window.TEAMS = [{"id":"6040","team":"McGill","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/mcgill/","rank":14,"awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"LanTurn","projectTitle_zh":"LanTurn","tagline":"Lanmodulin displayed on yeast, harvested by light-triggered flocculation, deployed on-site as a tolling service for mine tailings","tagline_zh":"將 lanmodulin 展示於酵母表面，以光觸發絮凝收集菌體，並以現場代工服務的形式部署於礦場尾礦","summary":"McGill engineered Saccharomyces cerevisiae EBY100 to display lanmodulin variants on its surface via the Aga1-Aga2 system for selective rare-earth binding, and to flocculate on command through a blue-light VP16-EL222 / C120 optogenetic circuit driving a truncated 678FLO1 flocculin, so that REE-loaded cells can be separated by gravity settling instead of centrifugation. Light-induced flocculation reached 66-75 percent against 24-25 percent in dark controls, and LanM surface display was confirmed by flow cytometry and confocal microscopy. The commercial case is a full industrial techno-economic analysis rather than a canvas: gate-to-gate CAPEX and OPEX, a unit cost of $11.83-20.58 USD per kg REO, a full-scale NPV case study on the Ashram tailings in Nunavik, Quebec, and seven separate sensitivity analyses. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship (Undergrad) and Best Biomanufacturing.","summary_zh":"McGill 改造 Saccharomyces cerevisiae EBY100，透過 Aga1-Aga2 系統將 lanmodulin 變異體展示於細胞表面以選擇性結合稀土元素，並以藍光 VP16-EL222 / C120 光遺傳學迴路驅動截短的 678FLO1 絮凝素，使細胞可依指令絮凝，讓吸附稀土的細胞以重力沉降取代離心分離。光誘導絮凝達 66-75%，暗處對照組為 24-25%；LanM 表面展示則以流式細胞術與共軛焦顯微術確認。其商業論證是完整的工業級技術經濟分析，而不是一張商業模式圖：涵蓋 gate-to-gate 的資本支出與營運支出、每公斤 REO 11.83-20.58 美元的單位成本、以魁北克 Nunavik 的 Ashram 尾礦為對象的全規模 NPV 個案研究，以及七項獨立的敏感度分析。他們入圍 Best Entrepreneurship（大學部）與 Best Biomanufacturing。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6040/wiki/entrep-page/tab-2/pt-financial-analysis.avif","caption":"Financial analysis of the Ashram tailings re-mining case study, giving USD 51M NPV over 15 years in the high-uptake scenario against a marginally negative NPV in the low-uptake case","caption_zh":"Ashram 尾礦再開採個案研究的財務分析：高採用情境下 15 年 NPV 為 5,100 萬美元，低採用情境則略為負值","credit":"Team McGill, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6041","team":"UOregon","section":"Overgrad","country":"United States","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uoregon/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Education — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳教育 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"AquaFlock","projectTitle_zh":"AquaFlock","tagline":"E. coli engineered to sequester groundwater nitrate as cyanophycin, then flocculate so the nitrogen can be harvested back as fertilizer","tagline_zh":"改造 E. coli 將地下水中的硝酸鹽固定為氮儲存聚合物 cyanophycin，再誘導細胞絮凝沉降，使氮得以回收作為肥料","summary":"UOregon engineered E. coli to pull excess environmental nitrate into the nitrogen storage polymer cyanophycin and, once a cyanophycin threshold is reached, to express flocculation proteins so cells sink and can be harvested as a fertilizer substitute, closing the nitrogen loop. The target users are rural well owners and farmers in Oregon whose water is rarely tested. The education practice is the standout: three original curricula built for three audiences with increasing prior knowledge, developed through an explicit Design-Build-Test-Learn loop and grounded in Universal Design for Learning plus STEAM. The team also built an offline desktop search engine indexing the full text of 1,354 iGEM team wikis and 20,761 pages from 2022-2025.","summary_zh":"UOregon 改造 E. coli，把環境中過量的硝酸鹽轉入氮儲存聚合物 cyanophycin，並在 cyanophycin 累積達到閾值後表現絮凝蛋白，使細胞沉降、可被收取作為肥料替代品，藉此閉合氮循環。目標使用者是奧勒岡州水質少有檢測的鄉村水井持有者與農民。最突出的是教育實踐：針對先備知識遞增的三種受眾，自行開發三套原創課程，以明確的 Design-Build-Test-Learn 迴圈迭代，並以通用學習設計（UDL）與 STEAM 為基礎。團隊另外做了一套離線桌面搜尋引擎，索引 2022-2025 年 1,354 個 iGEM 隊伍 wiki、共 20,761 個頁面的全文。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6041/wiki/pages/education/edu-wksp1-main-photo.avif","caption":"Workshop 1: one-hour intro to synthetic biology for 30 high school students at the Oregon Humane Society camp","credit":"Team UOregon, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"第一場工作坊：為奧勒岡人道協會營隊 30 位高中生舉辦的一小時合成生物學入門"}]},{"id":"6043","team":"Vilnius-Lithuania","section":"Undergrad","country":"Lithuania","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/vilnius-lithuania/","rank":21,"awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Software — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳軟體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"BMClick: One Shell to Click Them All","projectTitle_zh":"BMClick：一殼點擊萬物","tagline":"Bacterial microcompartment shells rebuilt outside the cell and made programmable by click chemistry, plus Ladder Detector, which annotates a gel in about a minute.","tagline_zh":"把細菌微區室外殼在細胞外重建，並以點擊化學使其表面可程式化；另有 Ladder Detector，約一分鐘標註完一張電泳膠影像。","summary":"BMClick rebuilds bacterial microcompartments (BMCs), the proteinaceous shells bacteria use to sequester metabolic reactions, in vitro and makes their surface programmable through click chemistry at an amber-codon-incorporated non-canonical amino acid, turning a natural containment system into a modular platform for working with purified biomolecules. The aim is to recover the organisation a cell provides, protecting therapeutic nucleic acids from nucleases, separating the steps of a reconstructed pathway, and extending the temperature and pH range over which enzymes work, while keeping the precision of in vitro conditions. The project also produced functional macroscopic materials from BMC-T shell proteins, and in vitro encapsulation was demonstrated with a HiBiT-SpyCatcher cargo and confirmed by cryo-EM. The dry-lab deliverable is Ladder Detector, a React + FastAPI web app that segments bands in a gel photograph using GelGenie's released U-Net models and then identifies which commercial ladder was run in the marker lane, a step no existing tool automated.","summary_zh":"BMClick 在體外重建細菌微區室（BMC）——細菌用來區隔代謝反應的蛋白質外殼——並透過在以 amber 密碼子嵌入的非天然胺基酸上進行點擊化學，使外殼表面可程式化，把一套天然的包覆系統變成處理純化生物分子的模組化平台。目標是重現細胞所提供的組織性：保護治療用核酸不被核酸酶分解、分隔重建路徑中的各個步驟、擴大酵素可作用的溫度與 pH 範圍，同時保有體外條件的精確性。團隊也用 BMC-T 外殼蛋白做出具功能的巨觀材料，並以 HiBiT-SpyCatcher 載物示範體外包覆，再由 cryo-EM 確認。乾實驗的產出是 Ladder Detector：一個 React + FastAPI 網頁應用程式，先用 GelGenie 已釋出的 U-Net 模型分割電泳膠照片中的條帶，再判定標記道跑的是哪一種市售分子量標準品（ladder）——這一步是現有工具都沒有自動化的。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6043/wiki/software-images/original-photo-vs-result-2.avif","caption":"The original gel electrophoresis photograph next to Ladder Detector's automatically annotated result.","caption_zh":"原始的膠體電泳照片，與 Ladder Detector 自動標註後的結果並列。","credit":"Team Vilnius-Lithuania, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6045","team":"UNILausanne","section":"Overgrad","country":"Switzerland","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/unilausanne/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"ASTACi: Detect, Disarm, Defend","projectTitle_zh":"ASTACi：偵測、解除、防禦","tagline":"A field-deployable LAMP assay for the crayfish plague pathogen, a sub-CHF-10 open-source incubator to run it, and an ecological model that decided which treatment strategy to pursue.","tagline_zh":"一套可現地部署、用於偵測螯蝦瘟病原的 LAMP 檢測法，一台成本低於 10 CHF 的開源恆溫加熱裝置來執行它，以及一個生態模型來決定該採取哪一套處理策略。","summary":"UNILausanne addressed crayfish plague, caused by the oomycete Aphanomyces astaci, with three complementary strategies: detect the pathogen in water with loop-mediated isothermal amplification, disarm the invasive signal crayfish that carries it using RNAi, and defend native crayfish with a protective protein supplement. The measurement work asks whether the LAMP assay is specific enough to separate A. astaci from the closely related A. frigidophilus, sensitive enough to be useful, and robust enough to survive real lake and river water. The hardware is C.L.A.W., a hand-sized USB-powered incubator built with the original author of the MobileLAMP design, fully open-source at under CHF 10 per unit. A stochastic two-species population model was validated against a documented field case and then used to decide how to split effort between the disarm and defend strategies.","summary_zh":"UNILausanne 以三項互補策略處理由卵菌 Aphanomyces astaci 引起的螯蝦瘟：以迴圈介導等溫擴增（LAMP）偵測水中的病原、以 RNAi 解除攜帶病原的入侵種訊號螯蝦的威脅，並以具保護作用的蛋白質補充劑防禦原生螯蝦。量測工作所問的問題是：這套 LAMP 檢測是否專一到足以把 A. astaci 與近緣的 A. frigidophilus 區分開來、是否靈敏到足以實用，以及是否穩健到能承受真實的湖水與河水。硬體是 C.L.A.W.，一台手掌大小、以 USB 供電的恆溫加熱裝置，與 MobileLAMP 設計的原作者共同打造，完全開源且單台成本低於 10 CHF。一個隨機性的雙物種族群模型先以一個有文獻紀錄的野外案例驗證，再用來決定該如何在「解除」與「防禦」兩項策略之間分配資源。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6045/wiki/hardware/frame-023.webp","caption":"C.L.A.W. (Compact LAMP ASTACi Water-incubator), the team's hand-sized, USB-powered LAMP incubator. It is fully open-source, built from off-the-shelf and 3D-printed parts for under CHF 10 per device.","caption_zh":"C.L.A.W.（Compact LAMP ASTACi Water-incubator），團隊自製的手掌大小、USB 供電 LAMP 恆溫加熱裝置。完全開源，以市售零件與 3D 列印件組成，單台成本低於 10 CHF。","credit":"Team UNILausanne, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6053","team":"HKSSC","section":"High School","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Food & Nutrition","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hkssc/","rank":110,"awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best New Basic Part — Winner (High School)","Best Education — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳新基礎元件 — 得主（高中組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / Art & Design）"],"projectTitle":"Engineering E. coli to express prbA, a paraben-degrading esterase, as a pre-treatment for food waste recycling","projectTitle_zh":"改造 E. coli 表現除對羥基苯甲酸酯的酯酶 prbA，作為廚餘回收的前處理步驟","tagline":"If preservatives are designed to stop microbes, can we design microbes to stop preservatives?","tagline_zh":"既然防腐劑的設計目的是抑制微生物，我們能不能設計微生物來分解防腐劑？","summary":"HKSSC (St. Stephen's College, Hong Kong) noticed a bottleneck nobody was talking about: Hong Kong's O-PARK organic resources recovery centre runs anaerobic digestion on food waste, but the chemical preservatives already in that waste inhibit the very microbes doing the digesting. They cloned prbA, a paraben esterase from Enterobacter cloacae that hydrolyses parabens to 4-hydroxybenzoic acid and needs no complex cofactors, into pET22b+ under a T7 promoter with a pelB signal peptide directing it to the periplasm, then characterised it with CFU-based MIC assays, a pNPA esterase assay and HPLC. They won Best New Basic Part at high school level largely on the strength of the prbA part family - including the previously unregistered native promoter and RBS, which they located in silico with BPROM and then built into a promoterless GFP reporter construct. The dry lab and statistics are the standout: structure-guided mutant design in HotSpot Wizard on an AlphaFold model, and a Michaelis-Menten kinetic analysis defended with two-way ANOVA, a Brown-Forsythe Levene variance check and Welch-Satterthwaite contrasts with Holm correction.","summary_zh":"HKSSC（香港聖士提反書院）注意到一個少有人談的瓶頸：香港 O-PARK 有機資源回收中心以厭氧消化處理廚餘，但廚餘中既有的化學防腐劑會抑制負責消化的微生物本身。他們將 prbA（來自 Enterobacter cloacae 的對羥基苯甲酸酯酯酶，可將 paraben 水解為 4-hydroxybenzoic acid，且不需複雜輔因子）選殖進 pET22b+，置於 T7 啟動子下，並以 pelB 訊號肽導向周質空間，再以 CFU 為基礎的 MIC 試驗、pNPA 酯酶活性試驗與 HPLC 進行特性分析。他們以 prbA 元件家族的實力拿下高中組最佳新基礎元件獎——其中包括此前未註冊的天然啟動子與 RBS，團隊先用 BPROM 以電腦預測其位置，再建成無啟動子的 GFP 報告基因構築。乾實驗與統計是全隊亮點：以 AlphaFold 模型在 HotSpot Wizard 中進行結構導向的突變體設計，以及一套以雙因子 ANOVA、Brown-Forsythe（基於中位數的 Levene）變異數檢定與經 Holm 校正的 Welch-Satterthwaite 對比加以支撐的 Michaelis-Menten 動力學分析。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6053/wiki/modelling/image1.avif","caption":"The prbA paraben esterase structure retrieved from AlphaFold and visualised in UCSF Chimera; the long flexible N-terminal tail matches the 31-residue signal peptide and justified switching to pelB periplasmic targeting.","caption_zh":"取自 AlphaFold、並以 UCSF Chimera 視覺化的 prbA 對羥基苯甲酸酯酯酶結構；長而柔軟的 N 端尾巴與 31 個殘基的訊號肽相符，成為改用 pelB 周質導向的依據。","credit":"Team HKSSC, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6054","team":"SJTU-BioX-Shanghai","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/sjtu-biox-shanghai/","rank":7,"awards":["Inclusivity Award — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["包容性獎 — 入圍（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"Dual-Armor","projectTitle_zh":"Dual-Armor（雙重護甲）","tagline":"An engineered living dressing that breaks open wound biofilm, clears pathogens and supports tissue repair in chronic wounds","tagline_zh":"一種工程化活體敷料，能破壞傷口生物膜、清除病原菌，並支持慢性傷口的組織修復","summary":"SJTU-BioX-Shanghai built Dual-Armor, an engineered-microbe dressing for chronic wounds, targeting the biofilm that a meta-analysis of 2,666 chronic wounds found in 68% of cases; about 18.6 million people develop diabetic foot ulcers each year and roughly 65% recur within five years. The team's inclusivity work is the most systematically theorised of the 2026 cohort: they built a two-layer framework in which four dimensions (VOICE, OPPORTUNITY, ACCESSIBILITY, PARTICIPATION) locate where participation is blocked and a five-step pathway, HEALS (Hear, Examine, Act, Learn, Share), governs how each barrier is answered. Twelve activities are each written up against both layers, and patient input visibly changed the product: Dual-Armor was repositioned from a stand-alone treatment to an auxiliary post-debridement dressing, and patients' fear of live bacteria touching the wound drove the physical-containment hardware design.","summary_zh":"SJTU-BioX-Shanghai 做出 Dual-Armor，一款用於慢性傷口的工程菌敷料，針對的是生物膜——一項涵蓋 2,666 例慢性傷口的統合分析發現其中 68% 有生物膜；每年約有 1,860 萬人罹患糖尿病足潰瘍，約 65% 在五年內復發。該隊的包容性工作是 2026 年各隊中理論化最系統的：他們建立了一個雙層架構，以四個面向（VOICE、OPPORTUNITY、ACCESSIBILITY、PARTICIPATION）定位參與在哪裡受阻，並以五步路徑 HEALS（Hear、Examine、Act、Learn、Share）規範每一道障礙如何被回應。十二項活動都分別對照兩個層次寫成紀錄，病人的意見也明顯改變了產品：Dual-Armor 從獨立療法重新定位為清創後的輔助敷料，而病人對活菌接觸傷口的恐懼促成了實體圍阻硬體的設計。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6054/wiki/images/inclusivity/braille-1.avif","caption":"'Touch Life, See Hope': writing chronic-wound knowledge onto braille postcards, with an open English toolkit released so others can run it","caption_zh":"「Touch Life, See Hope」：把慢性傷口知識寫上點字明信片，並釋出開放的英文工具包讓別人也能照著辦","credit":"Team SJTU-BioX-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6058","team":"HK-Joint-School","section":"High School","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Manufacturing / Environment","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hk-joint-school/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Software — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"FlaminGone","projectTitle_zh":"FlaminGone","tagline":"A non-toxic biological fire-retardant coating, plus PyroForge, a live protein-language-model web app that predicts thermostability from sequence alone.","tagline_zh":"無毒的生物性防火塗層，外加 PyroForge：一個已上線的蛋白質語言模型網頁應用，僅憑序列就能預測熱穩定性。","summary":"FlaminGone replaces halogenated chemical fire retardants with a self-assembling biological coating: E. coli's CsgA curli subunit forms an amyloid scaffold, fused to hydrophobic BslA for weatherproofing and polyethylene-binding peptides for substrate anchoring, in a two-layer system that sidesteps secretion limits and steric hindrance. Under fire testing the matrix forms a dense char shield that halts flame propagation and self-extinguishes, BslA prevents rain washout across weathering, and Arabidopsis assays indicated no ecotoxicity. To design the fusion peptides without waiting on crystal structures, the team built PyroForge, a publicly deployed web application that uses a frozen ESM-2 650M protein language model as a feature extractor under three lightweight custom-trained heads predicting melting temperature, folding free energy and per-mutation stability change, then scans every single-residue substitution and returns a ranked shortlist. For a high school team the engineering rigour is remarkable: a published S669 benchmark against 21 competing methods, Zenodo-archived weights and datasets with DOIs, 226-respondent user acceptance testing, and documented bugs that changed the model's reported accuracy.","summary_zh":"FlaminGone 以能自組裝的生物塗層取代含鹵素的化學阻燃劑：用 E. coli 的 CsgA curli 次單元形成類澱粉蛋白支架，融合疏水性的 BslA 以提供耐候能力、以及聚乙烯結合胜肽以錨定在基材上，並採用雙層設計繞開分泌量上限與立體障礙的問題。火燒測試中，這個基質會形成緻密的碳化屏障，阻止火焰延燒並自行熄滅；BslA 在耐候測試中可防止被雨水沖掉；Arabidopsis 試驗也顯示沒有生態毒性。為了不必等晶體結構就能設計融合胜肽，團隊做了 PyroForge：一個已公開部署的網頁應用，把凍結參數的 ESM-2 650M 蛋白質語言模型當作特徵擷取器，上面接三個自行訓練的輕量預測頭，分別預測熔解溫度、摺疊自由能與各突變造成的穩定性變化，接著掃描每一個單一殘基取代並回傳排序後的候選清單。以高中隊伍而言，其工程嚴謹度相當突出：公開與 21 種競爭方法對比的 S669 基準測試、在 Zenodo 上以 DOI 典藏的權重與資料集、226 人參與的使用者接受度測試，以及把改變了模型回報準確度的程式錯誤完整記錄下來。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6058/wiki/software/system-archi.avif","caption":"PyroForge system architecture: Nginx reverse proxy as the only public surface, with FastAPI, Redis and three purpose-separated Celery queues (fast, heavy, io) isolated on the internal Docker network.","caption_zh":"PyroForge 的系統架構：Nginx 反向代理是唯一對外開放的介面，FastAPI、Redis 與三條依用途區分的 Celery 佇列（fast、heavy、io）都隔離在內部 Docker 網路中。","credit":"Team HK-Joint-School, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6060","team":"DTU-Denmark","section":"Overgrad","country":"Denmark","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/dtu-denmark/","rank":47,"awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"Enzymatic degradation of wind turbine blade epoxy","projectTitle_zh":"風力機葉片環氧樹脂的酵素降解","tagline":"A chemo-enzymatic route to the resin fraction of decommissioned wind turbine blades, assessed honestly against the alternatives","tagline_zh":"針對退役風力機葉片中樹脂部分的化學—酵素複合路線，並誠實地與其他替代方案比較","summary":"DTU engineered laccases (ItL-03 from a spruce bark beetle gut metagenome, CueO variants and homologues) and unspecific peroxygenases (PaDa-I, WamPa, PabUPO-II, MroUPO, Fett) to attack the amine crosslinks of cured epoxy from wind turbine blades, layered on top of a published acid-plus-peroxide solvolysis pretreatment. They used NNBT, a small water-soluble molecule carrying the tertiary amine of the crosslink, as a defined model substrate, and showed by MALDI-TOF that PaDa-I performs N-dealkylation on it with Purpald confirmation of lactaldehyde release. The decisive work is a prospective comparative life-cycle assessment in SimaPro (ReCiPe 2016 Midpoint H) of five end-of-life routes, which found their own enzymatic route is NOT the best option on almost any indicator - and they published that. Seven interviews across DTU Wind, DTU Sustain, DTU Chemistry, SDU and industry, plus documented non-responses from Siemens Gamesa, Orsted and MAKEEN Energy, drove changes to the chemical target, the model substrate, the host organism, the enzyme-ranking criterion and the project's stated goal.","summary_zh":"DTU 改造了漆酶（來自雲杉樹皮甲蟲腸道總體基因組的 ItL-03、CueO 變異體與同源蛋白）與非專一性過氧合酶（PaDa-I、WamPa、PabUPO-II、MroUPO、Fett），用來攻擊風力機葉片已固化環氧樹脂中的胺類交聯，並疊加在一篇已發表的酸加過氧化氫溶劑分解前處理之上。他們以 NNBT 這個帶有交聯點三級胺、可溶於水的小分子作為定義明確的模型底物，並以 MALDI-TOF 顯示 PaDa-I 對其進行 N-脫烷基反應，再以 Purpald 確認乳醛的釋出。真正關鍵的工作是在 SimaPro 中（ReCiPe 2016 Midpoint H）對五種生命終期路線所做的前瞻式比較生命週期評估，結果發現他們自己的酵素路線在幾乎每一項指標上都不是最佳選項——而他們把這個結果公開了。橫跨 DTU Wind、DTU Sustain、DTU Chemistry、SDU 與產業界的七場訪談，加上 Siemens Gamesa、Orsted 與 MAKEEN Energy 無回應的完整記錄，促使他們更動了化學標的、模型底物、宿主生物、酵素排序標準，以及專案本身所宣稱的目標。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6060/wiki/human-practices/stakeholder-photos/javier.webp","caption":"Javier, postdoc at DTU Sustain working on resin chemistry, whose question about whether an enzyme could replace the cleaving solvent reframed the whole project as a complement to solvolysis","credit":"Team DTU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Javier，DTU Sustain 從事樹脂化學研究的博士後，他關於酵素能否取代裂解溶劑的問題，讓整個專案重新定位為溶劑分解的補充"}]},{"id":"6064","team":"DKU","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Software & AI","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/dku/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Software & AI Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體與 AI專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"PeptiCraft","projectTitle_zh":"PeptiCraft","tagline":"An AI-assisted platform that turns a product brief into a traceable shortlist of recombinant fusion-protein candidates for skincare and medical aesthetics.","tagline_zh":"以 AI 輔助的平台，可將產品需求說明轉換為一份可追溯的重組融合蛋白候選清單，應用於保養品與醫學美容。","summary":"PeptiCraft addresses a specific physical problem: a free 10-30 residue bioactive peptide has essentially no structural stability, is degraded quickly by proteases, cannot be cast or gelled into a material, and diffuses away from where it is needed. The team's hypothesis is that such a peptide can be rescued by gene-fusing it to a structural scaffold, here a 364-residue recombinant Bombyx mori silk fibroin (FibLNT8-10xRep-FibHCT) chosen because its mechanical behaviour comes from sequence repeats rather than a folded globular core and therefore survives editing. The dry lab streamed 849,416,450 published protein sequences, kept the 19.9 million that are 3-30 standard residues, and ran them down an eight-round funnel to 496 assembled constructs across four functional directions, with a 99.9975% overall rejection rate. Three antioxidant candidates and a scaffold-only control were then expressed in E. coli and assayed: Top1 roughly doubled the scaffold's radical-scavenging capacity (TEAC 0.375 vs 0.195 mmol TE/g, p = 0.0075), no construct was cytotoxic to human keratinocytes, and no construct significantly protected cells against oxidative stress.","summary_zh":"PeptiCraft 針對一個具體的物理問題：游離的 10-30 個殘基生物活性胜肽幾乎沒有結構穩定性，會被蛋白酶快速降解，無法被澆鑄或膠化成材料，而且會從需要它的位置擴散離開。團隊的假設是，這類胜肽可藉由基因融合接上結構性支架而獲得補救；此處採用 364 個殘基的重組 Bombyx mori 絲蛋白（FibLNT8-10xRep-FibHCT），選它是因為其力學表現來自序列重複單元而非摺疊的球狀核心，因此能承受序列改動。乾實驗以串流方式處理 849,416,450 條已發表蛋白質序列，保留其中長度為 3-30 個標準殘基的 1,990 萬條，再讓它們通過八輪漏斗式篩選，最終在四個功能方向上得到 496 個組裝完成的構築體，整體淘汰率為 99.9975%。隨後在 E. coli 中表現三個抗氧化候選物與一個僅含支架的對照並進行檢測：Top1 的自由基清除能力約為支架的兩倍（TEAC 0.375 對 0.195 mmol TE/g，p = 0.0075）；所有構築體對人類角質細胞皆無細胞毒性；也沒有任何構築體能顯著保護細胞免於氧化壓力。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6064/wiki/project-20261020/image8.avif","caption":"PeptiCraft's library page safety panel, which resolves to four verdicts (clear, exceeded, borderline, not assessed) so an unmeasured gate can never be read as a passed one.","caption_zh":"PeptiCraft 序列庫頁面的安全性面板，給出四種判定（通過、超標、臨界、未評估），使未經測量的關卡絕不會被誤讀為已通過。","credit":"Team DKU, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6072","team":"GEMS-Taiwan","section":"High School","country":"Taiwan","village":"Space, Foundational Advance, Software & AI, Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/gems-taiwan/","rank":169,"awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Measurement — Winner (High School)","Best Hardware — Winner (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Winner (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳量測 — 得主（高中組）","最佳硬體 — 得主（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"projectTitle":"ReLEAF","projectTitle_zh":"ReLEAF","tagline":"A stress-responsive optogenetic bioreactor that predicts crop stress from field sensors and forecasts, then uses green light to make plant-protective proteins on the farm.","tagline_zh":"一套逆境響應式的光遺傳學生物反應器：先由田間感測器與氣象預報推估作物逆境，再以綠光在農場端生產保護植物的蛋白質。","summary":"ReLEAF closes a loop: field sensors and weather forecasts feed a stress-index model, the model sets a green-light dose, green light drives the cyanobacterial CcaSR two-component system in Bacillus subtilis WB800, and the cells secrete ACC deaminase into a hollow-fiber perfusion bioreactor that lets protein out and keeps cells in. The unit is about 40 x 24 x 62 cm, designed to stand beside a Taiwanese smallholder paddy where the average agricultural manager is 63.8 years old and precision agriculture is otherwise out of reach. It swept the high-school technical awards (Measurement, Hardware, Integrated Human Practices) largely on provenance discipline: four self-built devices with release build manuals, a digital twin that caught a failing photometer 26.7 hours before it died, a pre-registered growth forecast scored against a later run, and an input ledger that marks every number as measured, cited or modelled. Its distinguishing quality is honesty — the wiki repeatedly withdraws its own claims, and that is also where its dry-lab weaknesses are visible.","summary_zh":"ReLEAF 把整件事做成一個閉環：田間感測器與氣象預報餵給逆境指數模型，模型決定綠光劑量，綠光驅動 Bacillus subtilis WB800 中來自藍綠菌的 CcaSR 雙組分系統，菌體再把 ACC deaminase 分泌到中空纖維灌流式生物反應器裡——蛋白質可以出去，菌留在裡面。整台機器約 40 x 24 x 62 cm，設計上就是要擺在台灣小農的稻田旁；台灣農業經營者平均年齡 63.8 歲，精準農業對他們本來遙不可及。這個專案幾乎囊括高中組的技術類獎項（Measurement、Hardware、Integrated Human Practices），主要靠的是來源標註的紀律：四台自製裝置都附有釋出版組裝手冊；數位孿生在光度計徹底失效前 26.7 小時就抓到它正在壞；一份預先登錄的生長預測被後來的實驗實際評分；還有一份輸入明細帳，把每個數字標明是自己量的、引用的，還是模型算的。它最特別的品質是誠實——wiki 一再撤回自己先前的主張，而這也正是乾實驗弱點看得見的地方。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6072/wiki/software/twin-screen-20261018-software.webp","caption":"The ReLEAF digital twin control screen on 18 October 2026, showing optical density, pH, four pressure traces and the pump and valve controls for a live bioreactor run on one page.","caption_zh":"2026 年 10 月 18 日的 ReLEAF 數位孿生控制畫面，在同一頁顯示即時生物反應器實驗的光密度、pH、四路壓力曲線以及泵與閥的控制。","credit":"Team GEMS-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6077","team":"UOttawa","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uottawa/","rank":110,"awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Alternative Platform — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳替代平台 — 得主（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"Nulfur","projectTitle_zh":"Nulfur","tagline":"Break bonds, not the fuel: engineered biodesulfurization as a polishing step for refractory sulfur in diesel.","tagline_zh":"斷鍵，而不是斷燃料：以工程化生物脫硫作為柴油中難脫除硫化物的精製步驟。","summary":"Nulfur rebuilds the four-enzyme 4S biodesulfurization pathway (DszA, DszB, DszC plus a flavin reductase) from Rhodococcus erythropolis inside Pseudomonas putida KT2440, targeting dibenzothiophene (DBT) — the refractory sulfur compound that conventional hydrodesulfurization struggles to remove without running at 300-400 C and 3-6 MPa. Rather than replacing hydrodesulfurization, the team reframed the project after industry consultation as a modular side-stream polishing step on diesel. The project won on the strength of its alternative chassis work: because P. putida is a non-model organism, the team built the missing toolkit from scratch (a Golden Gate-compatible broad-host-range vector, a measured four-promoter set, and a working heat-shock transformation protocol) and published it as a handbook for other teams. That platform contribution, paired with an unusually deep dry lab (COBRApy genome-scale modelling, a FoldX/ThermoMPNN protein engineering pipeline, and an agentic AI research platform called Cofactor), won Best Alternative Platform and Best Wiki and Best Bioremediation Project nominations.","summary_zh":"Nulfur 把源自 Rhodococcus erythropolis 的四酶 4S 生物脫硫途徑（DszA、DszB、DszC 加上一個黃素還原酶）重建於 Pseudomonas putida KT2440 之中，標的是二苯并噻吩（DBT），也就是傳統加氫脫硫必須在 300-400 C、3-6 MPa 條件下才勉強能處理的難脫除硫化物。團隊在與業界諮詢後，並未把專案定位為取代加氫脫硫，而是重新定義為柴油上的模組化側流精製步驟。本專案的獲獎實力來自替代底盤的工作：由於 P. putida 屬於非模式生物，團隊從零建立起原本缺乏的工具組（一個相容於 Golden Gate 的廣宿主範圍載體、一組經過量測的四啟動子系列，以及一套可用的熱休克轉型流程），並把它整理成供其他團隊使用的手冊。這項平台貢獻，搭配一個深度罕見的乾實驗（COBRApy 基因組尺度代謝模型、FoldX/ThermoMPNN 蛋白質工程流程，以及名為 Cofactor 的代理式 AI 研究平台），為團隊贏得 Best Alternative Platform，並入圍 Best Wiki 與 Best Bioremediation Project。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6077/wiki/dry-lab/protein-engineering/fig-3.svg","caption":"Predictor-agreement scatter for 437 scored DszB mutations: the shaded quadrant is where FoldX and ThermoMPNN both call a substitution stabilising, enlarged to label the five variants advanced to the wet lab.","caption_zh":"437 個評分過的 DszB 突變的預測器一致性散布圖：加底色的象限是 FoldX 與 ThermoMPNN 同時判定該取代具穩定化效果的區域，放大後標示出推進到濕實驗的五個變異體。","credit":"Team UOttawa, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6078","team":"UPF-Barcelona","section":"Undergrad","country":"Spain","village":"Food & Agriculture","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/upf-barcelona/","rank":26,"awards":["Best Software — Winner (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 得主（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"Vinesys","projectTitle_zh":"Vinesys","tagline":"Where the rain runs out, the roots hold on: engineering root-associated Bacillus subtilis to hold water around grapevine roots.","tagline_zh":"雨水用盡之處，根系仍然守住：改造根際共生的 Bacillus subtilis，把水留在葡萄藤根部周圍。","summary":"Vinesys engineers Bacillus subtilis to colonise the grapevine rhizosphere and overexpress gamma-PGA, a water-retaining biopolymer, plus ACC deaminase to trim the drought-stress hormone precursor ACC, forming a thin hydration shell where the bacterium attaches to the root. Drought is detected by a two-layer switch: an osmolarity-responsive promoter plus a salt-dependent intein (HutMCM2) that the team re-engineered in silico to splice at the roughly 600-725 mM intracellular K+ that B. subtilis actually reaches, rather than its native 1.5 M. The dry lab produced three distinct deliverables: RK4 solver, a standalone no-code genetic-circuit designer and simulator; a documented molecular-dynamics pipeline for tuning salt-dependent proteins; and iGEMforge, a Claude Code plugin of four research skills that they evaluated honestly and then declined to use for project decisions. Awards came for Software, Model and Education.","summary_zh":"Vinesys 改造 Bacillus subtilis，使其定殖於葡萄藤根際並過量表現保水生物聚合物 gamma-PGA，同時表現 ACC deaminase 以削減乾旱逆境荷爾蒙前驅物 ACC，在細菌附著於根部之處形成一層薄薄的保水殼。乾旱以雙層開關偵測：一個對滲透壓有反應的啟動子，加上一個依賴鹽濃度的內含肽（HutMCM2）；團隊以電腦重新改造該內含肽，使其在 B. subtilis 實際可達到的約 600-725 mM 胞內 K+ 濃度下進行剪接，而非其天然的 1.5 M。乾實驗產出三項明確的成果：RK4 solver，一套獨立、免寫程式的基因迴路設計與模擬工具；一條有完整文件的分子動力學流程，用於調校依賴鹽濃度的蛋白質；以及 iGEMforge，一個內含四項研究技能的 Claude Code 外掛——他們誠實地評估了它，然後決定不拿它來做專題決策。獲獎項目為軟體、模型與教育。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6078/wiki/dry-lab/software/figure6.avif","caption":"Screenshot of the RK4 solver editor with the biocontainment toxin-antitoxin circuit built from linked blocks.","caption_zh":"RK4 solver 編輯器的畫面截圖，圖中是以連結方塊搭建的生物圍堵毒素－抗毒素迴路。","credit":"Team UPF-Barcelona, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6089","team":"BAID-China","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/baid-china/","rank":7,"awards":["Inclusivity Award — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["包容性獎 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"Neurofilux","projectTitle_zh":"Neurofilux","tagline":"An AI-designed antibody sandwich assay for blood neurofilament light chain, for cheap non-invasive early screening of neurodegenerative disease","tagline_zh":"以 AI 設計抗體的血液神經絲輕鏈三明治免疫檢測，用於低成本、非侵入性的神經退化疾病早期篩檢","summary":"BAID-China built Neurofilux, a blood test for neurofilament light chain (NfL), a biomarker of neuronal damage that rises years before Alzheimer's or ALS symptoms appear but is currently detectable only by expensive, invasive or insufficiently sensitive methods. They expressed the NfL rod domain (residues 93-396) as antigen, used the generative model RFantibody to design candidate antibodies, screened them with a multi-objective scoring pipeline, validated eight candidates experimentally and found two pairs outperforming commercial antibodies in sandwich ELISA, then converted the validated antibodies into nanobodies for stability and cost. Their inclusivity work is organised around a self-defined 3A framework - Adaptation, Awareness, Accessibility - and centres on a tactile magnetic genetic-circuit kit for blind children, developed in two phases and donated to a school for the visually impaired.","summary_zh":"BAID-China 做出 Neurofilux，一項檢測血液中神經絲輕鏈（NfL）的檢驗。NfL 是神經元損傷的生物標記，在阿茲海默症或 ALS 症狀出現前數年就會上升，但目前只能靠昂貴、侵入性或靈敏度不足的方法偵測。他們表現 NfL 的 rod domain（第 93–396 號殘基）作為抗原，用生成式模型 RFantibody 設計候選抗體，以多目標評分流程篩選，實驗驗證八個候選，找出兩組在三明治 ELISA 中表現優於市售抗體的配對，再把已驗證的抗體轉換為奈米抗體以提升穩定性並降低成本。他們的包容性工作圍繞自訂的 3A 架構——Adaptation、Awareness、Accessibility——核心是一套給視障兒童的觸覺磁性基因迴路教具，分兩階段開發，最後捐贈給一所視障學校。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6089/wiki/5.avif","caption":"Workshop Activity One: participants navigate the team's own laboratory in a wheelchair and record the barriers they meet","caption_zh":"工作坊活動一：參與者坐輪椅通行該隊自己的實驗室，並記錄沿途遇到的障礙","credit":"Team BAID-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6090","team":"BOKU-Vienna","section":"Overgrad","country":"Austria","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/boku-vienna/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Education — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳教育 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"Algaeneering","projectTitle_zh":"Algaeneering","tagline":"Engineering the microalga Chlamydomonas reinhardtii into a vitamin C and folate factory to fight hidden hunger","tagline_zh":"把微藻 Chlamydomonas reinhardtii 改造成維生素 C 與葉酸工廠，對抗隱性飢餓","summary":"BOKU-Vienna overexpressed GGP (vitamin C) and GTPCHI plus ADCS (folate) in Chlamydomonas reinhardtii using Golden Gate Level 0/1/2 assembly, reaching a 4.5x increase in vitamin C in the GGP strain. The project was framed around hidden hunger, which affects an estimated two billion people, and was linked to UN SDGs 2, 3 and 12. Its education practice was built on an explicit didactic framework (the Didactic Triangle) and spanned four goals: sparking curiosity, classroom science, public dialogue and educational media. A genome-scale metabolic model was coupled to a calibrated bioreactor model and a nutritional impact model to translate lab titres into how many people a production plant could feed.","summary_zh":"BOKU-Vienna 以 Golden Gate Level 0/1/2 組裝，在 Chlamydomonas reinhardtii 中過表現 GGP（維生素 C）以及 GTPCHI 加 ADCS（葉酸），GGP 菌株的維生素 C 提高了 4.5 倍。專案以隱性飢餓為主軸，估計影響全球約 20 億人，並連結到聯合國永續發展目標 SDG 2、3 與 12。教育實踐建立在明確的教學框架（教學三角）之上，涵蓋四項目標：引發好奇、課堂科學、公眾對話與教育媒體。他們也把基因組尺度代謝模型接上經校正的生物反應器模型與營養影響模型，把實驗室效價換算成一座生產廠能餵養多少人。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6090/wiki/hp-and-education/kinderuni/kinderuni-02.avif","caption":"Children at the Children's University (KinderUNI) six-station synthetic biology booth in Vienna","caption_zh":"維也納兒童大學（KinderUNI）六站式合成生物學攤位上的孩子們","credit":"Team BOKU-Vienna, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6096","team":"XJTLU-China","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-china/","rank":66,"awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Model — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Education — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳模型 — 得主（大學組）","最佳教育 — 得主（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"dogmaOS — programming translation rhythm for soluble protein expression","projectTitle_zh":"dogmaOS — 以程式化的轉譯節奏提升可溶性蛋白質表現","tagline":"Design where and for how long the ribosome should pause, then re-engineer the host tRNA pool to make that pause possible.","tagline_zh":"設計核醣體該在哪裡、停多久，再重新改造宿主的 tRNA 庫讓這個停頓成為可能。","summary":"XJTLU-China asked whether soluble yield of hard-to-express recombinant proteins in E. coli can be improved by deliberately programming *where* translation slows down, rather than by maximising expression. Their dry-lab system catmaOS (Codon-Aware Translation Modeling and Analysis Operating System) chains four models: structural co-translational folding priority (M1), evolutionary conserved slow-codon evidence (M2), a five-layer translation-kinetics and ribosome-traffic engine with constrained Pareto selection (M3-A to M3-E), and host tRNA-pool intervention design (M4). The framework picked a single synonymous G-CSF design (W1-S) out of six candidates and an engineered BL21-AlaPro chassis, both of which went to the bench; Four-Leaf Clover RT-qPCR then measured the actual tRNA knockdown and that number was fed back into M3-A as an updated host context. It won Best Model (Undergraduate) and Best Education (Undergraduate).","summary_zh":"XJTLU-China 要問的是：在 E. coli 中難以表現的重組蛋白，其可溶產量能否透過刻意規劃轉譯*在哪裡*變慢來提升，而不是靠把表現量最大化。他們的乾實驗室系統 catmaOS（Codon-Aware Translation Modeling and Analysis Operating System）串接四個模型：結構上的共轉譯摺疊優先度（M1）、演化上保守的慢密碼子證據（M2）、含受限 Pareto 選擇的五層轉譯動力學與核醣體流量引擎（M3-A 至 M3-E），以及宿主 tRNA 庫的干預設計（M4）。這套框架從六個候選中挑出單一個同義密碼子設計（W1-S），以及一個工程化的 BL21-AlaPro 載體株，兩者都進了濕實驗室；接著以 Four-Leaf Clover RT-qPCR 量測實際的 tRNA 剔除程度，再把這個數字回饋進 M3-A 作為更新後的宿主情境。本專案獲得 Best Model（大學部）與 Best Education（大學部）。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6096/wiki/assets/drylab/model/figure-08.svg","caption":"Figure 8: exit-tunnel sensitivity heatmap. Rows are assumed ribosome exit-tunnel lengths of 30-40 codons, columns are G-CSF codon positions, and the fixed 0-100 teal scale shows structural priority. Light-grey cells mark genuinely unavailable structural data rather than a score of zero, so the reader can watch high-priority bands migrate as a modelling assumption changes.","credit":"Team XJTLU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"圖 8：出口通道敏感度熱圖。列為假設的核醣體出口通道長度 30-40 個密碼子，行為 G-CSF 的密碼子位置，固定的 0-100 藍綠色標尺表示結構優先度。淺灰色格子標示真正缺乏結構資料之處，而不是以零分充數，讓讀者看見高優先度帶隨著建模假設改變而遷移。"}]},{"id":"6098","team":"ICJFLS","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/icjfls/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"ORA-GUARD","projectTitle_zh":"ORA-GUARD","tagline":"An engineered oral probiotic that degrades the sulfur compounds causing halitosis instead of sterilising the mouth","tagline_zh":"一株工程改造的口腔益生菌，分解造成口臭的硫化合物，而不是把整個口腔消毒","summary":"ICJFLS engineered Streptococcus salivarius K12, a GRAS oral probiotic, to express a Sox enzyme cluster plus an MTO enzyme that catalytically degrade the volatile sulfur compounds (H2S, methanethiol, dimethyl sulfide) responsible for bad breath, positioning it as a Live Biotherapeutic Product rather than a mouthwash. Plasmid expression was abandoned after stability tests showed near-total plasmid loss within five days without selection, so the cassettes were moved into the chromosome by CRISPR-Cas9, and a four-layer biosafety system (D-alanine auxotrophy via alr knockout, a PcspA RNA-thermometer suicide switch, no antibiotic resistance markers) was added in direct response to public fear of live GMO bacteria. The entrepreneurship case is numerically specific, with per-dose cost, retail price, gross margin and a named contract manufacturer. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship in the High School section.","summary_zh":"ICJFLS 把 Streptococcus salivarius K12 這株列為 GRAS 的口腔益生菌加以工程改造，使其表現 Sox 酵素叢集與一個 MTO 酵素，以催化方式分解造成口臭的揮發性硫化物（H2S、甲硫醇、二甲基硫），並把產品定位為活體生物治療產品（LBP），而不是漱口水。質體表現在穩定性測試顯示沒有選擇壓力時五天內質體幾乎全部流失後便被放棄，改以 CRISPR-Cas9 把表現卡匣送進染色體；同時針對民眾對活體 GMO 細菌的恐懼，直接加上四層生物安全系統（以 alr 基因剔除造成的 D-丙胺酸營養缺陷、PcspA RNA 溫度計自殺開關、不使用抗生素抗性標記）。創業面的論證有具體數字：每劑成本、零售價、毛利率，以及指名的委外製造商。他們入圍高中組 Best Entrepreneurship。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6098/wiki/entrepre/fig-3-entrepre.avif","caption":"TAM, SAM and SOM analysis for ORA-GUARD, with the SOM built bottom-up from 100,000 target users at RMB 200 per month","caption_zh":"ORA-GUARD 的 TAM、SAM 與 SOM 分析，其中 SOM 由 100,000 名目標使用者、每人每月 RMB 200 自下而上建立","credit":"Team ICJFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6102","team":"ZJU-China","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/zju-china/","rank":14,"awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"NEST","projectTitle_zh":"NEST","tagline":"A sequence-defined SELP hydrogel with a SnoopTag2 plug socket, so one cartilage scaffold can be reconfigured by swapping functional peptides","tagline_zh":"一款序列明確定義的 SELP 水凝膠，搭配 SnoopTag2 插槽，因此同一個軟骨支架只要更換功能性胜肽就能重新配置","summary":"ZJU-China built NEST, a silk-elastin-like protein (SELP) hydrogel carrying SnoopTag2 as a standardised ligation interface, so that repair peptides (Link-N, a chondroitin-sulfate-retaining CPC module, a magnetically responsive anisotropy module, a mitochondrial delivery module) can be attached without redesigning the material. They engineered a SnoopLigase2-ZJU variant for the ligation chemistry, purified SELP by inverse transition cycling optimised to 65 degrees C in PBS with 2 M NaCl, and validated GAG binding by AviTag-BirA site-specific biotinylation onto streptavidin beads with DMMB quantification. The commercial case is a full process-economics build rather than a canvas, with equipment, land, working capital, medium, IPTG, kanamycin, labour by shift and waste volumes all costed, plus a 2026-2042 stage-gated roadmap and a ten-year discounted cash-flow model. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship (Undergrad) and Best Biomanufacturing.","summary_zh":"ZJU-China 打造了 NEST，一種帶有 SnoopTag2 作為標準化連接介面的絲蛋白-彈性蛋白樣蛋白（SELP）水凝膠，使修復用胜肽（Link-N、一個可保留硫酸軟骨素的 CPC 模組、一個具磁響應性的非等向性模組、一個粒線體遞送模組）能夠直接接上，而不必重新設計材料本身。團隊為這套連接化學改造出 SnoopLigase2-ZJU 變異體，以反相轉變循環純化 SELP 並將條件最佳化為含 2 M NaCl 的 PBS、65 度 C，並以 AviTag-BirA 位點專一性生物素化接到鏈黴親和素磁珠上、再以 DMMB 定量來驗證 GAG 結合。商業論證是一份完整的製程經濟模型，而不是一張商業模式圖：設備、土地、營運資金、培養基、IPTG、卡那黴素、按班別計算的人力與廢棄物量全部估算成本，另有 2026-2042 的階段關卡路線圖與一套十年折現現金流模型。團隊入圍 Best Entrepreneurship（大學部）與 Best Biomanufacturing。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6102/wiki/images/hp/entrepreneurship/003.avif","caption":"NEST development roadmap and milestones for R&D, manufacturing, regulatory affairs, fundraising and commercialisation, 2026-2042","caption_zh":"NEST 在研發、製造、法規事務、募資與商業化各方面的開發路線圖與里程碑，2026-2042","credit":"Team ZJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6105","team":"Mingdao","section":"High School","country":"Taiwan","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/mingdao/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Model — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"Waste-to-Watt — bioethanol from plastic-coated paper containers","projectTitle_zh":"Waste-to-Watt——以淋膜紙容器製造生質乙醇","tagline":"Turn the coffee cups and lunch boxes 7,000 students throw away every day into fuel, by pairing enzymes with a glucose-eating microbe in one pot.","tagline_zh":"把 7,000 名學生每天丟掉的咖啡杯與餐盒變成燃料：在同一個反應槽裡讓酵素與一株吃葡萄糖的微生物並肩工作。","summary":"Mingdao take used paper containers — coffee cups, lunch boxes, ramen bowls — and break their cellulose to glucose with an enzyme cocktail for fermentation to bioethanol. The obstacle is end-product inhibition: cellulase is inhibited by cellobiose and beta-glucosidase by glucose. Their answer is Simultaneous Saccharification and Fermentation, putting Zymomonas mobilis in the same vessel as a glucose sink so neither enzyme ever sees inhibitory product. Three models carry it: a Michaelis-Menten competitive-inhibition fit to their own pNPG assay data giving Km, Vmax and Ki for BglA at fermentation-compatible conditions; a Monod fit to their own Z. mobilis growth curves giving mu_max, Ks and biomass yield; and a coupled ODE in SciPy that feeds every one of those measured parameters into a closed-versus-open simulation of the real one-pot reactor. Every parameter in model three came from their own bench.","summary_zh":"Mingdao 收集用過的紙容器——咖啡杯、餐盒、泡麵碗——以酵素組合將其中的纖維素水解成葡萄糖，再發酵成生質乙醇。障礙在於產物抑制：纖維素酶受纖維二糖抑制，beta-葡萄糖苷酶則受葡萄糖抑制。他們的解法是同步糖化發酵，把 Zymomonas mobilis 放進同一個反應槽作為葡萄糖的消耗端，使兩種酵素都不會遇上抑制性產物。支撐整個專案的是三個模型：以自己的 pNPG 分析數據擬合 Michaelis-Menten 競爭型抑制方程，求出 BglA 在相容於發酵條件下的 Km、Vmax 與 Ki；以自己量測的 Z. mobilis 生長曲線擬合 Monod 方程，求出 mu_max、Ks 與生物量產率；最後以 SciPy 建立耦合 ODE，把上述每一個實測參數帶入真實單槽反應器的封閉對開放模擬。模型三中的每一個參數都出自他們自己的實驗檯。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6105/wiki/model2.avif","caption":"The Waste-to-Watt SSF fermentor: cellulase and beta-glucosidase saccharify paper-container cellulose to glucose while Zymomonas mobilis simultaneously ferments that glucose to bioethanol, so neither enzyme ever accumulates enough product to inhibit itself.","credit":"Team Mingdao, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Waste-to-Watt 的 SSF 發酵槽：纖維素酶與 beta-葡萄糖苷酶把紙容器纖維素糖化成葡萄糖，Zymomonas mobilis 同時把葡萄糖發酵成生質乙醇，因此兩種酵素都不會累積到足以自我抑制的產物量。"}]},{"id":"6108","team":"GU Frankfurt","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/gu-frankfurt/","rank":143,"awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Part Collection — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Software — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Education — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳元件集 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳軟體 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳教育 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳治療專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"HIDE","projectTitle_zh":"HIDE","tagline":"Hiding a transplanted organ from the immune system instead of suppressing the immune system","tagline_zh":"把移植器官藏起來不讓免疫系統看見，而不是去壓制免疫系統","summary":"Around 183,000 transplants a year are followed by lifelong immunosuppression, which protects the graft by weakening the whole patient. HIDE attacks the cause instead: a synNotch receptor carrying a computationally designed binder recognises the donor organ's mismatched HLA class I alleles, triggers production and export of shRNA in extracellular vesicles, and silences only those 'non-self' HLAs by RNA interference, leaving the rest of the immune system intact. Three research fields are bridged at once (synNotch, RNAi, exosome delivery), with the binder and the shRNA both designed in silico by the dry lab and validated by FACS, qPCR, western blot and nanoparticle tracking analysis. It won Best Part Collection and Best Education because the by-products are as usable as the therapy: HUSH, an open-source RNAi design framework for polymorphic gene families, and TRUST, a framework for communicating about death and grief that iGEM did not previously have.","summary_zh":"每年約有 183,000 例移植手術，術後隨之而來的是終身免疫抑制——為了保住移植物，卻削弱了整個病人。HIDE 改從病因下手：一個帶有以電腦設計的結合子（binder）的 synNotch 受體辨識捐贈器官上不相配的 HLA class I 等位基因，觸發 shRNA 的生產並以胞外囊泡輸出，再透過 RNA 干擾只沉默那些「非自體」的 HLA，其餘免疫系統維持完整。此專題一次串起三個研究領域（synNotch、RNAi、exosome 遞送），結合子與 shRNA 都由乾實驗以電腦設計，並以 FACS、qPCR、西方墨點法與奈米顆粒追蹤分析驗證。它拿下最佳元件集合與最佳教育獎，因為其副產物和療法本身一樣好用：HUSH，一套針對多型性基因家族的開源 RNAi 設計框架；以及 TRUST，一套談論死亡與哀傷的溝通框架，這是 iGEM 此前所沒有的。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6108/wiki/images/drylab/hush/hush-1-input-page.avif","caption":"HUSH step one: the target sequence to silence plus an optional panel of related alleles to spare, with live input inspection reporting molecule type, length, GC content and readiness, and warning when a GC-rich target may defeat the seed filter.","caption_zh":"HUSH 的第一步：輸入要沉默的標的序列，再加上一組可選的、要保留的相關等位基因序列；系統即時檢視輸入並回報分子類型、長度、GC 含量與是否就緒，並在 GC 含量高的標的可能使種子區過濾器失效時提出警示。","credit":"Team GU Frankfurt, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6110","team":"TU Delft","section":"Overgrad","country":"Netherlands","village":"Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-delft/","rank":289,"awards":["Grand Prize Winner (Overgrad)","Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["總冠軍（研究生組）","Top 10（研究生組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 得主（研究生組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"MOSAIC","projectTitle_zh":"MOSAIC","tagline":"A modular elastin-like polypeptide coating platform that lets one implant surface be tuned to the tissue, and the patient, it sits in.","tagline_zh":"一個模組化的類彈性蛋白多肽塗層平台，讓同一種植入物表面能依其所在的組織、以及病人本身來調整。","summary":"MOSAIC is a modular implant coating built from elastin-like polypeptides (ELPs) that can be swapped part by part so a single platform serves many implants and tissues. The team's insight is that an implant coating has to match the stiffness and biochemistry of its target tissue: tissue stiffness spans 0.1 kPa in brain to over 1 MPa in bone, while titanium is around 100 GPa, so a one-size coating gives cells the wrong signal. They built five linked models to steer design before the lab work - an XGBoost predictor of ELP transition temperature, coarse-grained molecular dynamics of the surface-tethered hydrogel, an omics pipeline turning transcriptomic and proteomic atlases into tissue-specific coating recipes, a SuperPro Designer scale-up of ELP manufacturing, and a life-cycle assessment of that process - and they ran Value Sensitive Design across 13 interviews so stakeholders shaped the construct while it could still change. It took the Overgrad Grand Prize along with Best Wiki, Best Integrated Human Practices and Best Biomanufacturing Project.","summary_zh":"MOSAIC 是一種以類彈性蛋白多肽（ELP）構成的模組化植入物塗層，可逐一替換部件，因此單一平台就能服務多種植入物與組織。該隊的洞見是：植入物塗層必須匹配目標組織的硬度與生化特性；組織硬度從腦部的 0.1 kPa 到骨骼的超過 1 MPa，而鈦約為 100 GPa，所以一體適用的塗層只會給細胞錯誤的訊號。他們建了五個互相銜接的模型，在進實驗室之前先引導設計——以 XGBoost 預測 ELP 轉變溫度、對表面接枝水膠做粗粒化分子動力學模擬、一條把轉錄體與蛋白體圖譜轉成組織專一塗層配方的體學流程、用 SuperPro Designer 做 ELP 生產的放大模擬，以及該製程的生命週期評估——並在 13 場訪談中貫徹價值敏感設計（Value Sensitive Design），讓利害關係人在構築體還能改的階段就參與塑形。本隊拿下 Overgrad 組總冠軍，同時獲得最佳 Wiki、最佳整合式人類實踐與最佳生物製造專案。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6110/wiki/software/workflow.avif","caption":"What the MOSAIC Designer takes over: from a researcher's amino acid sequence through part identification, codon scrambling, Golden Gate cut-site design and synthesis feasibility checks to order-ready library sequences.","caption_zh":"MOSAIC Designer 接手了哪些工作：從研究者的胺基酸序列，經過部件識別、密碼子打散、Golden Gate 切位設計與合成可行性檢查，一路到可直接下單的函式庫序列。","credit":"Team TU Delft, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6115","team":"BNDS-China","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/bnds-china/","rank":14,"awards":["Best Education — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳教育 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"OrbitColi","projectTitle_zh":"OrbitColi","tagline":"An AND-logic-gate engineered probiotic that senses oxidative stress in space and produces vitamin B2 and trehalose to protect astronauts","tagline_zh":"以 AND 邏輯閘設計的工程益生菌，在太空中感測氧化壓力並生產維生素 B2 與海藻糖來保護太空人","summary":"BNDS-China built OrbitColi, an engineered E. coli probiotic designed to sense oxidative conditions arising from cosmic radiation and microgravity and respond by producing vitamin B2 and trehalose, replacing fixed-dose supplements that degrade over multi-year missions. The scientific framing is quantitative: ISS crews receive 100-200 mSv per year against a 20 mSv occupational limit, and a three-year Mars round trip may accumulate 300-450 mSv. The team's distinguishing contribution is methodological: they invented and applied a five-step education framework, R.E.A.C.H. (Recognize, Experience, Apply, Communicate, Harvest), to every single outreach activity, with a pre-event diagnostic survey and a matched post-event survey, and they report their own failures against it. Integrated Human Practices used a parallel STAR framework (Scan, Test, Assemble, Reflect) across five cycles.","summary_zh":"BNDS-China 做了 OrbitColi，一株經改造的 E. coli 益生菌，設計用來感測宇宙輻射與微重力造成的氧化環境，並以生產維生素 B2 與海藻糖作為回應，取代在多年任務中會變質的固定劑量補充品。科學鋪陳是有數字的：國際太空站組員每年接受 100-200 mSv，職業曝露上限為 20 mSv，而三年的火星往返任務可能累積 300-450 mSv。團隊最具辨識度的貢獻在方法層面：他們自創並實際套用一套五步教育框架 R.E.A.C.H.（Recognize、Experience、Apply、Communicate、Harvest）到每一場推廣活動，搭配活動前的診斷性問卷與相對應的活動後問卷，而且會依這個框架回報自己哪裡做失敗了。整合式人類實踐則以平行的 STAR 框架（Scan、Test、Assemble、Reflect）跑了五個循環。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6115/wiki/edu/image20.webp","caption":"Kindergarten children with the BioBrick 'building block' constructs they assembled in small 'syndicates'","caption_zh":"幼兒園孩子與他們在「小聯盟」中組裝出來的 BioBrick 積木構築","credit":"Team BNDS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6119","team":"UMA Malaga","section":"Undergrad","country":"Spain","village":"Diagnostics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uma-malaga/","rank":21,"awards":["Best Alternative Platform — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Software — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Diagnostics Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳替代平台 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳軟體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳診斷專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"Frida","projectTitle_zh":"Frida","tagline":"A SHERLOCK-type LwCas13a screen for rare-disease variants, with Diana, a tool that takes a disease name all the way to a plate map.","tagline_zh":"一套用於罕見疾病變異的 SHERLOCK 型 LwCas13a 篩檢，並搭配 Diana——一個能從疾病名稱一路做到盤位圖的工具。","summary":"Frida uses CRISPR/LwCas13a (SHERLOCK-type collateral cleavage read as fluorescence) to screen for the mutations behind rare genetic diseases, with cystic fibrosis as the model disease and a tandem gRNA assembly system (Neith) for multiplexing. Because a single disease can have hundreds of pathogenic variants and each needs its own guide, the team built Diana (diana-grna-designer), a free MIT-licensed web app, command-line tool and F# library that goes from a disease name, OMIM number or MONDO id, through ClinVar's variant list, to ranked and scored guide RNAs, to an order-ready oligo list, to a combinatorial pooling plan and a decoder for the positive wells. The engineering is unusually disciplined for iGEM: 1,164 unit and component tests plus 75 Playwright browser tests, automated axe-core WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility scans of every page state, every dependency pinned and checksum-verified, and exports in GenBank, SBOL 3 and SBOL 2 that are read back by Biopython and pySBOL3 as part of the test suite. Most striking, the wet lab contradicted the software's central heuristic and the team published that: the synthetic-mismatch substitution rule did not discriminate alleles in the placements tried, so the rule became an option to compare rather than a promise.","summary_zh":"Frida 使用 CRISPR/LwCas13a（SHERLOCK 型的旁側切割，以螢光讀出）篩檢罕見遺傳疾病背後的突變，以囊狀纖維化作為模式疾病，並以串聯 gRNA 組裝系統（Neith）實現多重檢測。由於單一疾病可能有數百個致病變異、每個都需要自己的嚮導，團隊開發了 Diana（diana-grna-designer）——一個免費、採 MIT 授權的網頁應用程式、命令列工具與 F# 函式庫，能從疾病名稱、OMIM 編號或 MONDO id 出發，經過 ClinVar 的變異清單，產生排序並評分的嚮導 RNA、可直接下訂的寡核苷酸清單、組合式混樣（pooling）計畫，以及陽性孔位的解碼器。這個專案的工程紀律在 iGEM 中相當罕見：1,164 個單元與元件測試，加上 75 個 Playwright 瀏覽器測試、對每個頁面狀態自動執行 axe-core WCAG 2.2 AA 無障礙掃描、所有相依套件皆鎖定版本並驗證檢查碼，匯出的 GenBank、SBOL 3 與 SBOL 2 檔案還會在測試套件中由 Biopython 與 pySBOL3 讀回驗證。最醒目的是，濕實驗室推翻了軟體的核心啟發式規則，而團隊照實公開：在所嘗試的放置位置上，人工錯配取代規則並未能區分對偶基因，於是該規則從承諾降級為一個可供比較的選項。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6119/wiki/images/software/v6-07-builder-ranked-table.avif","caption":"Diana's ranked spacer table: GC score, homopolymers, off-targets, assembly compatibility badges, folding energy, unpaired spacer share, mismatches against the other allele and the relative score, with the seed underlined and the mutation in red.","credit":"Team UMA Malaga, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Diana 的 spacer 排序表：GC 分數、同聚物、脫靶數、組裝相容性標章、摺疊能量、spacer 未配對比例、與另一對偶基因的錯配數，以及相對分數；種子區以底線標示、突變以紅色呈現。"}]},{"id":"6122","team":"Cornell","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","village":"Fashion & Cosmetics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/cornell/","rank":155,"awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Hardware — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Fashion & Cosmetics Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳硬體 — 得主（大學組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 得主（大學組）","最佳時尚與美妝專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"Klothos","projectTitle_zh":"Klothos","tagline":"A smart bandage: engineered probiotics inside electrospun alginate nanofibers that release an anti-fibrotic peptide only where a wound is scarring badly.","tagline_zh":"一款智慧敷料：把工程改造的益生菌包在靜電紡絲的海藻酸鈉奈米纖維裡，只在傷口正走向嚴重疤痕化的地方釋放抗纖維化胜肽。","summary":"Every scar treatment on the market today starts after the scar has formed — silicone sheeting, intralesional steroid, laser and grafts are all passive or reactive, and none addresses fibrosis biology during the critical healing window. Klothos intervenes during healing instead: engineered bacteria secrete 810A, a 12-amino-acid peptide that binds the exposed C-terminal domain of CTGF (CCN2) and blocks fibroblast-to-myofibroblast activation, and expression is held behind a two-input AND gate built from the Pseudomonas syringae hrpR/hrpS/hrpL system so the peptide is only made when reactive oxygen species (via TrxC) and hypoxia (via Pfnr) are both present — the signature of unchecked remodelling. The bacteria are encapsulated in an alginate/PEO nanofiber matrix spun on a coaxial electrospinner the team designed and built themselves, because commercial instruments cost far more than an undergraduate team can reach. It won Best Hardware and Best Presentation on the strength of that open, flat-packable, interlock-protected electrospinner plus a modular 3D-printed coaxial spinneret adapter, and Best Fashion & Cosmetics on a project that is unusually complete end to end: 20-plus risk-rated commercialisation analysis, a six-phase FDA path, and a human practices programme built around people who actually live with scars.","summary_zh":"今天市面上每一種疤痕療法都是在疤痕形成之後才開始——矽膠片、病灶內類固醇注射、雷射與植皮，全都是被動或反應式的，沒有一種在癒合的關鍵時間窗內處理纖維化的生物學。Klothos 改在癒合過程中介入：工程改造的細菌分泌 810A，一段 12 個胺基酸的胜肽，會結合 CTGF（CCN2）暴露出來的 C 端結構域，阻斷纖維母細胞轉為肌纖維母細胞的活化；而其表現被關在一個以 Pseudomonas syringae 的 hrpR/hrpS/hrpL 系統建成的雙輸入 AND 邏輯閘之後，因此只有在活性氧（經 TrxC）與缺氧（經 Pfnr）同時存在時才會製造胜肽——那正是重塑失控的特徵。細菌被包覆在海藻酸鈉/PEO 奈米纖維基質中，而這層基質是用團隊自行設計並製作的同軸靜電紡絲機紡出來的，因為市售機器的價格遠超大學部團隊能負擔的範圍。他們憑著這台開源、可拆平收納、設有安全互鎖的靜電紡絲機，加上一個模組化的 3D 列印同軸噴絲頭轉接件，拿下 Best Hardware 與 Best Presentation；又以一個從頭到尾罕見完整的專案拿下 Best Fashion & Cosmetics：20 多項標定風險等級的商業化分析、一條六階段的 FDA 路徑，以及一套真正圍繞著帶著疤痕生活的人所建立的人類實踐計畫。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6122/wiki/modeling/productdev-14-spinning-viability-alginate-peo-classifier-map.avif","caption":"Predicted spinning viability across sodium alginate and PEO weight percentages, generated by Monte Carlo sampling over the viscosity, conductivity and surface tension models — the map behind the green/yellow/red readiness classifier that decides whether a formulation reaches the electrospinner.","caption_zh":"以蒙地卡羅取樣跑過黏度、導電度與表面張力模型後，預測出的海藻酸鈉與 PEO 重量百分比可紡性分佈——這張圖就是決定一個配方能不能上靜電紡絲機的綠/黃/紅就緒分類器背後的地圖。","credit":"Team Cornell, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6123","team":"BASIS-China","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/basis-china/","rank":33,"awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (High School)","Safety and Security Award — Winner (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（高中組）","安全與保安獎 — 得主（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"HEAL — Hairball Elimination and Lysis","projectTitle_zh":"HEAL — 毛球清除與分解","tagline":"Keratinases for cat hairballs, held inside the cat by a kill switch keyed to bile acid, with the containment claim measured against real sewage and soil concentrations","tagline_zh":"以角蛋白酶分解貓毛球，並用以膽酸為訊號的致死開關把菌限制在貓體內，圍堵主張則對照真實污水與土壤中的濃度加以檢驗","summary":"BASIS-China engineered E. coli to express keratinases and proteases (p-Ker, Protease 1, Protease 2, MGY1820, MGY4907) with thioredoxin and thioredoxin reductase as synergistic helpers and LGOX plus KatG as gut antioxidant modules, aimed at digesting cat hairballs. The safety engineering is the standout: a bile-acid-responsive suicide switch in which membrane sensors TcpH and CadC-TcpP activate the pCadBA promoter to produce the unstable CcdA antitoxin, while the stable CcdB toxin is expressed constitutively, so the cell survives only where bile acid is present. Four Anderson promoters (J23100, J23102, J23104, J23114) were built to tune CcdB strength, and the response threshold was measured at roughly 0.1-0.2 mM taurocholic acid, then compared against feline duodenal bile salts at 15-42 mM and against published sewage and soil bile-acid levels orders of magnitude below the threshold. They won the Safety and Security Award in the High School section and were nominated for Best New Basic Part.","summary_zh":"BASIS-China 改造 E. coli 表現角蛋白酶與蛋白酶（p-Ker、Protease 1、Protease 2、MGY1820、MGY4907），並以 thioredoxin 與 thioredoxin reductase 作為協同輔助、LGOX 與 KatG 作為腸道抗氧化模組，目標是分解貓的毛球。安全設計是最突出的部分：一個對膽酸有反應的自殺開關，由膜上感應蛋白 TcpH 與 CadC-TcpP 活化 pCadBA 啟動子，產生不穩定的 CcdA 抗毒素，而穩定的 CcdB 毒素則持續表現，因此細胞只能在有膽酸的環境中存活。團隊建構四個 Anderson 啟動子（J23100、J23102、J23104、J23114）來調整 CcdB 的強度，量得反應閾值約在 0.1-0.2 mM 牛膽酸，再與貓十二指腸膽鹽的 15-42 mM、以及文獻中低於該閾值數個數量級的污水與土壤膽酸濃度對照。他們獲得高中組的 Safety and Security Award，並入圍 Best New Basic Part。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6123/wiki/safety-20261021/switch-promoters.webp","caption":"Four Anderson promoter variants driving ccdB, built to tune toxin strength and find the suicide switch's operating window rather than ship a single construct","caption_zh":"驅動 ccdB 的四個 Anderson 啟動子變異體，目的是調整毒素強度、找出自殺開關的操作區間，而不是只交出單一構築體","credit":"Team BASIS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6124","team":"Madrid-UCM","section":"Undergrad","country":"Spain","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/madrid-ucm/","rank":21,"awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"rePhlow: A modular synthetic-biology platform for phosphorus capture and valorisation from industrial wastewater","projectTitle_zh":"rePhlow：一個用於從工業廢水中捕集並加值利用磷的模組化合成生物學平台","tagline":"Phosphorus should not reach nature as pollution, and it should not leave industry as waste.","tagline_zh":"磷不該以污染的形式進入自然，也不該以廢棄物的形式離開工業。","summary":"rePhlow intercepts phosphorus in a defined industrial wastewater stream rather than attempting to 'solve eutrophication'. An immobilised enzyme panel (phosphatases, phospholipases, phytase) releases phosphorus from organic and condensed fractions; engineered Pseudomonas putida KT2440 carrying heterologous ppk1 and the Accumulibacter Pst high-affinity transport system, with pitB/ppx/ppkB knocked out by CRISPR base editing, accumulates it as polyphosphate inside core-shell alginate-chitosan capsules; the recovered polyP then feeds a coupled PPK2/DHAK biocatalytic cascade producing dihydroxyacetone phosphate. The capsules sit in a basket-type rotating-bed bioreactor the team built themselves, with encapsulation doubling as the EU contained-use regulatory strategy. The project is explicitly framed as a two-sided business: paid to remove phosphorus, paid again for the phosphorus recovered.","summary_zh":"rePhlow 選擇在一條明確界定的工業廢水流中攔截磷，而不是試圖「解決優養化」。一組固定化酶（磷酸酶、磷脂酶、植酸酶）先把磷從有機態與縮合態組分中釋放出來；經改造的 Pseudomonas putida KT2440 帶有異源 ppk1 與 Accumulibacter 的 Pst 高親和性運輸系統，並以 CRISPR 鹼基編輯剔除 pitB/ppx/ppkB，在核殼式海藻酸鹽-幾丁聚醣膠囊內把磷累積成聚磷酸鹽；回收得到的 polyP 再送入 PPK2/DHAK 偶聯的生物催化串聯，生產磷酸二羥丙酮。這些膠囊放在團隊自行打造的籃式旋轉床生物反應器中，而包覆本身同時就是歐盟封閉使用（contained use）的法規策略。這個專案明確定位為一門雙邊收費的事業：除磷收一次錢，回收到的磷再收一次。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6124/wiki/assets/human-practices/travel-archive/bio-oils-01.webp","caption":"The Bio-Oils Huelva biodiesel plant, whose degumming effluent ranges became rePhlow's semi-synthetic test stream and later its first real sample.","caption_zh":"Bio-Oils Huelva 生質柴油廠，其脫膠廢水的數值範圍成為 rePhlow 的半合成測試水流，後來也成為第一個真實樣本的來源。","credit":"Team Madrid-UCM, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6125","team":"Squirrel-Beijing","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/squirrel-beijing/","rank":33,"awards":["Best New Composite Part — Winner (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Climate Crisis / Conservation / Bioremediation)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（Climate Crisis / 保育 / 生物復育）"],"projectTitle":"PNPeeker","projectTitle_zh":"PNPeeker","tagline":"A whole-cell sensor that reports the bioavailable fraction of p-nitrophenol in soil, paired with a five-enzyme pathway that destroys it and a cold-triggered suicide switch","tagline_zh":"一種全細胞感測器，可報告土壤中對硝基苯酚（p-nitrophenol）的生物可利用部分，並搭配一條將其分解的五酵素途徑與一組低溫觸發的自殺開關","summary":"Squirrel-Beijing targeted p-nitrophenol, a US EPA priority pollutant found in more than 32 percent of Chinese agricultural soils at 0.8-30.5 micrograms per gram in places, and attacked the measurement problem rather than just the pollutant: HPLC reports total concentration, but ecological risk depends on the bioavailable fraction, which only a living sensor can read. They engineered the PobR transcriptional regulator with its PpobA promoter into an RFP reporter circuit showing concentration-dependent response from 0.001 to 10 mg/L, reconstructed the five-enzyme hydroquinone pathway (pnpA, B, C, E, D) that converts pNP all the way to beta-ketoadipate, and achieved 87-95 percent pNP removal at 10-500 micrograms per litre within 24 hours. They won Best New Composite Part in the High School section and were nominated for Best Village Project.","summary_zh":"Squirrel-Beijing 針對對硝基苯酚（p-nitrophenol）。這是美國 EPA 列管的優先污染物，出現在超過 32% 的中國農業土壤中，部分地點濃度達每公克 0.8-30.5 微克。團隊處理的不只是污染物本身，而是量測問題：HPLC 報告的是總濃度，但生態風險取決於生物可利用的那一部分，而這只有活體感測器才讀得出來。他們把 PobR 轉錄調控因子與其 PpobA 啟動子構築成 RFP 報告迴路，在 0.001 至 10 mg/L 之間呈現濃度依賴性反應；重建了把 pNP 一路轉化為 beta-ketoadipate 的五酵素氫醌途徑（pnpA、B、C、E、D）；並在 10-500 微克每公升的初始濃度下，於 24 小時內達成 87-95% 的 pNP 去除率。他們在 High School 組別獲得 Best New Composite Part 獎，並獲 Best Village Project 提名。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6125/wiki/contribution/img1.avif","caption":"Supplementary characterisation of the existing Registry part BBa_K5083099: PCR confirmation of GFP, T4 Holin and T4 Lysozyme fragments, normalised pCspA activity across temperatures and times, and growth curves of the lysis strain","caption_zh":"對 Registry 既有零件 BBa_K5083099 的補充特性分析：GFP、T4 Holin 與 T4 Lysozyme 片段的 PCR 確認、不同溫度與時間下經正規化的 pCspA 活性，以及裂解菌株的生長曲線","credit":"Team Squirrel-Beijing, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6133","team":"GreatBay-SCIE","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/greatbay-scie/","rank":47,"awards":["Best Model — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (High School)","Inclusivity Award — Winner (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（高中組）","包容性獎 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / Art & Design）"],"projectTitle":"Expelliodor — Expel the Odor, on Your Terms","projectTitle_zh":"Expelliodor — 除去體味，由你決定","tagline":"Three de novo designed proteins that stop axillary odour before it forms, without killing the skin microbiome.","tagline_zh":"三個從頭設計的蛋白質，在體味形成之前就阻斷它，同時不殺死皮膚微生物相。","summary":"Axillary odour arises when Staphylococcus hominis imports the odourless precursor Cys-Gly-3M3SH through the peptide transporter PepTSh and converts it to 3M3SH. Rather than killing skin bacteria, GreatBay-SCIE attacked the uptake step three ways: a de novo small-molecule binding protein that sequesters the precursor, a de novo protein binder designed to lock PepTSh in its inward-facing conformation, and a cyclodextrin glucanotransferase engineered to glycosylate the precursor so the transporter no longer recognises it. This is the most sophisticated de novo protein design campaign of any high school team in the cohort — RFdiffusion3, Proteina-Complexa, ProteinMPNN, RoseTTAFold3 co-folding, 50-ns MD with MM/GBSA, and SPURS-guided thermostability engineering — organised around two frameworks they invented: a Characterize stage prepended to DBTL, and a funnel-shaped decision-gated workflow that spends expensive methods only on candidates that survive cheap ones. Nine precursor binders and five transporter binders were actually tested in vitro, with 4 of 9 and 4 of 5 significantly reducing 3M3SH.","summary_zh":"腋下體味的成因是 Staphylococcus hominis 透過胜肽運輸蛋白 PepTSh 把無味的前驅物 Cys-Gly-3M3SH 送進細胞，再轉換成 3M3SH。GreatBay-SCIE 沒有選擇殺死皮膚細菌，而是從三個方向攻擊這個攝入步驟：一個從頭設計的小分子結合蛋白把前驅物隔離起來、一個從頭設計的蛋白質結合子把 PepTSh 鎖在朝內的構形、以及一個經改造的環糊精葡萄糖轉移酶（CGTase）為前驅物加上糖基，使運輸蛋白不再認得它。這是本屆所有高中隊伍中最精巧的從頭蛋白質設計工作——RFdiffusion3、Proteina-Complexa、ProteinMPNN、RoseTTAFold3 共折疊、搭配 MM/GBSA 的 50 ns 分子動力學，以及由 SPURS 指引的熱穩定性工程——並圍繞他們自創的兩套框架組織起來：在 DBTL 之前加上一個 Characterize（特性描述）階段，以及一條漏斗狀、設有決策關卡的流程，讓昂貴的方法只花在通過便宜方法篩選的候選上。實際進入體外測試的有九個前驅物結合子與五個運輸蛋白結合子，其中 9 個中有 4 個、5 個中有 4 個顯著降低了 3M3SH。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6133/wiki/drylab/model/overview-fig3.avif","caption":"The funnel-shaped decision-gated workflow: successive evaluation gates remove designs from a large generated space until a small testing set remains, with each gate more computationally expensive than the last. Designed explicitly so a high school team with limited wet-lab resources spends molecular dynamics time only on candidates that already survived cheap co-folding filters.","caption_zh":"漏斗狀的決策關卡流程：一道道評估關卡把設計從龐大的生成空間中逐步剔除，直到剩下一小組進入測試，而每一道關卡的運算成本都比前一道更高。這是刻意設計的，讓一支濕實驗資源有限的高中隊伍只把分子動力學的時間花在已通過便宜共折疊過濾的候選上。","credit":"Team GreatBay-SCIE, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6145","team":"MIT-MAHE","section":"Undergrad","country":"India","village":"Food & Agriculture / Manufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/mit-mahe/","rank":33,"awards":["Best Software — Nominee (Undergrad)","Inclusivity Award — Winner (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 入圍（大學組）","包容性獎 — 得主（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"MAHEK","projectTitle_zh":"MAHEK","tagline":"Sustainable cuminaldehyde from Pseudomonas putida, and NetFlux, a web tool that turns a genome-scale metabolic model into a drawable pathway and a ranked list of knockouts.","tagline_zh":"用 Pseudomonas putida 永續生產枯茗醛，並開發 NetFlux——一個把基因組尺度代謝模型化成可繪製路徑與剔除策略排序清單的網頁工具。","summary":"MAHEK addresses the fragrance industry's dependence on petrochemical synthesis and wasteful seed extraction by producing cuminaldehyde biologically. The chassis is Pseudomonas putida F1, a solvent-tolerant soil bacterium that already makes cuminaldehyde as an intermediate in p-cymene degradation; CRISPR-Cas9-mediated homologous recombination knocks out cymC, the p-cumic aldehyde dehydrogenase, arresting the pathway exactly at the target compound. The dry lab's deliverable is NetFlux, a React + FastAPI web application that compresses a genome-scale metabolic model into a readable 'production corridor' using a novel extraction algorithm (SCOPE) and then pools OptKnock and OptForce into one co-ranked list of knockout and regulation strategies, each traced to the gene and linked to BiGG. The team also won the Inclusivity Award for work with visually impaired learners that ended in Vision Empower adopting their tactile models for use in schools across India.","summary_zh":"MAHEK 針對香料產業依賴石化合成、以及種子萃取耗費資源的問題，改以生物方式生產枯茗醛（cuminaldehyde）。宿主是 Pseudomonas putida F1，一株耐溶劑的土壤細菌，它在 p-cymene 降解途徑中本來就會產生枯茗醛作為中間產物；以 CRISPR-Cas9 介導的同源重組剔除 cymC（p-cumic 醛脫氫酶），讓途徑恰好停在目標化合物。乾實驗的交付成果是 NetFlux，一個 React + FastAPI 的網頁應用程式，它以自創的擷取演算法（SCOPE）把基因組尺度代謝模型壓縮成一條可讀的「生產走廊」，再把 OptKnock 與 OptForce 的結果匯整成單一的共同排序清單，列出剔除與調控策略，每一項都追溯到對應基因並連結到 BiGG。該隊也以針對視障學習者的工作獲得包容性獎，成果是 Vision Empower 採用了他們的觸覺模型，用於印度各地的學校。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6145/wiki/dry-lab/software/fig-2-architecture.avif","caption":"NetFlux architecture: React/TypeScript frontend, FastAPI backend with Pydantic schemas and a bounded JobManager worker pool, over a SQLite model catalogue and precomputed Mass Flow Graphs.","caption_zh":"NetFlux 架構：React/TypeScript 前端、搭配 Pydantic 結構與有上限 JobManager 工作者池的 FastAPI 後端，底層是 SQLite 模型目錄與預先計算的質量流圖。","credit":"Team MIT-MAHE, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6151","team":"Uni-Padua-IT","section":"Undergrad","country":"Italy","village":"Space","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uni-padua-it/","rank":59,"awards":["Best Software — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Space Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 得主（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 得主（大學組）","最佳太空專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"C.O.S.M.I.C. (Cyanobacterial Oxygen Supply for Martian Inhabitant Complexes)","projectTitle_zh":"C.O.S.M.I.C.（火星居住複合體的藍綠菌供氧系統）","tagline":"A Nostoc-based life-support chassis for Mars, plus ReTIsigner, an open codon optimiser for the 35,799 hosts other tools ignore.","tagline_zh":"以 Nostoc 為基礎的火星生命維持底盤，外加 ReTIsigner：一個開放的密碼子最佳化工具，支援其他工具忽略的 35,799 種宿主。","summary":"Uni-Padua-IT engineered the filamentous cyanobacterium Nostoc sp. PCC 7120 as a Martian life-support organism: it fixes CO2 into breathable oxygen, degrades the perchlorates that poison Martian water (via native NarB and a heterocyst-compartmentalised pcrABD plus chlorite dismutase), and carries pprA from Deinococcus radiodurans for radiation-damage repair, behind a copper-dependent MazF kill switch. Because no free codon optimiser listed their chassis, they forked TIsigner into ReTIsigner, a frequency-weighted codon optimiser that reads any of the 35,799 Kazusa codon usage tables, enforces GC bounds, actively excises RFC restriction sites and reports CAI, GC and translation-initiation opening energy. ReTIsigner was validated in silico over 100 sequences and four hosts, then in vivo: a ReTIsigner-optimised eYFP gave a 2.16-fold common-effect increase in specific fluorescence across DH5-alpha and BL21 (p = 0.002, permutation test stratified by strain). They also built an open-source acoustic (piezo + Arduino) bubble sensor so oxygen production can be followed without opening a sealed culture.","summary_zh":"Uni-Padua-IT 把絲狀藍綠菌 Nostoc sp. PCC 7120 改造成火星上的生命維持生物：它把 CO2 固定成可供呼吸的氧氣、分解污染火星水源的過氯酸鹽（透過原生的 NarB，加上區隔在異形細胞中的 pcrABD 與亞氯酸鹽歧化酶），並帶有來自 Deinococcus radiodurans 的 pprA 以修復輻射損傷，整套系統受一個銅依賴型 MazF kill switch 控制。由於沒有任何免費的密碼子最佳化工具收錄他們的底盤，團隊把 TIsigner 分支成 ReTIsigner：一個以頻率加權的密碼子最佳化工具，可讀取 35,799 份 Kazusa 密碼子使用表中的任何一份、強制 GC 含量上下界、主動剔除 RFC 限制酶切位，並回報 CAI、GC 與轉譯起始的開啟能量。ReTIsigner 先在電腦上以 100 條序列、四種宿主驗證，再做活體驗證：經 ReTIsigner 最佳化的 eYFP 在 DH5-alpha 與 BL21 中，比生螢光的共同效應提高 2.16 倍（p = 0.002，依菌株分層的排列檢定）。他們也做了一個開放原始碼的聲學氣泡感測器（壓電元件加 Arduino），讓人不必打開密閉培養就能追蹤產氧情況。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6151/wiki/software/new-frontend.avif","caption":"The ReTIsigner interface the team built from scratch in SvelteKit, replacing the original TIsigner form.","caption_zh":"團隊以 SvelteKit 從零打造的 ReTIsigner 介面，取代了原本 TIsigner 的表單。","credit":"Team Uni-Padua-IT, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6157","team":"UCAS-China","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ucas-china/","rank":212,"awards":["1st Runner-up (Undergrad)","Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best New Composite Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["亞軍（大學組）","Top 10（大學組）","最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 得主（大學組）","最佳治療專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"PARCEL","projectTitle_zh":"PARCEL","tagline":"An inhaled, protein-based mRNA carrier that makes airway cells produce their own asthma medicine.","tagline_zh":"一種吸入式、以蛋白質為基礎的 mRNA 載體，讓呼吸道細胞自己製造氣喘藥。","summary":"PARCEL is an inhaled mRNA delivery platform built from elastin-like polypeptides (ELPs) rather than lipid nanoparticles. The fusion protein ELP-Pum2-EEP13 uses Pum2 to grab mRNA carrying a PRS tag in its 3' UTR, ELP phase separation to encapsulate and protect it, an endosomal escape peptide to get out of the endosome, and a Sortase A-conjugated anti-UPK1B scFv to target airway club cells; the cargo is mRNA for SLPI (inhibiting neutrophil elastase and the mucus hypersecretion it triggers) plus a lower dose of IFN-lambda-1 (antiviral defence and Th2 suppression). It won 1st Runner-up and Best Integrated Human Practices because the stakeholder work genuinely steered the science: clinicians moved the project from rescue therapy to maintenance therapy, and an asthma mechanism researcher killed one of the two original cargoes outright. The dry lab is unusually complete, modelling the whole chain from E. coli production through nebulizer aerosol deposition to a PK-PD readout in FEV1 and FeNO, with every module feeding the next.","summary_zh":"PARCEL 是一個吸入式 mRNA 遞送平台，以類彈性蛋白多肽（ELP）而非脂質奈米顆粒構成。融合蛋白 ELP-Pum2-EEP13 以 Pum2 抓取 3' UTR 帶有 PRS 標籤的 mRNA，利用 ELP 的相分離把它包裹並保護起來，再以內體逃脫肽離開內體，並以 Sortase A 接合的抗 UPK1B scFv 鎖定呼吸道棒狀細胞（club cell）；所攜帶的貨物是 SLPI 的 mRNA（抑制嗜中性球彈性蛋白酶及其引發的黏液過度分泌），加上較低劑量的 IFN-lambda-1（抗病毒防禦與 Th2 抑制）。本專案獲得亞軍與 Best Integrated Human Practices，因為利害關係人工作真的導引了科學：臨床醫師把專案從急救治療轉向長期控制治療，而一位氣喘機制研究者則直接否決了兩個原始貨物之一。乾實驗室的完整度相當罕見，從 E. coli 生產、經霧化器氣霧沉積，一路模擬到以 FEV1 與 FeNO 表示的 PK-PD 讀值，每一個模組都餵給下一個。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6157/wiki/humanpractices/hp-overview0.avif","caption":"The Human Practices overview: 20 individuals and institutions across six defined communities, 44 asthma patient representatives and 419 public representatives, mapped onto nine project iterations of the team's own RCSF cycle.","credit":"Team UCAS-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"人類實踐總覽：六個明確界定社群中的 20 位個人與機構、44 位氣喘病患代表與 419 位公眾代表，對映到團隊自創 RCSF 循環的九次專案迭代。"}]},{"id":"6158","team":"HongKong-JSS","section":"High School","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Agriculture","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-jss/","rank":219,"awards":["1st Runner-up (High School)","Top 10 (High School)","Best New Composite Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Model — Nominee (High School)","Best Hardware — Nominee (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Winner (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"awards_zh":["亞軍（高中組）","Top 10（高中組）","最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 得主（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / Art & Design）"],"projectTitle":"MerMAID - MerR-based Mercury Assay for In-field Detection","projectTitle_zh":"MerMAID - MerR-based Mercury Assay for In-field Detection","tagline":"One mercury ion among a billion molecules of water - a living sensor that glows red, read by a portable detector fed by a modular sample-extraction platform.","tagline_zh":"十億個水分子中的一個汞離子——一個會發紅光的活體感測器，由可攜式偵測器讀取，前端再接上模組化的樣品萃取平台。","summary":"HongKong-JSS is a four-school joint team (Y.W.C.A. Hioe Tjo Yoeng College, Po Leung Kuk Celine Ho Yam Tong College, Pentecostal School, Yan Oi Tong Tin Ka Ping Secondary School) that built a complete mercury-screening system for agricultural water and soil: a MerR-regulated E. coli biosensor expressing mRFP1e, a portable modular fluorescence reader, and a motorised sample-extraction platform that turns soil and water into a standard assay input. They designed, built and tested 13 biosensor prototypes - 2 aptamer-based and 11 protein-based - of which two protein designs responded to Hg2+, with the best showing low background, a response down to about 1 ppb (0.005 uM, roughly sixfold below the WHO drinking-water guideline of 6 ug/L), no cross-response to Cd2+, Pb2+ or Zn2+ at the concentrations tested, and retained function after alginate encapsulation. It took 1st Runner-up Grand Prize in the High School section and won Best Village Project, and the reason is visible on every page: the wiki's standing rule is that every number carries its conditions and a source, and the team separates demonstrated results from deployment claims more rigorously than most university teams.","summary_zh":"HongKong-JSS 是四校聯隊（Y.W.C.A. Hioe Tjo Yoeng College、Po Leung Kuk Celine Ho Yam Tong College、Pentecostal School、Yan Oi Tong Tin Ka Ping Secondary School），為農業用水與土壤做出一整套汞篩檢系統：一個由 MerR 調控、表現 mRFP1e 的 E. coli 生物感測器、一台可攜式模組化螢光讀取儀，以及一座可把土壤與水轉換成標準檢測輸入的電動樣品萃取平台。他們設計、製作並測試了 13 個感測器原型——2 個基於適體（aptamer）、11 個基於蛋白質——其中兩個蛋白質設計對 Hg2+ 有反應，表現最好的背景值低、反應可下探到約 1 ppb（0.005 uM，約為 WHO 飲用水指引值 6 ug/L 的六分之一），在測試濃度下對 Cd2+、Pb2+ 或 Zn2+ 沒有交叉反應，而且在海藻酸鈉包覆後仍保有功能。他們拿下高中組 1st Runner-up Grand Prize 與 Best Village Project，而理由在每一頁都看得見：這個 wiki 的常規是每個數字都要帶著它的條件與來源，而且團隊把「已展示的結果」和「佈署時的主張」分得比多數大學團隊更嚴格。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6158/wiki/model/figure-1.avif","caption":"Control-subtracted colour and pellet-fluorescence signals against log mercury concentration, with each calibration run coloured separately and the pooled log-linear fit overlaid.","caption_zh":"扣除對照後的顏色與菌體沉澱物螢光訊號對汞濃度對數作圖，每個校正批次以不同顏色標示，並疊上彙總後的對數線性擬合線。","credit":"Team HongKong-JSS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6165","team":"SMS-Shenzhen","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Climate Crisis / Conservation / Bioremediation (inferred from project scope; no village stated on the wiki)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/sms-shenzhen/","rank":7,"awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"kisMET - selective biosorption of residual metals from battery-recycling wastewater","projectTitle_zh":"kisMET——從電池回收廢水中選擇性生物吸附殘餘金屬","tagline":"Catching the last one percent of lithium, cobalt, nickel and manganese without more chemistry","tagline_zh":"不靠更多化學藥劑，把鋰、鈷、鎳、錳的最後百分之一攔下來","summary":"kisMET targets the tail-end wastewater of spent lithium-ion battery recycling, where metal concentrations fall to parts-per-million and solvent extraction stops being economic. The team engineered Komagataeibacter rhaeticus to decorate its own bacterial cellulose with a secreted fusion protein built from a signal peptide, a carbohydrate-binding module, a HiBiT reporter tag and a swappable ion-binding peptide, assembled by Golden Gate on a pSEVA331 backbone under a rhamnose-inducible promoter. Four SP/CBM scaffolds and an eight-member ion-binding-peptide panel were designed so the binding specificity can be changed without redesigning the platform. Evidence so far covers cultivation, construct and reporter comparisons, single-metal binding experiments and cellulose-degradation assays; the team states clearly that selectivity in mixed wastewater, closed-loop cellulose reuse and complete metal recovery are design objectives, not results.","summary_zh":"kisMET 瞄準廢鋰離子電池回收的末端廢水：此時金屬濃度已降到 ppm 等級，溶劑萃取不再符合經濟效益。團隊改造 Komagataeibacter rhaeticus，讓它以自身分泌的融合蛋白修飾自己產生的細菌纖維素；該融合蛋白由訊息肽、碳水化合物結合模組、HiBiT 報導標籤與可替換的離子結合肽組成，以 Golden Gate 組裝於 pSEVA331 骨架上，由鼠李糖誘導型啟動子驅動。他們設計了四組 SP/CBM 支架與八個成員的離子結合肽組，使結合專一性可在不重新設計平台的情況下更換。目前的證據涵蓋培養、構築體與報導基因比較、單一金屬結合實驗以及纖維素降解分析；團隊明確表示，混合廢水中的選擇性、纖維素的閉環再利用與金屬的完全回收都是設計目標，而非已得的結果。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6165/wiki/description-fig3-ibp-swap.avif","caption":"Molecular design of the pSEVA331 expression system, showing the interchangeable ion-binding-peptide modules that let the platform be retargeted to a different metal without redesign.","credit":"Team SMS-Shenzhen, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"pSEVA331 表現系統的分子設計，顯示可互換的離子結合肽模組，使平台能在不重新設計的情況下改為針對另一種金屬。"}]},{"id":"6166","team":"GHCIS","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Climate Crisis, Conservation & Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ghcis/","rank":136,"awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Part Collection — Winner (High School)","Best Software — Winner (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Climate Crisis / Conservation / Bioremediation)"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳元件集 — 得主（高中組）","最佳軟體 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（Climate Crisis / 保育 / 生物復育）"],"projectTitle":"ARGUS","projectTitle_zh":"ARGUS","tagline":"A paper-based toehold-switch assay plus a browser-based image-analysis and surveillance platform for environmental antimicrobial resistance gene monitoring.","tagline_zh":"一套紙基 toehold switch 檢測，搭配一個在瀏覽器中執行的影像分析與監測平台，用於環境中抗藥性基因的監測。","summary":"ARGUS pairs a cell-free, paper-based toehold switch assay for three antimicrobial resistance genes (mcr-1, blaNDM-1, blaKPC-2) with portable temperature-control hardware and a full-stack web platform that reads the colorimetric plate from a phone photo, grades each gene, and stores location-linked records for regional review. Recombinase polymerase amplification feeds trigger RNA to switches that drive colour-producing enzymes — blue for MCR1 (GusA), yellow for NDM1 (XylE), purple-shifted for KPC2 (LacZ). The project is framed inside the One Health approach, targeting the gap between institution-led metagenomic surveys and the routine, fine-grained environmental monitoring that networks like CARSS do not cover. It won Best Software and Best Part Collection on the strength of a genuinely deployable platform (Docker or native Node, SQLite, role-based access, documented deployment) and a NUPACK design pipeline that reproduced a published sequence grammar and then found an error in it — all presented with an unusually disciplined limitations section that refuses to claim sensitivity, specificity or a detection limit it has not measured.","summary_zh":"ARGUS 把針對三個抗藥性基因（mcr-1、blaNDM-1、blaKPC-2）的無細胞紙基 toehold switch 檢測，與可攜式溫控硬體以及一個全端網頁平台結合起來：平台能從手機照片讀取呈色反應盤、為每個基因評級，並儲存與地點連結的紀錄以供區域層級審閱。重組酶聚合酶擴增（RPA）產生觸發 RNA 餵給開關，再驅動呈色酶，MCR1 為藍色（GusA）、NDM1 為黃色（XylE）、KPC2 則偏紫（LacZ）。專案置於 One Health 架構之下，瞄準的是機構主導的總體基因體調查與日常、細緻的環境監測之間的落差，而後者正是 CARSS 這類網路並未涵蓋的部分。團隊憑一個真正可部署的平台（Docker 或原生 Node、SQLite、角色式存取控制、文件化的部署流程），以及一條重現了已發表序列語法、進而在其中找出一個錯誤的 NUPACK 設計流程，拿下 Best Software 與 Best Part Collection；而這一切的呈現都搭配一個紀律異常嚴謹的限制章節，拒絕聲稱任何尚未量測到的靈敏度、專一性或檢測極限。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6166/wiki/software/figure-02.avif","caption":"ARGUS feature map: client functions (location, plate photographs, local four-grade analysis, personal records), console functions (regional review, alerts, exports), account management and operations.","caption_zh":"ARGUS 功能圖：用戶端功能（定位、反應盤拍照、本機四級分析、個人紀錄）、主控台功能（區域審閱、警示、匯出），以及帳號管理與維運。","credit":"Team GHCIS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6174","team":"Hongwen School","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hongwen-school/","rank":21,"awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (High School)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / Art & Design）"],"projectTitle":"BrewXOS","projectTitle_zh":"BrewXOS","tagline":"Creating additional value within an existing spent-grain economy: brewer's spent grain to candidate arabinoxylan oligosaccharides.","tagline_zh":"在既有的酒糟經濟中創造額外價值：把啤酒酒糟轉為候選的阿拉伯木聚醣寡醣。","summary":"Hongwen School (Shanghai and Qingdao) engineered Bacillus subtilis WB600 to secrete xylan-degrading enzymes that convert the arabinoxylan fraction of brewer's spent grain (BSG) into candidate arabinoxylan oligosaccharides (AXOS). Five strains - single Xyn2 and Xyn11A, two dual combinations with the GH62 arabinofuranosidase Abf62A, and a triple construct - were compared; the triple strain reached 257.10 +/- 5.55 U/mL apparent supernatant activity and a parental-adjusted index of 107.91 +/- 6.64 mg xylose equivalents per gram dry BSG after 12 h, 32.8% above the better dual strain. Alongside this they built BrewXOS Fermenter Mini, a small fermentation-monitoring prototype with a main-cap/sub-cap lid, headspace O2/CO2 sensing and a touchscreen interface, and tested it with real users. The Human Practices work is the best part of the project: a GRAIN x TRACE framework forces every stakeholder interaction to end in a named change plus the evidence for it, or be flagged as an open loop.","summary_zh":"Hongwen School（上海與青島）改造 Bacillus subtilis WB600，使其分泌木聚醣降解酵素，將啤酒酒糟（BSG）中的阿拉伯木聚醣部分轉化為候選的阿拉伯木聚醣寡醣（AXOS）。團隊比較了五個菌株——單獨表現 Xyn2 與 Xyn11A、兩種與 GH62 阿拉伯呋喃糖苷酶 Abf62A 的雙酵素組合，以及一個三酵素構築體；三酵素菌株在 12 小時後達到 257.10 +/- 5.55 U/mL 的上清液表觀活性，以及經親代校正的 107.91 +/- 6.64 mg 木糖當量/公克乾酒糟，比表現較好的雙酵素菌株高出 32.8%。此外他們還做了 BrewXOS Fermenter Mini，一台小型發酵監測原型機，具備主蓋／副蓋結構的槽蓋、頂空 O2/CO2 偵測與觸控螢幕介面，並找真實使用者測試。人類實踐是整個專案最好的部分：GRAIN x TRACE 框架要求每一次利害關係人互動都必須收束成一項具名的改變加上其證據，否則就標記為未閉合的迴路。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6174/wiki/public/hp/integration-pathway.webp","caption":"The GRAIN x TRACE integration pathway: how stakeholder input reshaped problem definition, purpose, scientific design, implementation strategy and knowledge sharing, with TRACE recording each question-to-change-to-evidence loop.","caption_zh":"GRAIN x TRACE 的整合路徑：利害關係人的意見如何重塑問題定義、目的、科學設計、落地策略與知識分享，而 TRACE 則記錄每一個「問題—改變—證據」的迴路。","credit":"Team Hongwen School, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6177","team":"SEHS","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Therapeutics / health (inferred from project scope; no village stated on the wiki)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/sehs/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Alternative Platform — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳替代平台 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"FusionDrive - an anti-TIGIT-IL-2v fusion protein for gastric cancer immunotherapy","projectTitle_zh":"FusionDrive：用於胃癌免疫治療的 anti-TIGIT-IL-2v 融合蛋白","tagline":"Release the immune brake and bias the accelerator, in one molecule","tagline_zh":"以單一分子鬆開免疫煞車，並把油門偏向正確的細胞族群","summary":"Starting from the high gastric-cancer burden in their home province of Shandong, SEHS designed FusionDrive, a fusion protein joining an anti-TIGIT antibody to an engineered IL-2 variant through a G4S linker. The antibody Fab blocks CD155-TIGIT inhibitory signalling to reverse T-cell exhaustion, while the Fc-fused IL-2v carries a low-alpha/high-beta modification that reduces CD25 binding and so biases stimulation away from regulatory T cells. Across five DBTL cycles the team built the antibody, the wild-type IL-2 fusion and the variant fusion in CHO cells and compared them by SDS-PAGE, TIGIT-binding ELISA (EC50 0.6317 nM for the antibody, 1.335 nM after IL-2 fusion) and flow cytometry for CD25 and pSTAT5. Because the iGEM high-school White List left Jurkat as the only available T-cell line, they used PHA induction to create CD25-high and CD25-low populations as a stand-in for the Treg receptor phenotype.","summary_zh":"從家鄉山東省沉重的胃癌負擔出發，SEHS 設計了 FusionDrive，一種以 G4S 連接子把 anti-TIGIT 抗體接上經改造 IL-2 變體的融合蛋白。抗體的 Fab 段阻斷 CD155-TIGIT 抑制訊號以逆轉 T 細胞耗竭；與 Fc 融合的 IL-2v 則帶有 low-alpha/high-beta 改造，降低對 CD25 的結合，從而讓刺激偏離調節型 T 細胞。在五個 DBTL 循環中，團隊於 CHO 細胞內製作了抗體、野生型 IL-2 融合蛋白與變體融合蛋白，並以 SDS-PAGE、TIGIT 結合 ELISA（抗體 EC50 為 0.6317 nM，融合 IL-2 後為 1.335 nM）以及針對 CD25 與 pSTAT5 的流式細胞術加以比較。由於 iGEM 高中組的 White List 只留下 Jurkat 這一株可用的 T 細胞株，他們改以 PHA 誘導製造 CD25 高表現與低表現族群，作為 Treg 受體表現型的替代。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6177/wiki/description/fig-03.avif","caption":"From design to initial validation: the five engineering cycles taking FusionDrive from anti-TIGIT antibody to wild-type IL-2 fusion to the low-alpha/high-beta IL-2 variant fusion.","caption_zh":"從設計到初步驗證：五個工程循環把 FusionDrive 從 anti-TIGIT 抗體推進到野生型 IL-2 融合蛋白，再到 low-alpha/high-beta IL-2 變體融合蛋白。","credit":"Team SEHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6178","team":"HFI","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hfi/","rank":143,"awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (High School)","Best Education — Winner (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Winner (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳教育 — 得主（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 得主（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"projectTitle":"TWO EcN, ONE METABOLIC MISSION - A Probiotic Synergistic Therapy for the Rare Disease Hyperlysinemia","projectTitle_zh":"TWO EcN, ONE METABOLIC MISSION — 以益生菌協同療法治療罕見疾病高離胺酸血症","tagline":"A dual-strain E. coli Nissle 1917 consortium, physically stapled together with SpyTag/SpyCatcher, that degrades dietary lysine in the gut so hyperlysinemia patients can escape lifelong diet restriction.","tagline_zh":"一組以 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 實體釘接在一起的雙菌株 E. coli Nissle 1917 群落，在腸道中分解飲食來源的離胺酸，讓高離胺酸血症患者得以擺脫終身飲食限制。","summary":"HFI (International Department, The Affiliated High School of South China Normal University, Guangzhou) built an orally delivered live biotherapeutic for hyperlysinemia, a rare AASS-mutation disorder with no approved therapy and an incidence near 1 in 411,000. They split the human saccharopine pathway across two EcN populations - an upstream strain expressing LKR and SDH, a downstream strain expressing ALDH and AASDHPPT - knocked out the endogenous ldcC lysine decarboxylase by CRISPR-Cas9 to remove background lysine consumption, and covalently coupled the two strains using eCPX-displayed SpyTag/SpyCatcher so intermediates pass between cells over a short diffusion distance. Biosafety is handled by a dual-input kill switch where an arabinose-driven Bxb1 serine integrase inverts the lysis-E cassette and an oxygen-sensing PcyoA promoter only fires outside the anaerobic gut. The project won because the dry lab genuinely steered the wet lab (NetLogo screening picked the RBS before cloning), the part collection was fully characterised with HPLC-MS, and the education and IHP programmes were unusually systematic for a high school team.","summary_zh":"HFI（廣州華南師範大學附屬中學國際部）為高離胺酸血症打造了一款口服的活體生物療法；這是一種由 AASS 突變造成的罕見疾病，目前沒有核准療法，發生率約為 1/411,000。他們把人體的 saccharopine 代謝路徑拆分到兩群 EcN 上——上游菌株表現 LKR 與 SDH，下游菌株表現 ALDH 與 AASDHPPT——並以 CRISPR-Cas9 剔除內源的 ldcC 離胺酸脫羧酶，以消除背景的離胺酸消耗；再以 eCPX 展示的 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 把兩個菌株以共價方式耦合起來，使中間產物在很短的擴散距離內於細胞間傳遞。生物安全由一個雙輸入致死開關處理：由阿拉伯糖驅動的 Bxb1 絲胺酸整合酶會把 lysis-E 卡匣反轉，而感測氧氣的 PcyoA 啟動子只有在離開厭氧的腸道環境後才會啟動。此專題之所以勝出，是因為乾實驗確實引導了濕實驗（NetLogo 篩選在選殖之前就選定了 RBS）、元件集合以 HPLC-MS 做了完整特性分析，而教育與 IHP 的規劃對一支高中隊伍而言異常地系統化。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6178/wiki/model/4.avif","caption":"NetLogo agent-based output: simulation trajectories (A) and cluster-size distributions (B) under different SpyCatcher binding capacities, showing the transition from fragmented association at low display to near-global condensation at 50+ sites.","caption_zh":"NetLogo 代理人模型輸出：不同 SpyCatcher 結合容量下的模擬軌跡（A）與群集大小分布（B），顯示從低展示量時的零散結合，到 50 個位點以上時近乎全域凝聚的轉變。","credit":"Team HFI, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6185","team":"Lambert-GA","section":"High School","country":"United States","village":"Conservation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/lambert-ga/","rank":301,"awards":["Grand Prize Winner (High School)","Top 10 (High School)","Best Model — Winner (High School)","Best Hardware — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Winner (High School)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Winner (High School)","Best Village Project — Winner (Climate Crisis / Conservation / Bioremediation)"],"awards_zh":["總冠軍（高中組）","Top 10（高中組）","最佳模型 — 得主（高中組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 得主（高中組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 得主（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 得主（Climate Crisis / 保育 / 生物復育）"],"projectTitle":"SWARM - de novo minibinders against Deformed Wing Virus paired with multiplexed RNAi against Varroa destructor","projectTitle_zh":"SWARM——針對殘翅病毒的 de novo minibinder，搭配針對蜂蟹蟎 Varroa destructor 的多工 RNAi","tagline":"Protecting honeybees by hitting both the virus and the mite that carries it, with the first reported minibinder confirmed to bind DWV's VP3.","tagline_zh":"同時打擊病毒與攜帶病毒的蟎來保護蜜蜂，並做出已確認可結合 DWV VP3 的首例 minibinder。","summary":"Lambert iGEM (Suwanee, Georgia) built SWARM to attack the two linked causes of honeybee colony collapse: Deformed Wing Virus and the Varroa destructor mite that vectors it. US beekeepers reported losing 55.6% of managed colonies between April 2024 and April 2025, and Georgia's large operations lost roughly 88,000 colonies in nine months. SWARM pairs a computationally designed 79-amino-acid minibinder against the exposed P-domain of DWV's VP3 capsid protein - experimentally confirmed by biolayer interferometry at KD = 603.6 nM (95% CI 497.1-733.3 nM), to the team's knowledge the first reported minibinder with confirmed binding to VP3 - with a multiplexed dsRNA construct silencing three Varroa salivary-gland genes (Vd-CHIsal, Vd-CHIBIN, VdAV422) at once to blunt resistance. Both components are delivered through feeding practices beekeepers already use. They took the High School Grand Prize plus Best Model, Best Wiki, Best Sustainable Development Impact and Best Village Project, and the modelling is the headline: four linked models spanning protein design benchmarking on 5,721 experimentally labelled designs, oral pharmacokinetics with Sobol sensitivity analysis, a 13-ODE RNAi network, and an individual-based six-year colony epidemiology simulation across two climates.","summary_zh":"Lambert iGEM（喬治亞州 Suwanee）做出 SWARM，攻擊造成蜜蜂蜂群崩解的兩個相連原因：殘翅病毒（DWV）與傳播它的蜂蟹蟎 Varroa destructor。美國養蜂人報告在 2024 年 4 月至 2025 年 4 月間損失了 55.6% 的管理蜂群，喬治亞州的大型蜂場在九個月內損失約 88,000 個蜂群。SWARM 把一個以計算設計、長 79 個胺基酸的 minibinder（針對 DWV 的 VP3 外殼蛋白中暴露的 P-domain，並以生物層干涉技術實驗確認 KD = 603.6 nM，95% CI 497.1-733.3 nM，就該隊所知是首例確認可結合 VP3 的 minibinder）與一個多工 dsRNA 構築體配對，後者同時靜默三個 Varroa 唾液腺基因（Vd-CHIsal、Vd-CHIBIN、VdAV422）以降低抗性風險。兩個組件都透過養蜂人原本就在用的餵食方式投遞。該隊拿下高中組總冠軍，外加最佳模型、最佳 Wiki、最佳永續發展影響與最佳 Village 專案，而建模是最醒目的部分：四個互相銜接的模型，涵蓋在 5,721 個有實驗標註的設計上做蛋白質設計基準測試、含 Sobol 敏感度分析的口服藥物動力學、一個 13 條 ODE 的 RNAi 網路，以及一個跨兩種氣候、以個體為基礎的六年蜂群流行病學模擬。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6185/wiki/modeling/img-6251.avif","caption":"The epidemiological model pipeline: how minibinder protection (assigned per bee from its syrup intake) and RNAi exposure at brood capping enter the individual-based colony simulation.","caption_zh":"流行病學模型的流程：minibinder 保護（依每隻蜂的糖水攝取量逐一指派）與封蓋時的 RNAi 暴露，如何進入以個體為基礎的蜂群模擬。","credit":"Team Lambert-GA, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6187","team":"Toronto","section":"Overgrad","country":"Canada","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/toronto/","rank":124,"awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Model — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Hardware — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳模型 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"PetaBite","projectTitle_zh":"PetaBite","tagline":"Planetary-scale bioprospecting for plastic-degrading enzymes: mine 300M candidates, then match an enzyme to each real-world condition.","tagline_zh":"行星尺度的塑膠分解酵素生物探勘：挖出 3 億個候選序列，再為每一種真實環境條件配對出合適的酵素。","summary":"PetaBite attacks PET and microplastic pollution by abandoning the field's usual strategy of engineering a handful of known enzymes and instead searching the natural sequence landscape at planetary scale. The dry lab rebuilt PETadex from scratch into PETadex V2: 1.74 billion plastic-degrading enzyme homologs recovered from NCBI nr and the Logan assembly of the entire Sequence Read Archive, filtered by 53 hand-curated catalytic HMMs to 291,922,243 complete catalytic ORFs, each annotated with the pH, temperature, salinity and environment of the sample it came from. They paired this with PETai activity labels scraped from literature by an LLM pipeline and by 20+ human curators, pretrained PlasticESM (LoRA adapters on ESM-C) on the corpus, and built a hardware bioreactor array to feed condition-specific measurements back into the model. They won Best Model largely for scientific honesty: a homology-component-grouped split showed that sequence length beats their own embeddings, and they reported that rather than the inflated random-split numbers.","summary_zh":"PetaBite 處理 PET 與微塑膠污染的方式，不走這個領域慣用的改造少數已知酵素路線，而是在行星尺度上搜尋自然界的序列地景。乾實驗室把 PETadex 從頭重建成 PETadex V2：從 NCBI nr 以及整個 Sequence Read Archive 的 Logan 組裝中找回 17.4 億條塑膠分解酵素的同源序列，再以 53 個人工校正的催化 HMM 過濾成 291,922,243 條完整的催化 ORF，每一條都標註來源樣本的 pH、溫度、鹽度與環境。他們再搭配 PETai 活性標籤，這些標籤由一條 LLM 流程與 20 多位人工標註者從文獻中擷取；並在這個語料上預訓練 PlasticESM（在 ESM-C 上加 LoRA adapter）；還做了一套硬體生物反應器陣列，把特定條件下的量測值回饋給模型。他們拿下 Best Model，很大一部分是因為科學上的誠實：依同源性連通元件分組的資料切分顯示，單純的序列長度表現勝過他們自己的嵌入向量，而他們選擇回報這個結果，而不是隨機切分那組虛高的數字。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6187/wiki/drylab-page/figures/petadex-workflow-overview.svg","caption":"Overview of the PETadex V2 discovery pipeline: curated PAZy enzymes seed catalytic HMMs, which mine NCBI nr and the Logan SRA assembly down to 291,922,243 complete catalytic ORFs.","caption_zh":"PETadex V2 探索流程概覽：以人工校正的 PAZy 酵素作為種子建立催化 HMM，再從 NCBI nr 與 Logan 的 SRA 組裝中挖掘，最後收斂到 291,922,243 條完整的催化 ORF。","credit":"Team Toronto, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6196","team":"TAU-Israel","section":"Overgrad","country":"Israel","village":"Therapeutics / Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/tau-israel/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Software — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"CERNAL","projectTitle_zh":"CERNAL","tagline":"A biological compiler: supply RNA expression data, get ranked RNA logic-gate circuit designs that fire only in the cell state you specify.","tagline_zh":"一個生物編譯器：輸入 RNA 表現資料，得到排序後的 RNA 邏輯閘迴路設計，只在你指定的細胞狀態下啟動。","summary":"CERNAL treats the transcriptome as a fingerprint of cellular state and compiles that fingerprint into an RNA logic circuit: it picks the transcripts that distinguish a target cell from its neighbour, scans each transcript for an accessible, unique, constructible trigger window, designs a toehold-style switch whose hairpin hides the ribosome binding site until that trigger unzips it, combines switches into AND and NOT gates, ranks every candidate on shared thermodynamic metrics, and assembles the winner into an annotated plasmid. Because the sensing element is the cell's own RNA rather than a characterised transcription factor, the approach is intended to be host-agnostic, and the team demonstrated it in three proofs of concept: endometriosis logic in HEK293T, a PFOA/PFAS biosensor in E. coli, and CRISPRa gates in yeast. The software is a Django Ninja + React 19 application with a strictly isolated scientific engine, a versioned HTTP API with Python, R and MATLAB clients, SBOL 3 export, and an IBBIS Common Mechanism biosecurity gate that withholds sequence files when screening cannot be completed. The team filed a provisional patent through Tel Aviv University's TTO and built a full market case around cell and gene therapy developers.","summary_zh":"CERNAL 把轉錄體當成細胞狀態的指紋，並把這個指紋編譯成 RNA 邏輯迴路：它挑出能把目標細胞與鄰近細胞區分開來的轉錄本，掃描每個轉錄本尋找可及、專一且可建構的觸發視窗，設計 toehold 式開關——其髮夾結構會把核醣體結合位藏起來，直到觸發序列把它拉開——再把多個開關組合成 AND 與 NOT 閘，以共用的熱力學指標為每個候選排序，最後把勝出者組裝成帶註解的質體。由於感測元件是細胞自身的 RNA 而非已鑑定的轉錄因子，這套方法的設計意圖是與宿主無關，團隊也以三個概念驗證示範：HEK293T 中的子宮內膜異位症邏輯、E. coli 中的 PFOA/PFAS 生物感測器，以及酵母中的 CRISPRa 閘。軟體是一個 Django Ninja + React 19 應用程式，具嚴格隔離的科學運算引擎、版本化的 HTTP API（附 Python、R 與 MATLAB 客戶端）、SBOL 3 匯出，以及一道 IBBIS Common Mechanism 生物安全閘門——在篩查無法完成時扣住序列檔案不放。團隊透過台拉維夫大學技轉辦公室提出臨時專利申請，並圍繞細胞與基因治療開發商建立了完整的市場論證。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6196/wiki/software/01-inputs.avif?v=4","caption":"CERNAL's Inputs panel: E. coli selected as host and a 711-nucleotide mCherry transcript entered as a Direct Trigger mRNA, from the recorded five-step walkthrough.","credit":"Team TAU-Israel, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"CERNAL 的輸入面板：選定 E. coli 為宿主，並輸入一段 711 個核苷酸的 mCherry 轉錄本作為 Direct Trigger mRNA，取自那段錄製的五步驟導覽。"}]},{"id":"6197","team":"HangzhouFourteenAP","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Space, Foundational Advance, Software & AI, Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hangzhoufourteenap/","rank":124,"awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Measurement — Nominee (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Winner (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳量測 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 得主（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"projectTitle":"DCO (Dental Calculus Obstructor)","projectTitle_zh":"DCO (Dental Calculus Obstructor)","tagline":"A four-enzyme cocktail plus a hydroxyapatite-binding antimicrobial peptide coating that dismantles dental plaque biofilm before it mineralises into calculus.","tagline_zh":"四種酵素的組合，加上一層會結合羥基磷灰石的抗菌胜肽塗層，在牙菌斑生物膜礦化成牙結石之前就把它拆掉。","summary":"DCO is a three-module biological oral care system: an enzyme cocktail that degrades the organic matrix holding plaque biofilm together, a tooth-binding antimicrobial peptide that coats enamel to block re-colonisation, and a controlled-release system to coordinate them. The enzymes are two recombinantly expressed glycoside hydrolases — PmGH87 (alpha-1,3-glucanase) and CoGH66 (alpha-1,6-glucanase), which act cooperatively because CoGH66 removes alpha-1,6 branches and exposes new PmGH87 cleavage sites — plus commercially sourced DNase I and papain for extracellular DNA and protein. It addresses a real and specific burden: 96.7% of Chinese adults aged 35-44 have dental calculus, over 900 million have periodontal disease, only 20.1% of elderly people saw a dentist in the past year, and the dentist-to-population ratio is about 1:7,768. It won Best Village Project on a tight problem-to-product chain, a FoldX mutation-prioritisation pipeline whose prediction was wrong and whose failure is reported in full, and an unusually commercially literate entrepreneurship section that refuses to make anti-calculus claims it cannot support.","summary_zh":"DCO 是一套三模組的生物性口腔照護系統：一組分解牙菌斑生物膜有機基質的酵素組合、一種會結合牙面、覆蓋琺瑯質以阻止細菌重新定殖的抗菌胜肽，以及一套協調兩者的控制釋放系統。酵素包含兩種以重組方式表現的醣苷水解酶——PmGH87（alpha-1,3-葡聚醣酶）與 CoGH66（alpha-1,6-葡聚醣酶），兩者具協同作用，因為 CoGH66 會移除 alpha-1,6 分支、露出新的 PmGH87 切割位——再加上市購的 DNase I 與木瓜酵素，分別處理胞外 DNA 與蛋白質。它針對的是真實而具體的負擔：中國 35-44 歲成人有 96.7% 有牙結石、超過 9 億人有牙周疾病、過去一年只有 20.1% 的高齡者看過牙醫，而牙醫與人口比約為 1:7,768。它拿下 Best Village Project，靠的是一條從問題到產品的緊密鏈條、一套預測錯了卻把失敗完整報出來的 FoldX 突變優先排序流程，以及一份罕見具商業素養、而且拒絕提出自己支持不了的抑制牙結石主張的創業章節。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6197/wiki/content/model/modeling-figure1.avif","caption":"The CoGH66 mutation prioritisation workflow: PyMOL contact identification in PDB 8IUB, mapping onto the MAFFT/ESPript conservation map to select substitutable sites, point mutation in PyMOL, and FoldX delta-delta-G calculation to rank candidates.","caption_zh":"CoGH66 突變優先排序工作流程：在 PDB 8IUB 中用 PyMOL 找出接觸殘基、對映到 MAFFT/ESPript 保守性圖以挑出可取代位置、在 PyMOL 做點突變，再以 FoldX 計算 delta-delta-G 為候選排序。","credit":"Team HangzhouFourteenAP, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6199","team":"SUIS-SFLS","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/suis-sfls/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"TyroFix","projectTitle_zh":"TyroFix","tagline":"Recyclable magnetic-bead tyrosinase that cheaply DOPA-modifies recombinant mussel adhesive protein, sold as a B2B raw material","tagline_zh":"可回收再用的磁珠固定化酪胺酸酶，以低成本對重組貽貝黏附蛋白進行 DOPA 修飾，並以 B2B 原料的形式販售","summary":"SUIS-SFLS expressed three microbial tyrosinases, immobilised them on magnetic beads so the enzyme can be magnetically recovered and reused, and used the recycled catalyst to hydroxylate Mfp3-linker-Mfp6 fusion mussel foot proteins into DOPA-bearing wet adhesives for skin and wound repair. The commercial thesis is unusually self-aware: after expert interviews they abandoned the idea of selling a finished dressing and repositioned as an upstream B2B raw-material supplier, splitting the same protein stock into TyroFix Mini (cosmetic grade) and TyroFix ProMax (Class II medical grade) and running both regulatory tracks in parallel from day one so that test data never has to be repeated. They are the only high-school team here with a genuine financial model, including capex, cost per litre, pricing, gross margin and breakeven year for each line, published as downloadable PDFs. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship in the High School section.","summary_zh":"SUIS-SFLS 表現了三種微生物來源的酪胺酸酶，把它們固定化在磁珠上使酶能以磁性回收並重複使用，再以回收的催化劑把 Mfp3-linker-Mfp6 融合的貽貝足蛋白羥化成帶 DOPA 的濕態黏合劑，用於皮膚與傷口修復。商業論述的自我認識異常清楚：在專家訪談之後，團隊放棄了販售成品敷料的想法，改定位為上游的 B2B 原料供應商，把同一批蛋白質原料拆成 TyroFix Mini（化妝品級）與 TyroFix ProMax（第二類醫療器材級），並從第一天就讓兩條法規途徑平行推進，使檢測資料永遠不必重做。他們是本批中唯一具備真正財務模型的高中團隊，模型包含各產品線的資本支出、每公升成本、定價、毛利率與損益兩平年度，並以可下載的 PDF 公開。團隊入圍高中組的 Best Entrepreneurship。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6199/wiki/entrepreneurship/figure-11.avif","caption":"Financial planning for TyroFix Mini: capex, R&D spend, CNY 71 per litre production cost and the volume ramp to 30,000 litres by year five","caption_zh":"TyroFix Mini 的財務規劃：資本支出、研發支出、每公升 71 CNY 的生產成本，以及到第五年爬升至 30,000 公升的產量","credit":"Team SUIS-SFLS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6214","team":"HongKong-HS","section":"High School","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Diagnostics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hongkong-hs/","rank":84,"awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"projectTitle":"AmpliRen - a urine-based home screening kit concept for chronic kidney disease using urinary miRNA and hybridisation chain reaction","projectTitle_zh":"AmpliRen——以尿液 miRNA 與雜交鏈反應建構的慢性腎臟病居家篩檢套組概念","tagline":"Early signals. Made visible. A small sample telling a bigger story.","tagline_zh":"及早的訊號，看得見的呈現。一份小小的檢體，說出更大的故事。","summary":"HongKong-HS is a five-school joint team (Wah Yan College Kowloon, Pope Paul VI College, C&MA Sun Kei Secondary School, Tsung Tsin Christian Academy, St. Paul's School Lam Tin) tackling chronic kidney disease, which affects roughly 788 million adults worldwide, has risen past 405,000 recorded adult cases in Hong Kong, and is usually caught only at stage 3-5 because creatinine-based eGFR does not move until about half of kidney function is gone. AmpliRen detects two urinary microRNAs - miR-21-5p for fibrosis severity and miR-192-5p as an early warning, together reported at 89% sensitivity and 82% specificity - and amplifies the signal enzyme-free at room temperature with hybridisation chain reaction, whose G-rich hairpin loops fold into G-quadruplexes that bind hemin to form a DNAzyme and oxidise TMB into a colour change visible in natural light. The project is a genuine four-cycle engineering story: the team started with toehold switches designed in miRADAR and screened in NUPACK, found EGFP output too weak and invisible, pivoted to HCR, then to G-quadruplex-containing probes, then to hemin/TMB colorimetry. It was nominated for Best Wiki on one of the most ambitious scroll-driven, 3D-visualised wikis in the competition.","summary_zh":"HongKong-HS 是由五校組成的聯隊（九龍華仁書院、保祿六世書院、宣道會鄭榮之中學、崇真書院、藍田聖保祿學校），處理的是慢性腎臟病：全球約有 7.88 億成人受影響，香港的成人紀錄病例已超過 405,000 例，而由於基於肌酸酐的 eGFR 要等到腎功能大約失去一半才會變動，病情通常要到第 3 至 5 期才被發現。AmpliRen 偵測兩種尿液 microRNA——miR-21-5p 反映纖維化嚴重度，miR-192-5p 作為早期警訊，兩者合併的報告數據為靈敏度 89%、專一性 82%——並以雜交鏈反應（HCR）在室溫下不用酵素放大訊號；其富含 G 的髮夾環會折疊成 G-四聯體，結合血基質（hemin）形成 DNAzyme，氧化 TMB 產生在自然光下即可看見的顏色變化。這個專題是一段貨真價實、歷經四輪的工程故事：團隊一開始用 miRADAR 設計、在 NUPACK 中篩選 toehold switch，發現 EGFP 的輸出太弱、看不見，轉而改用 HCR，再改用含 G-四聯體的探針，最後改成 hemin/TMB 比色。它以本屆最具野心的捲動敘事、3D 視覺化 wiki 之一獲最佳 wiki 提名。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6214/wiki/project/engineering/fig-10-complex-formation-of-toehold-7-for-mir-192-5p-nupack.avif","caption":"NUPACK equilibrium complex-formation analysis for toehold 7 against miR-192-5p; the red bars show the active toehold-miRNA complex concentration used to rank candidates alongside the HMFE-versus-TMFE comparison.","caption_zh":"以 NUPACK 分析 toehold 7 對 miR-192-5p 的平衡態複合物生成；紅色長條顯示有活性的 toehold-miRNA 複合物濃度，這與 HMFE 對 TMFE 的比較一併用來為候選排序。","credit":"Team HongKong-HS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6219","team":"XJTLU-Software","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Software & AI","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/xjtlu-software/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Software & AI Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳軟體與 AI專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"AMPilot","projectTitle_zh":"AMPilot","tagline":"An AI research workbench for antimicrobial peptide design, where the application owns the research record and the model only ever receives a request.","tagline_zh":"一套用於抗菌肽設計的 AI 研究工作台：研究紀錄由應用程式掌管，模型從頭到尾只收到一份請求。","summary":"AMPilot is a live, hosted AI-assisted research workbench for antimicrobial peptide design, built around the argument that a conversation is an entry point but the research has to live in inspectable materials. Sources stay linked to their records, candidate sequences stay in files, and documents remain editable after the conversation moves on, across twelve implemented research stages grouped into five phases from framing a question to a bench handoff. The team wrote their own agent harness rather than using LangChain, LlamaIndex, AutoGen, DSPy or LiteLLM, specifically so the application rather than a framework owns the saved research state and the policy that turns it into model context, and so that a model proposal becomes an executable action only through a validated tool boundary. The sequence generator, TC-SRF, adapts the ProtFlow latent flow-matching pipeline with scientific-text conditioning via cross-attention and adaptive normalisation plus a constraint-aware decoder that refuses a residue unless some allowed suffix can still satisfy the stated length, charge and composition contract. Validation includes a 16-participant randomised AB/BA crossover user study, which is the most rigorous usability evidence any iGEM software team produced this year.","summary_zh":"AMPilot 是一套已上線、代管的 AI 輔助研究工作台，用於抗菌肽設計，其核心主張是：對話只是入口，研究本身必須存放在可檢視的材料裡。文獻來源始終與其紀錄相連，候選序列留在檔案中，文件在對話往前推進後仍可編輯；整個流程涵蓋十二個已實作的研究階段，歸納為五個時期，從界定問題一路到交付實驗檯。團隊自行撰寫 agent 執行框架，而不採用 LangChain、LlamaIndex、AutoGen、DSPy 或 LiteLLM，目的很明確：讓已儲存的研究狀態、以及把該狀態轉成模型上下文的策略，由應用程式而非外部框架掌管；也讓模型的提議只有通過經驗證的工具邊界才會變成可執行的動作。序列生成器 TC-SRF 改編自 ProtFlow 的潛在空間流匹配管線，透過交叉注意力與自適應正規化加入科學文本條件，並配上一個具約束意識的解碼器：除非仍有某個允許的後綴能滿足既定的長度、電荷與組成條件，否則它會拒絕該殘基。驗證包含一項 16 人、隨機化 AB/BA 交叉設計的使用者研究，這是本年度所有 iGEM 軟體隊伍中最嚴謹的可用性證據。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6219/wiki/software/ampilot-live-sequence-workspace-v2.avif","caption":"The live AMPilot sequence workspace: a circular map of the public reference record 1S with the base-level sequence and annotation list kept connected to the original GenBank annotations.","credit":"Team XJTLU-Software, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"AMPilot 已上線的序列工作區：公開參考紀錄 1S 的環狀圖譜，鹼基層級序列與註解清單都與原始 GenBank 註解保持連動。"}]},{"id":"6220","team":"WHU-China","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/whu-china/","rank":33,"awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best New Composite Part — Winner (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳新複合元件 — 得主（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"DifferPhase","projectTitle_zh":"DifferPhase","tagline":"Phase-separated condensates split plasmids unevenly at division, so one founder population differentiates into a stable division of labour","tagline_zh":"相分離凝聚體在細胞分裂時把質體不均勻地分配出去，讓單一起始族群分化成穩定的分工體系","summary":"WHU-China built DifferPhase, a platform that uses liquid-liquid phase separation to force asymmetric inheritance at cell division, so a single founder population can differentiate into several engineered sub-populations each carrying a different part of a long metabolic pathway. A YhjH-mCherry-PopZ fusion (Ymp) condenses at the cell pole and locally degrades c-di-GMP, so one daughter inherits the condensate and stays a low-c-di-GMP founder while the other becomes a high-c-di-GMP buffer cell; Slr supplies c-di-GMP to set up the gradient, and a tripartite split-GFP sensor built from GFP10-PilZ and FimX-GFP11 reports c-di-GMP in real time. Two orthogonal partitioning systems (ParB/parS and SopB/sopC) then drive different plasmids into different daughters, and a cross-interlocked dual toxin-antitoxin pair holds the resulting multi-plasmid state without antibiotics. They won Best New Composite Part in the Undergrad section and were nominated for Best New Basic Part.","summary_zh":"WHU-China 建立了 DifferPhase 平台，利用液-液相分離在細胞分裂時強制產生不對稱繼承，讓單一起始族群能分化成數個工程化子族群，各自攜帶長代謝途徑的不同片段。YhjH-mCherry-PopZ 融合蛋白（Ymp）會在細胞極凝聚，並在局部降解 c-di-GMP，因此一個子代細胞繼承凝聚體、維持低 c-di-GMP 的起始細胞狀態，另一個則變成高 c-di-GMP 的緩衝細胞；Slr 負責提供 c-di-GMP 以建立濃度梯度，而由 GFP10-PilZ 與 FimX-GFP11 組成的三元 split-GFP 感測器則即時回報 c-di-GMP 濃度。接著以兩套正交的分配系統（ParB/parS 與 SopB/sopC）把不同質體推進不同的子代細胞，並用一對交互連鎖的雙毒素-抗毒素系統，在不使用抗生素的情況下維持多質體狀態。他們獲得大學部組的 Best New Composite Part，並入圍 Best New Basic Part。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6220/wiki/whu-contribution2-fig1.avif","caption":"The LLPS-mediated platform for cellular functional differentiation, offered as a reference framework for future multi-cell division-of-labour systems","caption_zh":"以 LLPS 介導的細胞功能分化平台，作為未來多細胞分工系統的參考框架","credit":"Team WHU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6222","team":"WageningenUR","section":"Overgrad","country":"Netherlands","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/wageningenur/","rank":264,"awards":["1st Runner-up (Overgrad)","Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Measurement — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["亞軍（研究生組）","Top 10（研究生組）","最佳量測 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"Triton","projectTitle_zh":"Triton","tagline":"Capture, degrade and sense trifluoroacetate: a three-module biological system for the smallest forever chemical, aimed at reverse-osmosis concentrate.","tagline_zh":"捕捉、分解並偵測三氟乙酸鹽：針對最小的永久性化學物質設計的三模組生物系統，目標是逆滲透濃縮液。","summary":"Triton targets trifluoroacetate (TFA), the ultra-short-chain PFAS that makes up more than 98% of all PFAS measured in EU river and groundwater and was found in the blood of all 110 Europeans tested in a 2026 study. Rather than one trick, they built three modules shaped entirely by stakeholder input: a de novo protein binder on bacterial cellulose beads to concentrate TFA out of reverse-osmosis concentrate, a growth-coupled directed hyper-evolution platform to push fluoroacetate dehalogenases from monofluoroacetate toward difluoroacetate and then TFA, and a riboswitch biosensor for continuous on-site monitoring. The dry lab contributed two reusable tools - PIGEON, an active-learning in silico evolution loop that lifted a Boltz-2 binding probability by over 33%, and DISARM, which retargets existing aptamers to new small-molecule ligands without SELEX. They took 1st Runner-up Grand Prize plus Best Measurement, Best Presentation and Best Bioremediation Project.","summary_zh":"Triton 針對的是三氟乙酸鹽（TFA）——這種超短鏈 PFAS 佔歐盟河川與地下水所測得全部 PFAS 的 98% 以上，而 2026 年一項研究在 110 位受測歐洲人的血液中全數驗出。他們沒有只靠一招，而是做了三個完全由利害關係人意見塑形的模組：把 de novo 蛋白質結合體固定在細菌纖維素微珠上，用來把 TFA 從逆滲透濃縮液中濃縮出來；一個與生長耦合的定向超演化平台，把氟乙酸脫鹵酶從單氟乙酸推向二氟乙酸、再推向 TFA；以及一個核糖開關生物感測器，用於現場連續監測。乾實驗貢獻了兩項可重複使用的工具——PIGEON，一個主動學習的 in silico 演化迴圈，把 Boltz-2 的結合機率提升超過 33%；以及 DISARM，不需 SELEX 就能把現有核酸適體重新導向新的小分子配體。該隊拿下總冠軍亞軍，外加最佳量測、最佳簡報與最佳生物復育專案。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6222/wiki/text-images/general/triton-wholesystem-v5.avif","caption":"The full Triton system: reverse-osmosis concentrate passes a bacterial-cellulose capture filter to concentrate TFA, then a bioreactor where evolved dehalogenase cleaves the C-F bond while a riboswitch biosensor monitors concentration continuously.","caption_zh":"完整的 Triton 系統：逆滲透濃縮液先通過細菌纖維素捕捉濾床把 TFA 濃縮起來，再進入生物反應器，由演化後的脫鹵酶切開 C-F 鍵，同時由核糖開關生物感測器連續監測濃度。","credit":"Team WageningenUR, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6236","team":"ZQT-Nanjing","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Biomanufacturing / sustainable production (inferred from project scope; no village stated on the wiki)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/zqt-nanjing/","rank":33,"awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Project Promotion Video — Winner (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳專案宣傳影片 — 得主（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"EcToBloom","projectTitle_zh":"EcToBloom","tagline":"A greener, low-salt route to ectoine, finished as a compostable bacterial-cellulose repair mask","tagline_zh":"更環保的低鹽 ectoine（依克多因）製程，最後做成可堆肥的細菌纖維素修護面膜","summary":"EcToBloom rebuilds the ectoine biosynthesis route (ectB-ectA-ectC from halophilic bacteria) in non-halophilic E. coli BL21(DE3) so that ectoine can be made under conventional low-salt fermentation instead of the industrial high-salt 'bacterial milking' process that corrodes equipment and produces untreatable saline wastewater. A second engineered strain carries acsAB and acsCD to make its own bacterial cellulose membrane, which is combined with a silk fibroin layer and loaded with ectoine to give a preservative-free, compostable three-layer repair mask. Titres rose from 0.503 g/L (same-batch wild type) to 4.425 g/L in the first engineered strain, 5.344 g/L on an optimised medium and 6.852 g/L after introducing the feedback-desensitised LysC T352I aspartokinase. The team also explored wheat-straw hydrolysate and other paper wastes as non-food carbon sources.","summary_zh":"EcToBloom 把 ectoine（依克多因）的生合成路徑（來自嗜鹽細菌的 ectB-ectA-ectC）重建在非嗜鹽的 E. coli BL21(DE3) 中，讓 ectoine 可以在常規的低鹽發酵條件下生產，取代工業上會腐蝕設備、又產生難以處理含鹽廢水的高鹽「細菌擠乳」製程。第二株工程菌帶有 acsAB 與 acsCD，可自行生產細菌纖維素膜，再與絲蛋白層結合並載入 ectoine，做成不含防腐劑、可堆肥的三層修護面膜。效價從同批次野生型的 0.503 g/L 提升到第一株工程菌的 4.425 g/L，在最佳化培養基上達 5.344 g/L，導入解除回饋抑制的 LysC T352I 天門冬胺酸激酶後達 6.852 g/L。團隊也嘗試以小麥稈水解液與其他紙類廢棄物作為非食用碳源。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6236/wiki/description/img1-v2008.avif","caption":"The EcToBloom low-salt green manufacturing platform: engineered chassis, renewable feedstock, biosynthesised ectoine and biodegradable mask, ending in the three-layer BC-Silk-Ectoine repair mask.","caption_zh":"EcToBloom 的低鹽綠色製造平台：工程底盤、可再生原料、生物合成的 ectoine 與可生物分解的面膜，最後收在三層的 BC-Silk-Ectoine 修護面膜。","credit":"Team ZQT-Nanjing, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6242","team":"GCGS","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Infectious Diseases, Therapeutics, Diagnostics & Oncology","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/gcgs/","rank":117,"awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best New Improved Part — Winner (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳改良元件 — 得主（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"projectTitle":"PathoLogic","projectTitle_zh":"PathoLogic","tagline":"A dual-response engineered E. coli Nissle 1917 probiotic, delivered as an inhalable live biotherapeutic, that degrades Pseudomonas aeruginosa biofilm in cystic fibrosis lungs.","tagline_zh":"一株具雙重反應的工程化 E. coli Nissle 1917 益生菌，以可吸入式活體生物製劑形式遞送，用來降解囊狀纖維化肺部中綠膿桿菌（Pseudomonas aeruginosa）的生物膜。","summary":"PathoLogic engineers E. coli Nissle 1917 into a living sensor that fires only when it detects two simultaneous signals of the cystic fibrosis airway — low iron (via Fur) and high C4-HSL quorum-sensing molecule from Pseudomonas aeruginosa (via RhlR) — wired as an AND gate. On dual activation, Lysis E lyses the cells to release alginate lyase, which degrades the alginate-based extracellular polymeric matrix that shields P. aeruginosa from antibiotics and immunity. The product concept is a spray-dried, matrix-protected inhalable live biotherapeutic positioned as an adjunct, not a replacement, for inhaled antibiotics. It won Best New Improved Part on a genuinely instructive two-cycle engineering story: adding SsrA degradation tags to RhlR killed the leakage but also killed the induction, and only replacing the weak wild-type Prhl with the engineered Prhl(LR) recovered a working sensor. The dry lab is the thinnest of the five high-school Top 10 teams; its strength is wet-lab characterisation discipline and an exceptionally thorough regulatory and stakeholder analysis.","summary_zh":"PathoLogic 把 E. coli Nissle 1917 工程化為一個活體感測器，只有在同時偵測到囊狀纖維化呼吸道的兩個訊號時才啟動——低鐵（透過 Fur）與來自綠膿桿菌的高濃度 C4-HSL 群體感應分子（透過 RhlR）——兩者接成一個 AND 閘。雙重活化時，Lysis E 使細胞裂解，釋出 alginate lyase，降解以 alginate 為基礎的胞外高分子基質，而該基質正是綠膿桿菌抵禦抗生素與免疫系統的屏障。產品概念是一種噴霧乾燥、以基質保護的可吸入式活體生物製劑，定位為吸入型抗生素的輔助療法，而非取代。它以一段真正具教學價值的兩輪工程故事獲得 Best New Improved Part：在 RhlR 上加 SsrA 降解標籤雖消除了滲漏，卻也連誘導一起消滅，唯有把弱的野生型 Prhl 換成工程化的 Prhl(LR)，才救回一個可用的感測器。乾實驗室是五支高中組 Top 10 隊伍中最薄弱的；其強項在於濕實驗室的特性鑑定紀律，以及一份格外完整的法規與利害關係人分析。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6242/wiki/improve/figure-1.avif","caption":"The modification strategy for the RhlR response system across both improvement cycles: SsrA degradation tags on RhlR, then replacement of wild-type Prhl with the engineered Prhl(LR).","credit":"Team GCGS, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"RhlR 反應系統在兩輪改良中的修改策略：先在 RhlR 上加 SsrA 降解標籤，再把野生型 Prhl 換成工程化的 Prhl(LR)。"}]},{"id":"6243","team":"William-and-Mary","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/william-and-mary/","rank":40,"awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Safety and Security Award — Winner (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","安全與保安獎 — 得主（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"BROKEN: Building Resilient Optimized Engineered Networks","projectTitle_zh":"BROKEN: Building Resilient Optimized Engineered Networks","tagline":"Bringing failure analysis from mature engineering disciplines into synthetic biology: detect, mitigate and predict how genetic circuits break.","tagline_zh":"把成熟工程領域的失效分析帶進合成生物學：偵測、緩解並預測基因迴路是怎麼壞掉的。","summary":"William & Mary argued that synthetic biology measures whether a circuit works and almost never measures how long it keeps working. BROKEN therefore ran longitudinal experiments on four previously engineered circuits in laboratory cultures and in seawater microcosms, following them through serial passaging to deterioration rather than stopping at initial success. The team paired functional readouts (OD600, beta-carotene production, GFP, biofilm morphology, starch hydrolysis, colony-forming units) with molecular verification (PCR, restriction digests, gels, NanoDrop) and with multi-omics (RNA-seq, genomic DNA sequencing, long-read plasmid sequencing), then built mechanistic ODE models and machine-learning approaches to predict time to failure. The reliability framing came directly from Integrated Human Practices and turned safety into the project's central motivation, which is reflected in its Safety and Security Award.","summary_zh":"William & Mary 主張合成生物學一向只量迴路「會不會動」，幾乎從不量它「還能動多久」。因此 BROKEN 對四個先前已工程改造的迴路做縱向實驗，在實驗室培養液與海水微宇宙中，透過連續傳代一路追到功能衰退，而不是在初步成功時就停下。團隊把功能性讀值（OD600、beta-胡蘿蔔素產量、GFP、生物膜形態、澱粉水解、菌落形成單位）與分子層面的驗證（PCR、限制酶切、電泳膠、NanoDrop）以及多體學（RNA-seq、基因體 DNA 定序、長讀長質體定序）配在一起，再建立機制性 ODE 模型與機器學習方法來預測失效時間。這套以可靠性為核心的框架直接來自整合式人類實踐，把安全變成整個專案的主要動機，而這也反映在他們拿到的 Safety and Security Award 上。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6243/wiki/figures/figure1-betacarotene-assay.avif","caption":"Beta-carotene assay following circuit output over serial passaging. Absorbance at 454 nm is normalised to OD600 so that a fall in total pigment can be separated from a fall in cell number.","caption_zh":"追蹤連續傳代過程中迴路輸出的 beta-胡蘿蔔素分析。454 nm 的吸光度以 OD600 正規化，使總色素下降能與細胞數下降分開。","credit":"Team William-and-Mary, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6244","team":"QingdaoAcademy","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/qingdaoacademy/","rank":21,"awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Agriculture / Food & Nutrition / Fashion & Cosmetics / Art & Design)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（農業 / 食品與營養 / 時尚與美妝 / Art & Design）"],"projectTitle":"UPKeep","projectTitle_zh":"UPKeep","tagline":"From green tides to new possibilities: enzymes that turn collected Ulva into sugars for further biological use.","tagline_zh":"從綠潮到新的可能：用酵素把收集來的 Ulva 轉化為可供後續生物利用的醣類。","summary":"QingdaoAcademy (Qingdao, Shandong) built UPKeep around the Ulva prolifera green tides that wash onto the Yellow Sea coast each summer. Stage 1 uses a free, configurable cellulosome - four enzyme modules (Cel9A, Cel6B, Cel9B-N, BglC) docked onto a CBM3a-bearing scaffoldin via cohesin-dockerin pairs - to open the cellulose-rich cell wall; Stage 2 applies an INPNC-Uly1040 ulvan lyase fusion to depolymerise ulvan into oligosaccharides proposed as a cosmetic moisturising ingredient. Containment is an iron-responsive Fur/ccdB-TetR/ccdA toxin-antitoxin circuit, modelled as a 13-state ODE system, while interface selection rests on a 25-pair AlphaFold 3 screen with HADDOCK and PRODIGY follow-up. The Human Practices work is unusually well engineered for a first-year high-school team: thirteen numbered design decisions, each with the stakeholder, what was said, what changed and the follow-up evidence.","summary_zh":"QingdaoAcademy（山東青島）以每年夏天湧上黃海沿岸的 Ulva prolifera 綠潮為題，建立了 UPKeep。第一階段使用一個游離、可組態的纖維小體（cellulosome），由四個酵素模組（Cel9A、Cel6B、Cel9B-N、BglC）透過 cohesin-dockerin 配對接到帶有 CBM3a 的支架蛋白上，用來打開富含纖維素的細胞壁；第二階段則以 INPNC-Uly1040 ulvan 裂解酶融合蛋白把 ulvan 解聚成寡醣，並提議作為化妝品的保濕成分。生物圍阻採用鐵離子反應型的 Fur/ccdB-TetR/ccdA 毒素-抗毒素迴路，以 13 個狀態變數的 ODE 系統建模；界面的選擇則建立在 25 組配對的 AlphaFold 3 篩選上，再以 HADDOCK 與 PRODIGY 做後續分析。對一支第一年參賽的高中隊伍來說，人類實踐的工作設計得異常嚴謹：十三項編號的設計決策，每一項都列出利害關係人、對方說了什麼、改了什麼，以及後續證據。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6244/wiki/engagement/qa-8fac1d1be36d-hp01-8fac1d1be3.avif","caption":"HP01: interviews at Hongdao fishing harbour with fishers, boat operators, coastal sanitation workers and residents, which corrected the team's assumption that the Ulva utilisation chain was undeveloped.","caption_zh":"HP01：在 Hongdao 漁港對漁民、船員、海岸環衛工人與居民進行訪談，這修正了團隊原先以為 Ulva 利用鏈尚未發展的假設。","credit":"Team QingdaoAcademy, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6245","team":"ABOA","section":"Overgrad","country":"Finland","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/aboa/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"Benzophe-none","projectTitle_zh":"Benzophe-none","tagline":"Degrading benzophenone-3 before it reaches our waters","tagline_zh":"在二苯甲酮-3 進入水體之前先把它分解掉","summary":"ABOA (University of Turku) set out to express the benzophenone-3 (BP-3, oxybenzone) catabolic pathway of Rhodococcus oxybenzonivorans in E. coli so that this sunscreen UV filter could be destroyed inside a wastewater treatment plant rather than released into the Baltic and the oceans. The team built a modular restriction-based plasmid system (10 plasmids, 10 genes covering four pathway steps, codon-optimised and RFC10/RFC1000 compatible) that lets homologous flavin reductases and flavin-dependent oxidoreductases be co-expressed, separated, swapped and re-tagged between 6xHis and GST using only NcoI, NdeI and XhoI. Enzyme expression and solubility were obtained to varying degrees, but the activity question was not resolved: BP-3 and BP-1 absorbance overlaps NADH so the spectrophotometric assay was inconclusive, and the triple-quadrupole LC-MS run failed on missing controls and incompatible vials. The team says this plainly and positions the work as a first step plus a designed-but-untested 28-part Golden Gate system (38 parts in total) handed to the community.","summary_zh":"ABOA（University of Turku）著手在 E. coli 中表現 Rhodococcus oxybenzonivorans 的二苯甲酮-3（BP-3，氧苯酮）分解代謝途徑，目的是讓這種防曬紫外線濾劑在污水處理廠內就被分解，而不是排入波羅的海與大洋。團隊建立了一套模組化、以限制酶為基礎的質體系統（10 個質體、10 個基因，涵蓋途徑中的四個步驟，已做密碼子最佳化並相容於 RFC10/RFC1000），只用 NcoI、NdeI 與 XhoI 就能把同源的黃素還原酶與黃素依賴型氧化還原酶共表現、分離、互換，並在 6xHis 與 GST 兩種標籤之間更換。酵素表現與可溶性有不同程度的成果，但活性問題並未解決：BP-3 與 BP-1 的吸收與 NADH 重疊，使分光光度法分析無法定論；三重四極桿 LC-MS 的分析則因缺少對照組與樣品瓶不相容而失敗。團隊把這點直說出來，並把成果定位為第一步，外加一套已設計但未測試的 28 件式 Golden Gate 系統（合計 38 件零件）交給社群。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6245/wiki/images/wwtppersonnel-edited.avif","caption":"The team with process engineer Jouko Tuomi and trainees Nea Lempiainen and Heli Karinkanta at the Turku wastewater treatment plant, the meeting that switched the implementation from purified enzymes to whole cells on fixed carriers.","credit":"Team ABOA, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"團隊與 Turku 污水處理廠的製程工程師 Jouko Tuomi 及實習生 Nea Lempiainen、Heli Karinkanta 合影；正是這場會議讓實作從純化酵素改為固定在載體上的完整細胞。"}]},{"id":"6249","team":"Heidelberg","section":"Undergrad","country":"Germany","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/heidelberg/","rank":129,"awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Part Collection — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳元件集 — 得主（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 得主（大學組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"VOYAGE","projectTitle_zh":"VOYAGE","tagline":"An acoustic platform for observation and organization of living systems: gas vesicles engineered into a programmable interface between ultrasound and biology.","tagline_zh":"一個用於觀察與組織活體系統的聲學平台：把氣體囊泡改造成超音波與生物學之間可程式化的介面。","summary":"Fluorescence microscopy sees molecular detail but light scattering stops it at tissue depth; X-ray reaches deep but uses ionising radiation; ultrasound penetrates deep without radiation and can even push cells around, but has no molecular specificity. VOYAGE closes that gap with gas vesicles — gas-filled protein nanostructures from aquatic microorganisms, built from GvpA with GvpC reinforcing the outer shell — which scatter ultrasound as genetically encodable contrast agents and buckle at a collapse pressure that can be tuned by engineering GvpC. From that one part the team built four capabilities: GvpC variants with distinct pressure responses as a basis for multiplexed acoustic imaging, a kinase-responsive GvpC that turns phosphorylation into an acoustic signal, latch-based biosensors that report soluble targets, and DARPin- or SpyCatcher-directed vesicles that act as acoustic handles, enriching labelled HEK293T cells roughly tenfold at the side outlet of an acoustophoretic chip and lining them up at pressure antinodes while unlabelled cells sit at the nodes. It won Best Wiki and Best Part Collection because the delivery matched the science: a modular part collection with expression systems for Dolichospermum flos-aquae gas vesicles in mammalian cells and Serratia gas vesicles in E. coli, an accessibility guide for working with gas vesicles on a budget, and ATLAS — a full computational companion spanning all-atom molecular dynamics, three protein design pipelines, a fine-tuned segmentation model and an ultrasound signal model.","summary_zh":"螢光顯微術看得到分子層級的細節，但光散射讓它進不到組織深處；X 光可以深入，卻使用游離輻射；超音波既能深入又不需輻射，甚至能推動細胞，但沒有分子專一性。VOYAGE 以氣體囊泡填補這個落差，這種來自水生微生物、充滿氣體的蛋白質奈米結構由 GvpA 構成，外殼再由 GvpC 強化，它們能散射超音波而成為可由基因編碼的顯影劑，並在某個崩潰壓力下發生挫曲，而該壓力可透過改造 GvpC 來調整。團隊從這一個零件發展出四種能力：具不同壓力響應的 GvpC 變體，作為多工聲學成像的基礎；一個可響應激酶的 GvpC，把磷酸化轉換成聲學訊號；基於鎖扣（latch）的生物感測器，用以回報可溶性標的；以及由 DARPin 或 SpyCatcher 導向的囊泡，充當聲學把手，在聲泳晶片的側出口把標記過的 HEK293T 細胞富集約十倍，並把它們排列在壓力波腹上，而未標記的細胞則停在波節。本案拿下 Best Wiki 與 Best Part Collection，因為交付的成果與科學內容相稱：一組模組化零件集，含在哺乳類細胞中表現 Dolichospermum flos-aquae 氣體囊泡以及在 E. coli 中表現 Serratia 氣體囊泡的表現系統、一份在有限預算下操作氣體囊泡的可及性指南，以及 ATLAS，一套完整的運算伴隨工具，涵蓋全原子分子動力學模擬、三條蛋白質設計流程、一個微調過的分割模型與一個超音波訊號模型。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6249/wiki/img/model/gvpc-evolution-pipeline.svg","caption":"The complete in silico GvpC redesign pipeline: the template is split into interface and structural residues, interface redesign is deep-learning-guided with LigandMPNN while structural residues are chosen rationally, candidates are predicted and filtered by structure predictors and physical constraints, and validated variants feed back to retune the gating strategy.","caption_zh":"完整的 GvpC 電腦內重新設計流程：模板先拆成介面殘基與結構殘基，介面的重新設計由 LigandMPNN 以深度學習導引，結構殘基則依理性判斷選定；候選者經結構預測器與物理約束預測並篩選，而通過驗證的變體再回饋回來重新調校篩選策略。","credit":"Team Heidelberg, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6254","team":"UAlberta","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ualberta/","rank":110,"awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Inclusivity Award — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","包容性獎 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳創業 — 得主（大學組）","最佳治療專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"gleyeco","projectTitle_zh":"gleyeco","tagline":"A modular fusion protein that uses the eye's own sugar coating as an anchor, delivered in a hydrogel, so dry eye medicine stays put.","tagline_zh":"一個模組化融合蛋白，把眼睛本身的糖衣當成錨點，並以水膠遞送，讓乾眼症藥物留在原處。","summary":"Dry eye disease affects an estimated 34.6% of people globally and 21.3% of Canadian adults, and the central problem is not the drug but the delivery: blinking and tear drainage clear a topical therapeutic within minutes. gleyeco treats the ocular glycocalyx as a docking site rather than a barrier, fusing a Galectin-3 carbohydrate-recognition domain (binding Core 1 O-glycans on mucins), a tandem pair of the 12-residue hyaluronic-acid-binding peptide HABpep, and IL-1RA (anakinra) as the therapeutic payload, delivered from a crosslinked PEG/hyaluronic acid hydrogel as a drop or a contact lens. The team built a five-stage dry lab pipeline with its own acronyms - GLARE, InSiGHT, VOIR, I-SPY, HOPE - that chooses the target, engineers the binder, sets the valency, predicts the yield and tunes the gel, and released GLARE as an installable Python package. It won Best Entrepreneurship on an unusually rigorous commercial case (38-patient survey, two clinician letters of support, a letter of intent from a clinic, competitor matrix against Restasis/Cequa/Xiidra, PESTEL, 10-year plan) and was nominated for the Inclusivity Award for an open-access Inclusivity in Research course, an Adaptive Technology Kit and a rural teachers' programme.","summary_zh":"乾眼症估計影響全球 34.6% 的人口，以及 21.3% 的加拿大成人，而核心問題不在藥物、而在遞送：眨眼與淚液排出會在幾分鐘內把局部用藥沖掉。gleyeco 把眼表的糖萼視為停靠位點、而非屏障，將一個 Galectin-3 的碳水化合物辨識區（結合黏液素上的 Core 1 O-glycan）、一組串聯的 12 殘基玻尿酸結合胜肽 HABpep，以及作為治療酬載的 IL-1RA（anakinra）融合在一起，再由交聯的 PEG／玻尿酸水膠以點眼液或隱形眼鏡形式遞送。團隊建了一條五階段的乾實驗流程，各有自創的縮寫——GLARE、InSiGHT、VOIR、I-SPY、HOPE——分別負責選定標的、改造結合子、設定價數、預測產率與調校水膠，並把 GLARE 釋出為可安裝的 Python 套件。它以一份異常嚴謹的商業論證（38 位病患問卷、兩封臨床醫師支持函、一家診所的意向書、對照 Restasis/Cequa/Xiidra 的競品矩陣、PESTEL、10 年計畫）拿下最佳創業獎，並以一門開放取用的「研究中的包容性」課程、一套輔具技術套件與一項偏鄉教師計畫獲得包容性獎提名。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6254/wiki/model-page/glare-fig1.avif","caption":"GLARE, the glycan-lectin screening pipeline: 50,000+ catalogued glycan sequences filtered to the 134 documented in ocular tissue, then screened for Galectin-3 off-target risk across other organs and under a dry-eye disease signature.","caption_zh":"GLARE，糖鏈—凝集素篩選流程：從收錄超過 50,000 條糖鏈序列中篩出在眼部組織有文獻記載的 134 種，再篩查 Galectin-3 在其他器官上的脫靶風險，以及在乾眼症疾病特徵下的表現。","credit":"Team UAlberta, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6263","team":"Bist-China","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/bist-china/","rank":35,"awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Hardware — Nominee (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"projectTitle":"PyrLac Glow","projectTitle_zh":"PyrLac Glow","tagline":"A dual lactate-pyruvate fluorescent sensing system as a low-cost grassroots pre-screening tool for cancer risk","tagline_zh":"一套乳酸-丙酮酸雙指標螢光感測系統，作為基層可用的低成本癌症風險初篩工具","summary":"PyrLac Glow reads the Warburg effect directly: two allosteric fluorescent biosensors, built by inserting YFP into the transcription regulators PdhR (pyruvate) and LldR (L-lactate), report the concentrations and the ratio of the two metabolites through a dual-lock mechanism. The project targets a specific structural gap in Chinese cancer screening - CT, endoscopy and liquid biopsy are accurate but inaccessible at grassroots level, while conventional serum tumour markers are cheap but not specific enough - with fewer than 10% of patients diagnosed early. The team ran 16 in-depth interviews across clinical practice, research, industry, public health, insurance, education and engineering, plus two questionnaires (208 and 113 valid responses), organised into five sequential stages each answering one question and each closing with a 'What we changed' statement. The biomarker architecture, the product category, the deployment scenarios, the hardware scope, the software permission model and the outreach strategy all changed as a direct result.","summary_zh":"PyrLac Glow 直接讀取 Warburg 效應：團隊把 YFP 插入轉錄調控蛋白 PdhR（丙酮酸）與 LldR（L-乳酸），做成兩個異位調節型螢光生物感測器，透過雙鎖機制回報這兩個代謝物的濃度及其比值。專案針對的是中國癌症篩檢中一個具體的結構性缺口——CT、內視鏡與液態生物檢體檢測雖然準確，基層卻拿不到；傳統血清腫瘤標記便宜，專一性卻不足——而早期診斷的病人不到 10%。團隊做了 16 場深度訪談，涵蓋臨床、研究、產業、公共衛生、保險、教育與工程領域，另有兩份問卷（208 份與 113 份有效回覆），並整理成五個依序推進的階段，每個階段回答一個問題，並以一段「我們改了什麼」收尾。生物標記架構、產品類別、部署場景、硬體範圍、軟體權限模型與推廣策略，全都因此直接改變。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6263/wiki/hp/h-2.avif","caption":"Interview with oncology clinician Dr Wu Qing, who partially contradicted the patient interviews and moved the team's focus from cost reduction to unambiguous result communication","caption_zh":"與腫瘤科臨床醫師 Wu Qing 的訪談，他部分推翻了病人訪談的結論，使團隊的重心從降低成本轉向不含糊的結果溝通","credit":"Team Bist-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6264","team":"NBJF","section":"High School","country":"China","village":"Space / Foundational Advance (Best Village Project nominee; the village is not named on the wiki, but the project is framed as DNA data storage for long-duration spaceflight)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nbjf/","rank":14,"awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"projectTitle":"AI-assisted de novo design of a thermostable TdT for enzymatic DNA synthesis","projectTitle_zh":"以 AI 輔助 de novo 設計耐熱 TdT，用於酵素式 DNA 合成","tagline":"Redesigning nature's DNA typewriter so information can be written into DNA","tagline_zh":"重新設計自然界的 DNA 打字機，讓資訊得以寫入 DNA","summary":"NBJF tackled the write step of DNA data storage. Enzymatic DNA synthesis using terminal deoxynucleotidyl transferase (TdT) avoids the toxic chemistry of phosphoramidite synthesis, but wild-type TdT has a melting temperature of roughly 40 C and a catalytic pocket that does not accommodate bulky modified nucleotides. Over seven Design-Build-Test-Learn cycles the team built an AI-assisted de novo protein design pipeline (RFdiffusion backbone generation, ProteinMPNN/LigandMPNN inverse folding, ESMFold and AlphaFold refolding checks, TemStaPro and SaProt thermostability scoring), screened a large candidate library down to a shortlist, expressed 85 designs, and obtained a de novo TdT that retains DNA extension activity at elevated temperature and accepts oxyamino-modified nucleotides. A final cycle used 100 ns molecular dynamics at 300/350/400 K to explain why.","summary_zh":"NBJF 處理的是 DNA 資料儲存中的「寫入」這一步。以末端去氧核苷酸轉移酶（TdT）進行酵素式 DNA 合成，可避開亞磷醯胺合成的有毒化學，但野生型 TdT 的熔解溫度只有約 40 °C，催化口袋也容納不下體積龐大的修飾核苷酸。經過七個設計—建構—測試—學習（DBTL）循環，該隊建立了一條 AI 輔助的 de novo 蛋白質設計流程（以 RFdiffusion 生成骨架、以 ProteinMPNN/LigandMPNN 做反向折疊、以 ESMFold 與 AlphaFold 重新折疊檢查、以 TemStaPro 與 SaProt 評分熱穩定性），把龐大的候選函式庫篩到一份短名單，表現 85 個設計，並得到一個在較高溫度下仍保有 DNA 延伸活性、且可接受氧胺基修飾核苷酸的 de novo TdT。最後一個循環以 300/350/400 K 下各 100 ns 的分子動力學模擬解釋其原因。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6264/wiki/engineering/img1.avif","caption":"The seven Design-Build-Test-Learn cycles, from the first unconstrained de novo design through structural reanalysis of wild-type TdT, pocket enlargement, expression screening and the closing molecular-dynamics cycle.","caption_zh":"七個設計—建構—測試—學習循環，從最初無約束的 de novo 設計，經過野生型 TdT 的結構再分析、口袋擴大、表現篩選，到收尾的分子動力學循環。","credit":"Team NBJF, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6269","team":"UZurich","section":"Overgrad","country":"Switzerland","village":"Conservation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uzurich/","rank":98,"awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Conservation Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳保育專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"SeisMIC","projectTitle_zh":"SeisMIC","tagline":"Stabilising Alpine slopes from within: engineered bacteria precipitate calcite between soil grains, with four linked models deciding where it is worth doing.","tagline_zh":"從內部穩定阿爾卑斯山坡：工程菌在土壤顆粒之間沉積方解石，再由四個互相串接的模型決定哪裡值得施作。","summary":"SeisMIC adapts microbially induced calcite precipitation (MICP) to Alpine slope stabilisation, where heavy rainfall is now 26% more frequent and 12% more intense and concrete anchoring is often out of proportion to the risk. Sporosarcina pasteurii hydrolyses urea so calcium carbonate crystallises around soil particles, filling pores and binding loose grains, and the team worked on the four limits that stop MICP transferring to the Alps: uneven cementation, scaling across large slopes, cold sensitivity and ammonium production. The distinctive contribution is the dry lab, which is a geospatial and economic decision system rather than a protein pipeline: an infinite-slope Factor of Safety model run across all of Switzerland on daily historical rainfall, a PHREEQC reactive transport model of calcite formation down a soil column, a QGIS MICP feasibility map, and an economic model using Flow-Py runout simulation to put a Swiss franc figure on damage avoided. The models are linked to each other and were reshaped by named expert feedback, which is what earned the Best Model nomination.","summary_zh":"SeisMIC 把微生物誘導方解石沉積（MICP）用在阿爾卑斯山區的坡地穩定上；當地強降雨的發生頻率已增加 26%、強度增加 12%，而混凝土錨定工程往往與實際風險不成比例。Sporosarcina pasteurii 水解尿素，使碳酸鈣在土壤顆粒周圍結晶，填滿孔隙並把鬆散顆粒黏結起來；團隊針對 MICP 要移植到阿爾卑斯山區所面臨的四項限制著手：膠結不均、在大面積坡地上的放大問題、對低溫的敏感性，以及銨的生成。最具辨識度的貢獻在乾實驗室，而且它是一套地理空間與經濟的決策系統，不是蛋白質流程：一個以每日歷史降雨資料、在全瑞士範圍執行的無限坡安全係數模型；一個以 PHREEQC 建立、模擬方解石沿土柱形成的反應性傳輸模型；一張 QGIS 的 MICP 可行性地圖；以及一個以 Flow-Py 滑動路徑模擬為基礎、把避免掉的損失換算成瑞士法郎的經濟模型。這些模型彼此串接，並依具名專家的意見反覆修改，這也是它獲得 Best Model 入圍的原因。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6269/wiki/stability-model/pipeline-overview.avif","caption":"The slope stability modelling pipeline, which joins rainfall records, landslide inventories, terrain and soil data into an infinite-slope Factor of Safety calculation and outputs the extra cohesion MICP would need to supply.","caption_zh":"坡地穩定性建模流程：把降雨紀錄、山崩清冊、地形與土壤資料併入無限坡安全係數計算，並輸出 MICP 需要補上的額外凝聚力。","credit":"Team UZurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6276","team":"Michigan","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/michigan/","rank":26,"awards":["Best New Improved Part — Winner (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳改良元件 — 得主（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"MagNav","projectTitle_zh":"MagNav","tagline":"Magnetically steered Magnetospirillum magneticum carrying a heat-triggered therapeutic, with RiboTherm, an MCMC optimiser for RNA thermometers.","tagline_zh":"以磁場導引的 Magnetospirillum magneticum 攜帶熱觸發的治療分子，並搭配 RiboTherm，一套用於 RNA 溫度計的 MCMC 最佳化工具。","summary":"MagNav uses Magnetospirillum magneticum AMB-1, a magnetotactic bacterium that follows external magnetic fields and thrives in low-oxygen environments, as a vector for delivering ClyA into ovarian cancer and endometriotic tissue. Alternating magnetic fields generate heat inside the bacteria, which induces therapeutic expression through a sigma-32 heat shock promoter; because heat shock promoters leak and imprecise expression would damage healthy tissue, the team added an RNA thermometer in the 5' UTR that folds to sequester the Shine-Dalgarno sequence and physically block ribosome binding until the temperature rises. The dry lab built RiboTherm to redesign that thermometer: an open-source Python package that searches 32 designable positions with a Metropolis-Hastings MCMC sampler against a two-term objective combining a ddG-open switching score with a novel Jensen-Shannon ensemble regulariser that keeps the 37 degree C silent state close to the parent. Three designs went to the bench, one (M1) held basal expression below the Neupert U8 parent while still responding at 45 degree C, and the team reports the rest of the comparison with explicit caveats about a single unreplicated blot.","summary_zh":"MagNav 以 Magnetospirillum magneticum AMB-1 作為載體，把 ClyA 遞送到卵巢癌與子宮內膜異位組織；這是一種會循外加磁場移動、且在低氧環境中生長良好的磁趨性細菌。交流磁場在細菌體內產生熱，透過 sigma-32 熱休克啟動子誘導治療蛋白表現；由於熱休克啟動子會滲漏，而表現不精準會傷害健康組織，團隊在 5' UTR 加入一個 RNA 溫度計，使其摺疊後把 Shine-Dalgarno 序列包藏起來，在溫度上升之前以物理方式阻擋核糖體結合。乾實驗打造 RiboTherm 來重新設計這個溫度計：一個開源的 Python 套件，以 Metropolis-Hastings MCMC 取樣器在 32 個可設計位置上搜尋，目標函數由兩項構成，結合 ddG-open 的切換分數與一個新提出的 Jensen-Shannon 系集正則化項，後者讓 37 度 C 的靜默狀態保持接近母序列。三個設計進入實驗驗證，其中 M1 的基礎表現低於 Neupert U8 母序列，同時仍能在 45 度 C 下反應；團隊報告其餘比較結果時，明確加上「只有單一次、未重複的墨點」這項保留。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6276/wiki/wiki2-model-final-008.webp","caption":"The Pareto front between switching (ddG-open) and basal expression (JS-mean): 5,000 grey null sequences behind four design campaigns shaded by lambda, with the three selected designs marked on the low-JS end.","caption_zh":"切換性（ddG-open）與基礎表現（JS 平均值）之間的 Pareto 前沿：5,000 條灰色虛無序列在後，四次設計運算依 lambda 著色，三個被選中的設計標示在低 JS 的一端。","credit":"Team Michigan, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6278","team":"Stanford University","section":"Undergrad","country":"USA","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/stanford-university/","rank":230,"awards":["Grand Prize Winner (Undergrad)","Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["總冠軍（大學組）","Top 10（大學組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳治療專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"KelePatch","projectTitle_zh":"KelePatch","tagline":"A logic-gated, cell-state-specific RNA therapy for keloid scars, delivered by a microneedle patch shaped to the wound.","tagline_zh":"一種以邏輯閘控制、具細胞狀態專一性的蟹足腫 RNA 療法，透過依傷口形狀製作的微針貼片遞送。","summary":"KelePatch builds an ADAR-based RADAR RNA sensor that only switches on inside keloid myofibroblasts, so a therapeutic payload is produced in diseased cells and not in healthy skin. The team designed a 26-part modular sensor collection across five fibrosis transcripts (ADAM12, POSTN, ASPN, COL11A1, SPP1), validated them in HEK293 cells, combined the two best into a dual-input AND gate for extra selectivity, and tested in healthy dermal fibroblasts and keloid-derived fibroblasts; they also paired a sensor with Cas12a2 to show the output is not limited to fluorescent reporters. Alongside the wet lab they built RADAR-Scout, a published web platform that takes a cell type and a gene and returns a ranked, structure-aware list of RADAR sensor candidates plus a mechanistic simulation of how it will behave. It won the Grand Prize because every layer connects: 960,518 single cells of transcriptomics pick the trigger, ViennaRNA folding energy ranks the sensor, ODE models explain the delay they saw at the bench, and a U-Net++ computer vision pipeline turns a photo of a scar into a 3D-printable patch.","summary_zh":"KelePatch 建立了一個基於 ADAR 的 RADAR RNA 感測器，只在蟹足腫的肌纖維母細胞內開啟，因此治療酬載只在病變細胞中製造，而不在健康皮膚中。團隊針對五個纖維化轉錄本（ADAM12、POSTN、ASPN、COL11A1、SPP1）設計了一套 26 個部件的模組化感測器集合，在 HEK293 細胞中驗證，再把表現最好的兩個組成雙輸入 AND 閘以提升選擇性，並在健康皮膚纖維母細胞與源自蟹足腫的纖維母細胞中測試；他們也把一個感測器與 Cas12a2 配對，證明輸出不限於螢光報告子。濕實驗室之外，他們做了 RADAR-Scout——一個已發布的網頁平台，輸入細胞類型與基因，就回傳一份考慮 RNA 結構、經排序的 RADAR 感測器候選清單，外加一套關於其行為的機制模擬。本專案獲得總冠軍，因為每一層都彼此相連：960,518 個單細胞的轉錄體資料挑出觸發標的、ViennaRNA 的摺疊能量為感測器排序、ODE 模型解釋了他們在實驗台上看到的延遲，而一套 U-Net++ 電腦視覺管線則把一張疤痕照片變成可 3D 列印的貼片。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6278/wiki/m2-fig4-trigger-selection.webp","caption":"Trigger selection in RADAR-Scout: 600 filtered genes ranked across five keloid cohorts on the left (POSTN first at DSS 1.288), with every candidate sensor for the selected gene plotted on the right, so target and sensor are chosen in one view.","credit":"Team Stanford University, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"RADAR-Scout 中的觸發標的選擇：左側把 600 個經篩選的基因在五個蟹足腫世代資料上排序（POSTN 以 DSS 1.288 居首），右側繪出所選基因的每一個候選感測器，讓標的與感測器在同一個檢視中選定。"}]},{"id":"6279","team":"UBC-Vancouver","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","village":"Diagnostics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ubc-vancouver/","rank":33,"awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Diagnostics Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳診斷專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"FAST: a point-of-care antibiotic susceptibility test","projectTitle_zh":"FAST：一套定點照護的抗生素感受性試驗","tagline":"Three devices, a 200-promoter screen and a measurement page that opens by admitting the readout is the whole diagnostic.","tagline_zh":"三件自製裝置、一次 200 個啟動子的篩選，以及一個開頭就承認讀值本身就是整個診斷的量測頁面。","summary":"UBC-Vancouver built FAST, a point-of-care antibiotic susceptibility test in which a patient sample and a candidate antibiotic are combined on a microfluidic chip, and whatever antibiotic survives that step reaches stress-responsive E. coli biosensors downstream: a susceptible sample leaves the antibiotic active, the stress promoter fires and sfGFP is expressed, while a resistant sample degrades the antibiotic and the signal stays near baseline. Because the fluorescence is the diagnosis rather than a supporting observation, the team treated measurement as the project's foundation, establishing baselines, finding the usable concentration window, measuring the response and anchoring everything to controls. Three devices remove the infrastructure a point-of-care test cannot assume: a PDMS microfluidic chip at one to five dollars, a $204.48 fluorescence detector, and a $106.68 bioreactor to produce the biosensor cultures.","summary_zh":"UBC-Vancouver 做出 FAST，一套定點照護的抗生素感受性試驗：病人樣本與候選抗生素在微流體晶片上混合，凡是在這一步仍存活的抗生素會流到下游、遇上具壓力反應的 E. coli 生物感測器——若樣本為感受性菌，抗生素仍具活性，壓力啟動子啟動並表現 sfGFP；若樣本具抗藥性，抗生素被分解，訊號就停在接近基線的位置。由於螢光就是診斷本身，而不是輔助觀察，團隊把量測當成整個專案的基礎：建立基線、找出可用的濃度區間、量測反應，並把一切錨定在對照組上。三件裝置移除了定點照護檢測不能假設存在的基礎設施：一枚成本 1 至 5 美元的 PDMS 微流體晶片、一台 204.48 美元的螢光偵測器，以及一座 106.68 美元、用來生產生物感測器菌液的生物反應器。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6279/wiki/assets/87edc504fab45511ac34a0233e32a223.avif","caption":"The overall setup of the fluorescence detection system. Aligning a 488 nm LED, the sample, a 500 nm long-pass filter and a photodiode on a single vertical axis removed one of the two optical filters conventional detectors need, cutting optical material cost by at least half.","credit":"Team UBC-Vancouver, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"螢光偵測系統的整體配置。把 488 nm LED、樣本、500 nm 長波通濾光片與光二極體排在同一條垂直軸上，省掉了傳統偵測器所需兩片光學濾光片中的一片，使光學材料成本至少減半。"}]},{"id":"6280","team":"LYON","section":"Undergrad","country":"France","village":"Bioremediation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/lyon/","rank":129,"awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 得主（大學組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"BioThetis","projectTitle_zh":"BioThetis","tagline":"De novo protein binders anchored on cheap cellulose that capture trifluoroacetic acid from industrial water and release it with heat — no living organism in the filter.","tagline_zh":"以 de novo 設計、固定在便宜纖維素上的蛋白質結合體，從工業廢水中捕捉三氟乙酸，再用加熱把它放出來——濾材裡沒有任何活體生物。","summary":"BioThetis goes after trifluoroacetic acid, the smallest and most stubborn PFAS: an NGO found it in 34 of 36 tap water samples across eleven European countries in 2024, activated carbon barely retains short chains, ion-exchange resins are not approved for French drinking water, and reverse osmosis only concentrates TFA five to ten times at enormous energy cost — the elected official in charge of water at the Metropole de Lyon told the team a single installation would run to roughly one billion euros. Their alternative is a protein binder fused to the cellulose-binding module CBM3a, which sticks to ordinary microcrystalline cellulose with no chemical coupling, captures TFA, and gives it back when the column is heated to 65 C so the material is reusable. Because TFA weighs only 114 Da and no natural binder was on offer, they designed binders from scratch with BoltzGen — 10,000 candidates, 6,823 through the filters, top 5 kept, three taken to the bench in two anchor orientations each — and demonstrated dose-dependent TFA binding by nanoDSF that does not respond to difluoroacetic or acetic acid, so the recognition is TFA-specific. They also solved the fluoroacetate dehalogenase DAR3835 to 1.10 A, the highest resolution reported for that enzyme, and said plainly that no density on the processed datasets is attributable to TFA. It won Best Bioremediation and Best Presentation on an unusually honest project: 15 new Registry parts, 25 printable protocols, all code and all dead ends released CC BY 4.0, and a human practices record that names exactly which conversation changed which page.","summary_zh":"BioThetis 針對的是三氟乙酸，PFAS 家族中最小也最難處理的一員：一個 NGO 在 2024 年於十一個歐洲國家的 36 份自來水樣本中，有 34 份驗出它；活性碳幾乎留不住短鏈；離子交換樹脂在法國未獲准用於飲用水；而逆滲透只能把 TFA 濃縮五到十倍，代價是巨大的能耗——大里昂都會區（Metropole de Lyon）主管水務的民選官員告訴團隊，單一座設施的造價約為十億歐元。他們的替代方案是把蛋白質結合體與纖維素結合模組 CBM3a 融合，不需任何化學偶合就能黏在普通微晶纖維素上，捕捉 TFA，並在管柱加熱到 65 C 時把它還回來，使材料可重複使用。因為 TFA 只有 114 Da，而且沒有現成的天然結合蛋白可用，他們用 BoltzGen 從零設計——10,000 個候選、6,823 個通過篩選、保留前 5 名、其中三個各以兩種錨定方向進入實驗桌——並以 nanoDSF 證明劑量依賴的 TFA 結合，而且對二氟乙酸或乙酸沒有反應，所以辨識具 TFA 專一性。他們也把氟乙酸脫鹵酶 DAR3835 解到 1.10 A，是該酵素已報告的最高解析度，並明白表示處理後的資料集中沒有任何電子密度可歸因於 TFA。這個專案以罕見的誠實拿下 Best Bioremediation 與 Best Presentation：15 個新的 Registry 元件、25 份可列印的實驗協議、全部程式碼與全部走不通的路都以 CC BY 4.0 釋出，以及一份會指名「哪一場對話改了哪一頁」的人類實踐紀錄。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6280/wiki/drylab/column-schematic.avif","caption":"The packed-bed filter model in one picture: water carrying TFA at concentration C0 and flow rate Q enters a cellulose column carrying the binder, with curves for C(z,t) dissolved and q(z,t) captured showing the front moving down the bed, and the breakthrough curve as the output.","caption_zh":"一張圖講完填充床濾材模型：帶著濃度 C0 的 TFA、以流率 Q 進入的水流入一座帶結合體的纖維素管柱，溶解態 C(z,t) 與已捕捉 q(z,t) 的曲線顯示前緣沿床往下移動，而輸出就是穿透曲線。","credit":"Team LYON, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6283","team":"GYHS","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/gyhs/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"ReefBond: A Mussel-Inspired Bioadhesive for Coral Reef Restoration","projectTitle_zh":"ReefBond：一款用於珊瑚礁復育的仿貽貝生物黏著劑","tagline":"A mussel-inspired protein material, designed to help coral fragments hold on while they establish a new home.","tagline_zh":"一種受貽貝啟發的蛋白質材料，設計目的是讓珊瑚斷枝在建立新家的期間能夠附著得住。","summary":"GYHS (Guangdong Guangya High School, Guangzhou) built ReefBond, a recombinant fusion protein that joins a mussel foot protein adhesion module (Mfp3-v12 / Mfp3-v15) to an acidic mineralization module (a CARP3-derived peptide, (Asp)8, (DE)6 or (DDE)4) so that surface adhesion and interfacial mineral deposition act at the same coral-substrate interface. Eight fusion designs were expressed in E. coli BL21(DE3) from pET21a; the team reports qualitative surface-retention staining, in vitro CaCO3 deposition with SEM imaging, and a purpose-built two-version underwater test tank with a motor-guided force gauge, five-level wave generator and a six-channel monitoring interface. The project is unusually honest: nearly every claim is paired with what has not yet been measured, and no live-coral test has been done. Human Practices is the spine of the project rather than a decoration - expert and practitioner advice visibly reorders the experimental programme.","summary_zh":"GYHS（廣東廣雅中學，廣州）打造了 ReefBond，一種重組融合蛋白，把貽貝足蛋白的黏附模組（Mfp3-v12 / Mfp3-v15）與一個酸性礦化模組（源自 CARP3 的胜肽、(Asp)8、(DE)6 或 (DDE)4）接在一起，使表面黏附與界面礦物沉積作用於同一個珊瑚與基質的界面上。八種融合設計以 pET21a 在 E. coli BL21(DE3) 中表現；團隊回報了定性的表面滯留染色、搭配 SEM 影像的體外 CaCO3 沉積，以及一座自行打造、做了兩個版本的水下測試水槽，具備馬達導引的測力計、五段式造波器與六通道監測介面。這個專案誠實得不尋常：幾乎每一項主張都同時列出還沒量到什麼，而且完全沒有做過活體珊瑚測試。人類實踐是整個專案的骨幹而不是裝飾，專家與實務工作者的建議明顯重排了實驗計畫的順序。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6283/wiki/public/hp/figure-01-hp-overview.webp","caption":"Overview of Human Practices inputs, decisions and project responses: the five strands linking stakeholder advice to design, experiment, safety and follow-up.","caption_zh":"人類實踐的輸入、決策與專案回應總覽：把利害關係人建議連結到設計、實驗、安全與後續工作的五條線索。","credit":"Team GYHS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6284","team":"HUST-China","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hust-china/","rank":33,"awards":["iGEMers Prize — Winner (Undergrad & Overgrad)","Best Fashion & Cosmetics Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["iGEMers 票選獎 — 得主（大學暨研究生組）","最佳時尚與美妝專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"IRIS","projectTitle_zh":"IRIS","tagline":"Turning discarded cotton textiles into bacterial-cellulose nanocrystal films that reproduce the iridescence of kingfisher feathers, so the Dian Cui craft needs no birds","tagline_zh":"把廢棄棉織品轉化為細菌纖維素奈米晶體薄膜，重現翠鳥羽毛的虹彩，讓點翠工藝不再需要鳥","summary":"HUST-China built IRIS to resolve an ethical problem inside a Chinese intangible cultural heritage: Dian Cui, the court craft of inlaying kingfisher feathers into metal jewellery. Rather than finding another animal substitute, they went after the physics - keratin-and-air microstructures producing angle-dependent structural colour, with melanin absorbing stray light to raise saturation - and reproduced it by growing bacterial cellulose from discarded cotton textiles, converting it to cellulose nanocrystals and self-assembling those into an ordered photonic structure, layered with pigment-based functional layers. Their design philosophy, formed in dialogue with artisans and conservationists, is 'retain the aesthetic core while abandoning the outdated carrier'. They won the peer-voted iGEMers Prize, and the reasons are legible on the wiki: they hosted a regional forum for other teams modelled on the Jamboree itself, and co-produced open science-communication materials with multiple other teams rather than only publishing their own.","summary_zh":"HUST-China 做 IRIS，是為了解決一項中國非物質文化遺產內部的倫理問題：點翠——把翠鳥羽毛鑲嵌進金屬首飾的宮廷工藝。他們沒有去找另一種動物替代品，而是直接追究背後的物理：角蛋白與空氣交錯的微結構產生隨角度變化的結構色，黑色素則吸收雜散光以提高飽和度。他們改以廢棄棉織品培養細菌纖維素，再轉化為纖維素奈米晶體，讓其自組裝成有序的光子結構，並疊上以色素為基礎的功能層，重現了這個效果。與工藝師和保育人士對話後形成的設計理念是「保留美學核心，捨棄過時的載體」。他們獲得由各隊互相投票選出的 iGEMers Prize，原因在 wiki 上看得很清楚：他們仿照 Jamboree 本身的形式為其他隊伍辦了一場區域論壇，也與多支隊伍共同製作開放的科學傳播材料，而不只是發表自己的東西。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6284/wiki/image/wiki/education-wiki/education1-1.avif","caption":"The three-dimensional positioning map of educational practices: audience age against outreach domain, so every activity occupies a named cell","caption_zh":"教育實踐的三維定位圖：受眾年齡對推廣領域，每項活動都落在一個具名的格子裡","credit":"Team HUST-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6289","team":"ETH-Zurich","section":"Overgrad","country":"Switzerland","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/eth-zurich/","rank":136,"awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Software — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳軟體 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"preCISe","projectTitle_zh":"preCISe","tagline":"A modular tool for precise intracellular delivery using contractile injection systems","tagline_zh":"一套以收縮式注射系統實現精準胞內遞送的模組化工具","summary":"About 79% of the human proteome is intracellular and largely undruggable, and no approved protein therapeutic delivers an exchangeable protein cargo into the cytosol. preCISe engineers Photorhabdus virulence cassettes (PVCs), bacterial extracellular contractile injection systems that act as molecular syringes, into a retargetable delivery platform: a SpyTag/SpyCatcher-attached binder arm swaps the target without re-engineering the cage, demonstrated against CD20 on engineered mammalian cells with a piggyBac Cre-loxP reporter line (preCISion) that turns on GFP only when Cre reaches the cytosol. To raise specificity they added dual targeting, splitting the cargo across two PVCs against two receptors. It won Best Software and Best Foundational Advance because the platform ships as reusable infrastructure: 29 tested protocols, a part collection for evaluating intracellular delivery, and two open-source tools, deCISion and OpenSplitProtein.","summary_zh":"人類蛋白質體約有 79% 位於細胞內、且大多無法成藥，而目前沒有任何已核准的蛋白質藥物能把可替換的蛋白質酬載送進細胞質。preCISe 把 Photorhabdus virulence cassette（PVC）——一種細菌的胞外收縮式注射系統、功能上就像分子注射器——改造成一個可更換標的的遞送平台：一個以 SpyTag/SpyCatcher 接上的結合子臂可以替換標的，而不必重新改造整個外殼；他們以工程化哺乳類細胞上的 CD20 示範，並建立了一株以 piggyBac Cre-loxP 為基礎的報告細胞株（preCISion），只有在 Cre 真的抵達細胞質時才會打開 GFP。為提升專一性，他們加入了雙標的設計，把酬載拆分到兩個針對不同受體的 PVC 上。此專題拿下最佳軟體與最佳基礎進展獎，因為這個平台是以可重複使用的基礎設施形式交付：29 份經測試的實驗規程、一組用於評估胞內遞送的元件集合，以及兩套開源工具 deCISion 與 OpenSplitProtein。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6289/wiki/images/software/opensplitprotein/web1-03-ranked-v3.webp","caption":"OpenSplitProtein's browser interface showing every cut site in an uploaded structure ranked separately for split tolerance and fragment reassembly, instead of a single blended score.","caption_zh":"OpenSplitProtein 的瀏覽器介面，把上傳結構中的每一個切點分別就切點容忍度與片段重組能力排序，而非給出單一混合分數。","credit":"Team ETH-Zurich, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6292","team":"Stockholm","section":"Overgrad","country":"Sweden","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/stockholm/","rank":26,"awards":["Safety and Security Award — Winner (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["安全與保安獎 — 得主（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"TIDE","projectTitle_zh":"TIDE","tagline":"A yeast that senses bisphenol A and degrades it from the same sensing event, rebuilt as a contained reactor after three experts said open release would never fly","tagline_zh":"一株能偵測雙酚 A、並由同一個偵測事件啟動分解的酵母；在三位專家都說開放釋放絕無可能之後，重新設計成封閉式反應器","summary":"Stockholm (KTH) built TIDE, a three-plasmid Saccharomyces cerevisiae system: a detection module encoding a synthetic LexA-mER-alpha transcription factor, a degradation module encoding laccase, and a GFP reporter, so that detecting BPA also triggers its breakdown. They assembled by Gibson, verified by sequencing, read GFP by microscopy and 96-well plate, measured laccase by a modified ABTS assay at 420 nm and BPA removal by LC-MS, and built a modular dry-lab pipeline (structure prediction with pLDDT/PAE early screening, then batch docking of a bisphenol analogue panel). They won the Safety and Security Award in the Overgrad section, and the reason is visible in the work: a three-expert advisory board, a formal STPA hazard analysis, a published wastewater-containment guidebook for future teams, and a documented decision to abandon their own central deployment assumption.","summary_zh":"Stockholm（KTH）做出 TIDE，一套三質體的 Saccharomyces cerevisiae 系統：偵測模組編碼一個合成的 LexA-mER-alpha 轉錄因子，分解模組編碼漆酶，再加一個 GFP 報告基因，使得偵測到 BPA 的同時也觸發它的分解。他們以 Gibson 組裝、以定序確認，用顯微鏡與 96 孔盤讀取 GFP，以改良的 ABTS 分析在 420 nm 測漆酶活性，並以 LC-MS 測 BPA 去除率，另外建了一條模組化的乾實驗流程（先做結構預測並以 pLDDT/PAE 早期篩選，再對一組雙酚類似物進行批次對接）。他們拿下 Overgrad 組的安全與保安獎，而原因在作品中看得見：一個三位專家組成的諮詢委員會、一份正式的 STPA 危害分析、一本公開給未來隊伍使用的廢水圍阻指南，以及一份明確放棄自己核心部署假設的紀錄。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6292/wiki/safety-and-security/figure1-stpa-control-structure.avif","caption":"STPA control structure for TIDE, mapping regulators, developers, operator, the engineered yeast and independent BPA measurement, with control actions as solid lines and feedback as dashed","caption_zh":"TIDE 的 STPA 控制結構，盤點法規機關、開發者、操作者、工程化酵母與獨立的 BPA 量測，控制行動以實線、回饋以虛線表示","credit":"Team Stockholm, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6294","team":"SDU-Denmark","section":"Overgrad","country":"Denmark","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/sdu-denmark/","rank":14,"awards":["Best Alternative Platform — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Measurement — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳替代平台 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳量測 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"Shewanode","projectTitle_zh":"Shewanode","tagline":"A microbial fuel cell built from scratch, and a measurement workflow for the outer membrane vesicles that carry its electrons.","tagline_zh":"一座從零打造的微生物燃料電池，以及一套量測承載其電子的外膜囊泡的工作流程。","summary":"SDU-Denmark engineered Shewanella oneidensis MR-1 to improve extracellular electron transfer and built the hardware to measure it: first a two-chamber microbial fuel cell as proof of concept, then a single-chamber design with an air-breathing cathode and carbon felt electrode that became the team's primary electrochemical measurement system. The measurement work centres on the outer membrane vesicles that carry the MtrCAB cytochrome complex, asking how to isolate them reproducibly and how to quantify their size, morphology, charge and concentration. Each question is answered with complementary methods, each with stated calibration, controls, replicates and limitations. Along the way the team documented a working anolyte recipe, which the literature generally leaves as 'Shewanella basal medium', and released it for other teams.","summary_zh":"SDU-Denmark 改造 Shewanella oneidensis MR-1 以提升胞外電子傳遞，並自行做出量測它的硬體：先是一座雙室微生物燃料電池作為概念驗證，之後是採用空氣呼吸陰極與碳氈電極的單室設計，後者成為團隊主要的電化學量測系統。量測工作的核心是承載 MtrCAB 細胞色素複合體的外膜囊泡，要問的是如何可重現地分離它們，以及如何量化它們的大小、形態、電荷與濃度。每個問題都以互補的方法回答，每一種方法都寫明校正、對照、重複次數與限制。過程中團隊也把一份可行的陽極液配方記錄下來，文獻通常只寫成 Shewanella basal medium，而他們把配方公開給其他團隊使用。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6294/wiki/wetlab/calibration-curve-bca.avif","caption":"Calibration curve for the bicinchoninic acid assay: blank-corrected absorbance at 562 nm against a dilution series of bovine serum albumin, used to convert fraction absorbances into protein concentration.","caption_zh":"二喹啉甲酸（BCA）分析的校正曲線：扣除空白後在 562 nm 的吸光度對牛血清白蛋白稀釋系列作圖，用來把各分管的吸光度換算成蛋白濃度。","credit":"Team SDU-Denmark, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6295","team":"Princeton","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/princeton/","rank":205,"awards":["2nd Runner-up (Undergrad)","Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Measurement — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["季軍（大學組）","Top 10（大學組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳量測 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"SymPleco: Making Precision Sequestration Sym-ple","projectTitle_zh":"SymPleco：讓精準捕捉變簡單（Making Precision Sequestration Sym-ple）","tagline":"One M13 phage chassis, any cargo — bulk-capacity adsorption with antibody-grade specificity and light-triggered release.","tagline_zh":"一個 M13 噬菌體載體、任意貨物——兼具大容量吸附、抗體級專一性與光觸發釋放。","summary":"SymPleco attacks a trade-off that runs through all remediation chemistry: activated carbon captures a lot but cannot tell similar molecules apart, while monoclonal antibodies bind precisely but need harsh pH or chaotropic salts to release and cannot be recovered or scaled. Princeton's answer is a filamentous M13 bacteriophage used as a programmable adsorbent: sortase A-mediated ligation staples engineered fusion proteins onto the N-terminus of every pVIII copy (making 'furry' phage that bypass classical display size limits), with pIII carrying a Cg-Defensin anchor for PLA filter attachment, a VHH7 nanobody for macrophage clearance, and an AsLOV2 optomonobody that holds cargo in the dark and lets go under 450 nm light. Because swapping the target means swapping only the displayed binder, the team paired it with SymPlify, a de novo binder design pipeline, so a new target does not wait on a new antibody. It won on foundational-advance logic: a genuinely modular chassis demonstrated across three deliberately unrelated applications (melanoma exosome sequestration, Parkinson's alpha-synuclein interception, microcystin/BPA water remediation), backed by an unusually self-critical ODE model and an IRB-approved patient engagement programme.","summary_zh":"SymPleco 針對貫穿所有污染整治化學的一個取捨下手：活性碳吸附量大，卻無法分辨結構相近的分子；單株抗體結合精準，但需要劇烈的 pH 或離液鹽才能釋放，而且無法回收、也難以放大。Princeton 的答案是把絲狀 M13 噬菌體當成可程式化的吸附劑：以 sortase A 媒介的接合把工程化融合蛋白釘在每一份 pVIII 的 N 端（做出「毛茸茸」的噬菌體，繞過傳統展示技術的尺寸限制），而 pIII 則帶著用於附著 PLA 濾材的 Cg-Defensin 錨定子、供巨噬細胞清除的 VHH7 奈米抗體，以及一個 AsLOV2 光控單體抗體——在暗處抓住貨物，在 450 nm 光照下放手。由於更換標的只需要更換所展示的結合蛋白，團隊另外搭配了 SymPlify，一條 de novo 結合蛋白設計管線，讓新標的不必等待新抗體。它靠基礎進展的邏輯獲獎：一個真正模組化的載體，在三個刻意互不相關的應用上得到驗證（黑色素瘤外泌體捕捉、帕金森氏症 alpha-synuclein 攔截、微囊藻毒素／BPA 水體整治），背後還有一個異常自我批判的 ODE 模型，以及一個經 IRB 核准的病患參與計畫。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6295/wiki/figures/symplify-hotspots-protein.avif","caption":"SymPlify's hotspot selection screen: the protein target rendered in 3D and coloured by PeSTo binding probability, with top hotspot residues listed by confidence so low-scoring ones can be removed to leave the focused patch of three to five that BindCraft works best with.","credit":"Team Princeton, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"SymPlify 的熱點選擇畫面：蛋白質標的以 3D 呈現並依 PeSTo 結合機率著色，結合信賴度最高的熱點殘基列於旁側，使用者可移除低分殘基，留下 BindCraft 表現最好的三到五個殘基構成的聚焦區塊。"}]},{"id":"6296","team":"KIT","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","village":"Foundational Advance","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/kit/","rank":26,"awards":["Inclusivity Award — Winner (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["包容性獎 — 得主（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"ENCORE - Engineered Nanocompartments for Capture, Optimization and Reactor Engineering","projectTitle_zh":"ENCORE - Engineered Nanocompartments for Capture, Optimization and Reactor Engineering","tagline":"A standardized modular Golden Gate toolkit that expresses self-assembling encapsulin nanocompartments with custom cargo in yeast","tagline_zh":"一套標準化的模組式 Golden Gate 工具組，可在酵母中表現會自組裝的 encapsulin 奈米區室並搭載自選載物","summary":"KIT, the first iGEM team at Karlsruhe Institute of Technology, built ENCORE: a standardised modular cloning system (the toolKIT) that co-expresses a self-assembling encapsulin protein nanocompartment and its cargo in Saccharomyces cerevisiae, chosen because encapsulins assemble from a single repeating subunit and so need far fewer transcriptional units than bacterial microcompartments or virus-like particles. They won the 2026 Inclusivity Award for work that turned inward rather than outward: instead of role-model campaigns, they asked how tasks are actually distributed inside scientific teams and what role gender plays, surveyed 71 people, ran proper statistics, and published the negative result honestly. The resulting deliverables - a facilitated workshop with moderation guide and printable worksheet, and TeamKIT, a team-and-meeting-culture guide - are the reusable artefacts.","summary_zh":"KIT 是 Karlsruhe Institute of Technology 的第一支 iGEM 團隊，他們做出 ENCORE：一套標準化的模組式選殖系統（toolKIT），可在 Saccharomyces cerevisiae 中共同表現一個會自組裝的 encapsulin 蛋白質奈米區室與其載物；選 encapsulin 的理由是它由單一重複次單元組裝而成，因此所需的轉錄單元遠少於細菌微區室或類病毒顆粒。他們拿下 2026 年的 Inclusivity Award，靠的是把目光往內而不是往外：他們沒有做典範人物宣傳，而是去問科學團隊內部的任務實際上是怎麼分配的、性別在其中扮演什麼角色，調查了 71 人、做了正規統計，然後誠實地把負面結果公開。由此產出的交付成果——一套附帶帶領指南與可列印學習單的工作坊，以及團隊與會議文化指南 TeamKIT——才是可重複使用的成品。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6296/wiki/human-practices-resp/who-does-what-in-a-team/campus-day-presurvey-heptagon.avif","caption":"The heptagon pre-survey: visitors placed a gender-coded dot on the task category they most often take on in teamwork (n = 58)","caption_zh":"七邊形前導調查：訪客在自己在團隊合作中最常承擔的任務類別上貼一個依性別標色的點（n = 58）","credit":"Team KIT, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6297","team":"McMaster-Canada","section":"Undergrad","country":"Canada","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/mcmaster-canada/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"Chariot: A Platform Technology for OMV-based Therapeutics","projectTitle_zh":"Chariot：一個以 OMV 為基礎的療法平台技術","tagline":"Inducible loading of bacterial outer membrane vesicles, plus the standardised generation, isolation and characterisation protocols the field does not have.","tagline_zh":"細菌外膜囊泡的可誘導裝載，加上這個領域目前所缺的標準化生成、分離與表徵流程。","summary":"McMaster built Chariot, a platform that loads cargo into bacterial outer membrane vesicles (OMVs) using the VNp tagging system, so that accumulation of a VNp-fused protein forces membrane curvature and vesiculation under an inducible promoter. Having identified that OMV work is held back less by biology than by the absence of standard methods, the team made measurement the project: they characterised VNp-driven OMV generation, benchmarked four isolation methods against a shared filtrate reference, and wrote everything into an openly published Protocol Handbook. Alongside this sits Apollo and Artemis, an in-silico platform combining GFlowNet-based active learning for peptide design with molecular dynamics for VNp-cargo compatibility. The project was shaped by 40 stakeholder interviews run through a purpose-built OMVS framework.","summary_zh":"McMaster 打造了 Chariot，一個以 VNp 標籤系統把載運物裝進細菌外膜囊泡（OMV）的平台：在可誘導啟動子之下，VNp 融合蛋白的累積會強迫膜彎曲並形成囊泡。團隊認定 OMV 研究受限的原因，與其說是生物學，不如說是缺乏標準方法，於是把量測本身當成專案主體：他們表徵了 VNp 驅動的 OMV 生成、以共用的濾液作為參考基準對四種分離方法做對標，並把一切寫進一本公開發行的實驗流程手冊。與此並列的是 Apollo 與 Artemis，一個電腦模擬平台，把基於 GFlowNet 的主動學習用於胜肽設計，並以分子動力學模擬評估 VNp 與載運物的相容性。整個專案由 40 場利害關係人訪談所形塑，訪談則透過一套專為此目的建立的 OMVS 框架進行。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6297/wiki/measurement/measure-sds-page.avif","caption":"12% SDS-PAGE of E. coli BL21(DE3) pET26b(+) 6xHis-mNeonGreen-VNp6 induction and OMV isolation products. ImageJ densitometry on this gel gave 41% recovery of total extracellular mNeonGreen through the isolation.","caption_zh":"E. coli BL21(DE3) pET26b(+) 6xHis-mNeonGreen-VNp6 誘導與 OMV 分離產物的 12% SDS-PAGE。對這張膠做 ImageJ 密度定量，得到胞外 mNeonGreen 總量在分離過程中的回收率為 41%。","credit":"Team McMaster-Canada, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6300","team":"NU Boston","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nu-boston/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"Soil Shield, with the FLARE soil simulation chamber","projectTitle_zh":"Soil Shield，搭配 FLARE 土壤模擬艙","tagline":"A $300 fluorescence macroscope and controlled soil chamber that tests whether a strain still works under post-wildfire stress, instead of assuming it will.","tagline_zh":"一台 $300 的螢光巨觀成像儀與受控土壤艙，用來檢驗菌株在野火後的逆境下是否仍然有效，而不是逕自假設它會有效。","summary":"NU Boston engineered Pseudomonas putida to survive post-wildfire soil conditions while degrading polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons, using the ectABC/D hydroxyectoine pathway for desiccation tolerance and a salicylate-dependent ccdA/ccdB toxin-antitoxin kill switch for biocontainment. Their hardware answer to the obvious objection, that a strain which works on a bench says little about a burnt hillside, is FLARE: a light-tight soil chamber that recreates oxidative stress and desiccation and images salicylate fluorescence in situ. It replaces lasers and arc lamps with 295 nm UVB COB LEDs and a 410 nm bandpass filter, bringing a fluorescence imaging rig that commercially costs thousands to tens of thousands of dollars down to roughly $300 to $500 in parts, with the full bill of materials published line by line.","summary_zh":"NU Boston 改造 Pseudomonas putida，使其能在野火後的土壤條件下存活並同時降解多環芳香烴，以 ectABC/D 的 hydroxyectoine 途徑取得耐乾燥性，並用依賴水楊酸鹽的 ccdA/ccdB 毒素-抗毒素自殺開關做生物圍阻。面對最明顯的質疑，也就是一株在實驗桌上有效的菌株對一片燒過的山坡幾乎說明不了什麼，他們的硬體答案是 FLARE：一個不透光的土壤艙，能重現氧化壓力與乾燥逆境，並就地拍攝水楊酸鹽的螢光。它以 295 nm 的 UVB COB LED 與 410 nm 帶通濾光片取代雷射與弧光燈，把商用價格數千至數萬美元的螢光成像設備壓到約 300 至 500 美元的零件成本，而完整的 BOM 逐項公開。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6300/wiki/hardware/hardware.avif","caption":"FLARE, the team's controlled soil chamber and fluorescence macroscope. The laser-cut opaque black acrylic enclosure keeps ambient light out so the UV/camera module can image salicylate fluorescence directly in soil.","caption_zh":"FLARE，團隊的受控土壤艙與螢光巨觀成像儀。雷射切割的不透光黑色壓克力外殼阻絕環境光，讓 UV／相機模組能直接在土壤中拍攝水楊酸鹽螢光。","credit":"Team NU Boston, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6301","team":"UCNZ","section":"Undergrad","country":"New Zealand","village":"Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ucnz/","rank":91,"awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳創業 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"NanoBrew","projectTitle_zh":"NanoBrew","tagline":"Enzymatic production of nanocellulose from brewers' spent grain - turning 39 million tonnes a year of brewing waste into a high-value biomaterial.","tagline_zh":"以酵素從啤酒糟生產奈米纖維素——把每年 3,900 萬公噸的釀酒廢棄物變成高值生物材料。","summary":"NanoBrew takes brewers' spent grain (BSG), which makes up about 85% of beer brewing waste by weight and is mostly landfilled or sold as cheap animal feed, and extracts nanocellulose from it enzymatically instead of with hot acid and energy-intensive mechanical grinding. The team expressed a Bacillus subtilis xylanase (XynA) to strip hemicellulose and open up the cellulose, plus an ancestrally reconstructed Cel5A endoglucanase fused to a carbohydrate binding module to cut cellulose down to nanofibrils, and tested six construct variants with and without the YebF secretion tag in E. coli. It was Top 10 and nominated for Presentation, Entrepreneurship and Biomanufacturing because the project is framed end to end as a New Zealand circular-economy story - built on a real brewery partnership, grounded in the Maori value of kaitiakitanga, with a full pilot-plant cost analysis and letters of support - and because the team is candid that it never managed to characterise its product. No previous iGEM team had extracted nanocellulose from lignocellulosic plant material rather than growing it bacterially.","summary_zh":"NanoBrew 以啤酒糟（BSG）為原料——它以重量計約占啤酒釀造廢棄物的 85%，目前大多進入掩埋場或低價賣作動物飼料——改用酵素、而不是熱酸與高耗能的機械研磨來萃取奈米纖維素。團隊表現了一個 Bacillus subtilis 的木聚醣酶（XynA）以剝除半纖維素、把纖維素暴露出來，並表現一個經祖先序列重建的 Cel5A 內切葡聚醣酶、融合一個碳水化合物結合模組，把纖維素切到奈米纖絲尺度；他們在 E. coli 中測試了六種構築版本，分別帶與不帶 YebF 分泌標籤。此專題進入前十並獲簡報、創業與生物製造三項提名，因為整個專題從頭到尾被框成一個紐西蘭循環經濟的故事——建立在一段真實的釀酒廠合作關係上、紮根於毛利人的 kaitiakitanga（守護）價值，並附有完整的試量產廠成本分析與支持函——也因為團隊坦白承認自己始終沒能完成產品的特性分析。此前沒有任何 iGEM 隊伍從木質纖維素植物材料中萃取奈米纖維素，過去都是用細菌培養出來的。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6301/wiki/hp/fig-2.avif","caption":"The causal loop diagram: 12 nodes linking the environmental, economic and social effects of an upscaled NanoBrew process, with each link signed positive or negative and the graph decomposed into balancing and reinforcing loops - including the circular-economy rebound effect raised by regulatory stakeholders.","caption_zh":"因果迴圈圖：12 個節點串起 NanoBrew 流程放大後的環境、經濟與社會效應，每條連結都標上正負號，整張圖並分解成平衡迴圈與增強迴圈——其中包括法規方面的利害關係人所提出的循環經濟反彈效應。","credit":"Team UCNZ, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6306","team":"NYCU-Taiwan","section":"Undergrad","country":"Taiwan","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nycu-taiwan/","rank":26,"awards":["Best Project Promotion Video — Winner (Undergrad & Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳專案宣傳影片 — 得主（大學暨研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"BITE — Biosensing for Instant Target Pathogen Evaluation","projectTitle_zh":"BITE——即時目標病原評估的生物感測（Biosensing for Instant Target Pathogen Evaluation）","tagline":"A two-chamber swab that turns Cas12a collateral cleavage into a blue colour you can read with your eyes","tagline_zh":"一支雙腔室採樣棒，把 Cas12a 的附帶切割變成肉眼就讀得出來的藍色","summary":"NYCU-Taiwan built BITE, a hand-operated two-chamber cartridge for foodborne Salmonella detection: chamber one releases magnetic beads carrying DNA capture probes plus lysis buffer, heat lysis frees bacterial DNA, a magnet concentrates the bead-bound target, then chamber two delivers Cas12a with crRNA and a hairpin reporter whose G-rich segment, once cleaved, folds into a potassium-stabilised G-quadruplex that binds hemin to form a DNAzyme and oxidises TMB from colourless to blue. The point of the design is that the final step needs no instrument. They won Best Project Promotion Video in the Undergrad/Overgrad section, and the same communication discipline runs through the wiki, which is built as a scroll-driven narrative rather than a document.","summary_zh":"NYCU-Taiwan 做出 BITE，一個手動操作的雙腔室匣式裝置，用於檢測食品中的沙門氏菌：第一腔室釋出帶有 DNA 捕捉探針的磁珠與裂解緩衝液，加熱裂解釋出細菌 DNA，再以磁鐵把結合在磁珠上的目標濃縮；接著第二腔室送出帶 crRNA 的 Cas12a 與一個髮夾報導子，其富含 G 的片段一旦被切斷，就會折疊成由鉀離子穩定的 G-四聯體，結合 hemin 形成 DNAzyme，把 TMB 由無色氧化成藍色。這個設計的重點在於最後一步不需要任何儀器。他們獲得大學部／研究生組的 Best Project Promotion Video 獎，而同一份溝通紀律貫穿整個 wiki——它是以捲動驅動的敘事方式建成，而不是一份文件。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6306/wiki/01-home/279-home-walk-dev-base.webp","caption":"One layer of the exploded BITE device walkthrough, built from dozens of separately drawn illustration components so the cartridge can be assembled step by step as the reader scrolls","credit":"Team NYCU-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"BITE 裝置爆炸圖導覽中的一層，由數十個分別繪製的插圖元件組成，讀者一邊捲動，匣式裝置就一步一步組起來"}]},{"id":"6308","team":"Tsinghua-T","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Fashion & Cosmetics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/tsinghua-t/","rank":40,"awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Fashion & Cosmetics Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 得主（大學組）","最佳時尚與美妝專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"GALATEA","projectTitle_zh":"GALATEA","tagline":"Yeast-based glabridin production inside engineered liquid-liquid phase-separated condensates, with success criteria written by industry","tagline_zh":"在人工設計的液-液相分離凝聚體中以酵母生產光甘草定，而成功的標準是由產業界寫下的","summary":"Glabridin is 0.08-0.35% of licorice root dry weight and all three Glycyrrhiza species are on China's National Key Protected Wild Plants Catalogue, so one gram of the skincare active corresponds to roughly 286-1,250 g of dried root; GALATEA replaces that extraction route with Saccharomyces cerevisiae. The team built tunable protein condensates - an FTH1-24 ferritin iron core as nucleation seed, intrinsically disordered regions, and an SH3/PDZ scaffold at 3:1 recruiting the OC and DMT enzymes - instead of relying on random co-localisation. Their integrated human practices is organised as a four-act loop (Define, Optimize, Calibrate, Echo) in which each act must produce a change, and the loop closes by returning the engineering improvements to the same 96 street respondents for re-validation. Advice from Tsinghua chemical engineering professors reordered the biosynthetic pathway itself, and seven company visits rewrote the project's definition of success.","summary_zh":"光甘草定只佔甘草根乾重的 0.08-0.35%，而三種甘草屬植物全都列入中國《國家重點保護野生植物名錄》，因此 1 公克這種護膚活性成分約相當於 286-1,250 公克乾燥根；GALATEA 以 Saccharomyces cerevisiae 取代這條萃取路線。團隊建了可調的蛋白質凝聚體——以 FTH1-24 鐵蛋白的鐵核作為成核種子、內在無序區段，以及以 3:1 比例招募 OC 與 DMT 兩個酵素的 SH3/PDZ 骨架——而不是依賴隨機的共定位。他們的整合式人類實踐編成一個四幕的迴圈（Define、Optimize、Calibrate、Echo），每一幕都必須產出一項改變，而整個迴圈以「把工程上的改良帶回給同一批 96 位街訪受訪者重新驗證」來閉合。清華大學化工系教授的建議改變了生合成途徑本身的順序，而七次企業參訪則重寫了這個專案對成功的定義。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6308/wiki/assests/human-practice/hp-figure-10-01.avif","caption":"Expert interviews with the Department of Chemical Engineering, Tsinghua University - the conversation that moved the promiscuous DMT demethylation step to the end of the pathway","caption_zh":"與清華大學化工系的專家訪談——正是這場對話，把雜泛性高的 DMT 去甲基化步驟移到途徑最末端","credit":"Team Tsinghua-T, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6329","team":"Baltimore","section":"High School","country":"United States","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/baltimore/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"KeraTINT","projectTitle_zh":"KeraTINT","tagline":"A chromoprotein-keratin-binding-peptide fusion that colours hair and repairs it in the same step","tagline_zh":"一個色蛋白與角蛋白結合肽的融合蛋白，在同一個步驟中既染色又修護頭髮","summary":"Baltimore Biocrew, based at the Baltimore Underground Science Space community lab, engineered fusion proteins joining chromoproteins (aeblue, UM) to keratin-binding peptides so that a semi-permanent dye deposits colour while reinforcing the hair shaft. The entrepreneurship work was run through iGEM's Venture Creation Labs curriculum, the same incubator route their 2023 project RhizeUp took, and it produced an OKR table with numeric key results, a scored risk register, a US-specific patent strategy and a competitor map. Market evidence rests on two IRB-approved consumer surveys (56 then 54 responses, translated into Chinese and Filipino) plus named interviews with a cosmetics founder, two L'Oreal North America hair-colour-lab staff, a cosmetology student and the Boeke Lab at NYU Langone. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship in the High School section.","summary_zh":"Baltimore Biocrew 以 Baltimore Underground Science Space 社群實驗室為基地，工程改造出把色蛋白（aeblue、UM）與角蛋白結合肽接起來的融合蛋白，讓半永久染髮劑在沉積顏色的同時強化髮幹。創業工作透過 iGEM 的 Venture Creation Labs 課程進行，和他們 2023 年的專案 RhizeUp 走的是同一條育成路徑，產出一張附具體數值關鍵結果的 OKR 表、一份有評分的風險登錄表、一套針對美國的專利策略，以及一張競爭者地圖。市場證據建立在兩份經 IRB 核准的消費者調查（先 56 份、後 54 份回覆，並翻譯成中文與菲律賓語）之上，另有具名訪談對象：一位化妝品公司創辦人、兩位 L'Oreal 北美染髮實驗室人員、一位美容科學生，以及 NYU Langone 的 Boeke Lab。他們入圍高中組最佳創業獎。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6329/wiki/entrepreneurship/lbmc.avif","caption":"KeraTINT lean business model canvas identifying local salons and cosmetic companies as first customers","caption_zh":"KeraTINT 的精實商業模式畫布，把在地沙龍與化妝品公司列為首批客戶","credit":"Team Baltimore, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6330","team":"HBUT-China","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hbut-china/","rank":52,"awards":["Best New Basic Part — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Oncology Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 得主（大學組）","最佳腫瘤專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"IGNITE — oHSV2-Neo-IL-2","projectTitle_zh":"IGNITE — oHSV2-Neo-IL-2","tagline":"An AI-redesigned IL-2 that activates CD8 T cells without expanding Tregs, delivered from an oncolytic HSV-2 into microsatellite-stable cold tumours","tagline_zh":"一種經 AI 重新設計的 IL-2，能活化 CD8 T 細胞而不擴增 Treg，並以溶瘤型 HSV-2 遞送至微衛星穩定的冷腫瘤","summary":"HBUT-China targeted microsatellite-stable colorectal cancer, the roughly 80-85 percent of advanced cases that behave as immunologically cold tumours, by arming an attenuated oncolytic herpes simplex virus type 2 with an engineered interleukin-2. Their Best New Basic Part, Neo-IL-2, is an AI-guided interface redesign that weakens binding to IL-2R-alpha (CD25) while keeping signalling through the IL-2R-beta/gamma-c complex, so it activates CD8 T cells and NK cells without driving the regulatory T-cell expansion and dose-limiting toxicity that have crippled wild-type IL-2. The cassette was recombined into an HG52 backbone already deleted for ICP34.5 (neurovirulence) and ICP47 (TAP inhibition, so MHC class I presentation is restored), replacing a CMV-GFP cassette at the gamma-34.5 locus. They won Best New Basic Part in the Undergrad section and Best Oncology Project.","summary_zh":"HBUT-China 針對微衛星穩定（MSS）型結腸直腸癌，也就是在晚期病例中約占 80-85%、表現為免疫冷腫瘤的那一群，做法是為一株減毒的溶瘤型第 2 型單純疱疹病毒裝上經改造的介白素-2。他們獲得 Best New Basic Part 的 Neo-IL-2 是一項以 AI 引導的界面重新設計，削弱與 IL-2R-alpha（CD25）的結合，同時保留透過 IL-2R-beta/gamma-c 複合體的訊號傳遞，因此能活化 CD8 T 細胞與 NK 細胞，而不會引發重創野生型 IL-2 的調節型 T 細胞擴增與劑量限制毒性。該表現匣以同源重組置入已刪除 ICP34.5（神經毒力）與 ICP47（TAP 抑制，因此 MHC class I 呈現得以恢復）的 HG52 骨架，取代 gamma-34.5 位點上原有的 CMV-GFP 匣。他們在 Undergrad 組獲得 Best New Basic Part 與 Best Oncology Project。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6330/wiki/safety/wiki/safety/review-20261019/d-shield-framework.webp","caption":"The SHIELD safety framework, consolidating safety-by-design, wet-lab governance, hardware infrastructure, emergency response, training and outreach into one reusable full-chain paradigm","caption_zh":"SHIELD 安全框架，把設計階段安全、濕實驗治理、硬體基礎設施、緊急應變、訓練與推廣整合成一個可重用的全鏈範式","credit":"Team HBUT-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6337","team":"NJU-China","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nju-china/","rank":33,"awards":["Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Software & AI Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳軟體與 AI專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"Starase Atlas — Atlas-BRIDGE, Atlas-COMPASS and Atlas-EDGE for enzyme discovery","projectTitle_zh":"Starase Atlas — 用於酵素探索的 Atlas-BRIDGE、Atlas-COMPASS 與 Atlas-EDGE","tagline":"Given a target reaction and limited experimental resources, which enzyme candidates should a researcher test first?","tagline_zh":"在目標反應已定、實驗資源有限的情況下，研究者該優先測試哪些酵素候選？","summary":"NJU-China built a three-part platform around one decision: which enzyme to test next. Atlas-BRIDGE (Broad Retrieval with Inference-Driven Gated Experts) is a dual-tower contrastive retrieval model that will rank any protein it can encode, then lets specialist 'expert' models and two kinds of memory nudge that ranking only where their evidence genuinely applies; Atlas-COMPASS is a natural-language agent front end that resolves entities before it computes anything; Atlas-EDGE is a MySQL/graph knowledge base of compound nodes and enzyme edges built from UniProt, Rhea and ChEBI. The model's recommendation was then taken to the bench: M5AW86 was predicted and confirmed to convert FPP to beta-farnesene by GC-MS, TLC and 1H NMR against empty-vector controls. It won Best Software & AI Project and was nominated for Best Model.","summary_zh":"NJU-China 圍繞一個決策做出三件一組的平台：下一個該測哪個酵素。Atlas-BRIDGE（Broad Retrieval with Inference-Driven Gated Experts）是一個雙塔對比式檢索模型，能對任何可被編碼的蛋白質排序，再讓專門的專家模型與兩種記憶機制，只在其證據真正適用的地方微調這個排序；Atlas-COMPASS 是自然語言代理前端，在開始計算之前先把實體解析清楚；Atlas-EDGE 則是以 MySQL 與圖結構建立的知識庫，節點是化合物、邊是酵素，資料來自 UniProt、Rhea 與 ChEBI。模型的推薦後來真的拿到實驗台上驗證：M5AW86 被預測、並經 GC-MS、TLC 與 1H NMR 與空載體對照比較後確認可把 FPP 轉成 beta-farnesene。這個專案拿下 Best Software & AI Project，並入圍 Best Model。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6337/wiki/model/model.avif","caption":"Atlas-BRIDGE architecture: a shared dual-tower retrieval geometry that will score any encodable protein or reaction, with query-level gated experts and dual (long-term graph plus episodic) memory applying additive corrections only inside their valid scope.","caption_zh":"Atlas-BRIDGE 架構：一個共用的雙塔檢索幾何，可以為任何可編碼的蛋白質或反應打分，並以查詢層級閘控的專家模型與雙重記憶（長期圖記憶加情節記憶），在各自有效的範圍內做加法式修正。","credit":"Team NJU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6338","team":"ASIJ-Tokyo","section":"High School","country":"Japan","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/asij-tokyo/","rank":21,"awards":["Best Part Collection — Nominee (High School)","Best Education — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"awards_zh":["最佳元件集 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"projectTitle":"Project 茶(Sa)kure-it-all","projectTitle_zh":"Project 茶(Sa)kure-it-all","tagline":"Yeast cocultures that produce four plant specialized metabolites from sakura and tea - sakuranetin, quercetin, EGCG and L-theanine - without the plant","tagline_zh":"以酵母共培養生產四種來自櫻花與茶的植物特化代謝物——sakuranetin、quercetin、EGCG 與 L-theanine——而不需要植物本身","summary":"ASIJ-Tokyo engineered Saccharomyces cerevisiae to make four plant specialized metabolites tied to Japanese culture: sakuranetin, quercetin, EGCG and L-theanine. Rather than one overloaded strain, they split pathways across cocultured strains at optimised ratios (7:3 for sakuranetin and quercetin, 5:3:2 for the three-strain EGCG system), with every enzyme cassette behind a GAL promoter and a constitutive pTEF1 fluorescent reporter so strain ratios can be verified before induction. Their education portfolio is unusually broad for a high-school team and explicitly gap-driven: each activity was created to fill a named gap they had identified. They contributed 34 new parts, a no-HPLC semi-quantitative screening workflow and a low-cost DIY bioreactor with full build instructions, all aimed at other resource-limited high-school teams.","summary_zh":"ASIJ-Tokyo 改造 Saccharomyces cerevisiae 來製造四種與日本文化相連的植物特化代謝物：sakuranetin、quercetin、EGCG 與 L-theanine。他們沒有把全部路徑硬塞進單一菌株，而是把路徑拆分到以最佳比例共培養的多個菌株（sakuranetin 與 quercetin 為 7:3，三菌株的 EGCG 系統為 5:3:2），每個酵素卡匣都置於 GAL 啟動子之下，並加上組成型 pTEF1 螢光報告子，使菌株比例能在誘導前先行確認。他們的教育作品組合對高中隊伍而言格外廣泛，而且明確由缺口驅動：每一項活動都是為填補他們指認出的某個特定缺口而設計。團隊貢獻了 34 個新部件、一套無須 HPLC 的半定量篩選流程，以及一台附完整製作說明的低成本自製生物反應器，全都瞄準其他資源有限的高中隊伍。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6338/wiki/education/crafting-screenshot.avif","caption":"A crafting station in Village 茶(Sa)kura, the free Unity/C# synthetic biology game built with ABAL Inc. and published on itch.io","credit":"Team ASIJ-Tokyo, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"Village 茶(Sa)kura 中的製作站——這款免費的 Unity/C# 合成生物學遊戲與 ABAL Inc. 共同開發，並在 itch.io 上發布"}]},{"id":"6339","team":"Muenster-University","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","village":"Agriculture","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/muenster-university/","rank":117,"awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best New Composite Part — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Agriculture Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳新複合元件 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳農業專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"P.A.C. Immunity","projectTitle_zh":"P.A.C. Immunity","tagline":"A modular platform that retrofits native plant immune sensors so a crop detects a pathogen's own protease directly and triggers an instant immune response.","tagline_zh":"一個模組化平台，改裝植物本身的免疫感測器，讓作物直接偵測病原自己的蛋白酶，並立即啟動免疫反應。","summary":"P.A.C. Immunity rewires plant immunity instead of breeding for it. A plant NLR immune receptor is held inactive by a synthetic blocker peptide containing a protease cleavage site; when a pathogen secretes its effector protease into the host cell - a step many viruses, bacteria, fungi and nematodes cannot skip - the protease cleaves the blocker, the NLR fires, and the plant mounts a hypersensitive response. Because only the cleavage site changes between pathogens, swapping one short sequence retargets the whole system, which is the modularity argument: classical resistance breeding takes years and pathogens overcome new resistances quickly. The bottleneck they hit is that almost no pathogen protease has a known cleavage motif, so the dry lab built ProTEUS (Protease Target Elucidation Using Structural Modeling), a de-novo-binder-style pipeline chaining AlphaFold3, RFdiffusion3 and LigandMPNN with a mechanistically grounded geometric scoring function to generate candidate cleavage peptides for proteases with no characterised substrates at all.","summary_zh":"P.A.C. Immunity 是把植物免疫重新接線，而不是靠育種慢慢選。一個植物 NLR 免疫受體被一段含有蛋白酶切位的合成阻斷胜肽鎖在失活狀態；當病原把它的效應蛋白酶分泌進宿主細胞——這是許多病毒、細菌、真菌與線蟲都省不掉的一步——該蛋白酶就會切開阻斷胜肽，NLR 隨之啟動，植物便發動過敏性反應。由於不同病原之間唯一要改的只有切位，換掉一段短序列就能把整套系統重新指向新標的，這正是模組化的論點：傳統抗病育種要花好幾年，而病原很快就能突破新的抗性。他們撞上的瓶頸是：幾乎沒有任何病原蛋白酶有已知的切割基序，於是乾實驗做出 ProTEUS（Protease Target Elucidation Using Structural Modeling），一條 de novo 結合蛋白式的流程，把 AlphaFold3、RFdiffusion3 與 LigandMPNN 串起來，再配上一套以機制為根據的幾何評分函數，為完全沒有已知受質的蛋白酶產生候選切割胜肽。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6339/wiki/dry-lab/figures/fig3.avif","caption":"AlphaFold3 confidence for the four candidate effector proteases before and after excluding disordered N-terminal regions, averaged over 10 samples, with the share of each protein trimmed shown above each bar.","caption_zh":"四個候選效應蛋白酶在排除無序 N 端區域前後的 AlphaFold3 信心度，取 10 個樣本平均，每根長條上方標出該蛋白被修掉的比例。","credit":"Team Muenster-University, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6341","team":"KAUST-KSA","section":"Overgrad","country":"Saudi Arabia","village":"Space","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/kaust-ksa/","rank":143,"awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Measurement — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Hardware — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Space Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳量測 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳硬體 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳太空專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"SHIHAB","projectTitle_zh":"SHIHAB","tagline":"SHIHAB (shooting star): resilient microbial chassis and a suitcase bioreactor for on-demand therapeutic protein manufacturing in space","tagline_zh":"SHIHAB（流星）：耐受性強的微生物底盤，加上一台行李箱式生物反應器，用於在太空中按需製造治療性蛋白質","summary":"Stocking an inventory of medicines for long-duration missions costs payload mass, so SHIHAB makes the medicine instead: a small library of lyophilised engineered microbes ('pills'), each producing a different nanobody, plus a compact automated bioreactor and purification train that an untrained astronaut can run. The wet lab integrated Dsup, the tardigrade damage-suppressor protein, genomically into three chassis (Bacillus subtilis, Saccharomyces cerevisiae, Pichia pastoris) and quantified radiation resistance against UV-C and X-ray doses with four complementary readouts, then expressed and purified a payload protein by HisTrap. The dry lab answered which host, what feedstock and when to induce using genome-scale metabolic models plus an ODE layer, and COMSOL CFD decided the rotor geometry for mixing under Mars, Moon and transit gravity. It won Best Hardware and Best Space Project; the whole platform was taken out of the lab and run on desert dunes to prove the 'anywhere' claim.","summary_zh":"為長期任務備齊一整櫃藥品要付出酬載質量的代價，因此 SHIHAB 選擇現場製藥：一小套凍乾的工程微生物（「藥丸」），每一顆生產一種不同的奈米抗體，再加上一台小型自動化生物反應器與純化串列，讓未受訓練的太空人也能操作。濕實驗把水熊蟲的損傷抑制蛋白 Dsup 以基因組整合方式導入三種底盤（Bacillus subtilis、Saccharomyces cerevisiae、Pichia pastoris），並以四種互補的判讀方式量化其對 UV-C 與 X 光劑量的抗性，接著表現並以 HisTrap 純化了一個酬載蛋白質。乾實驗以基因組尺度代謝模型加上一層 ODE，回答了該用哪個宿主、用什麼進料與何時誘導，而 COMSOL 的流體力學模擬則決定了在火星、月球與航行期重力下用於混合的轉子幾何。本案拿下 Best Hardware 與 Best Space Project；為了證明「在任何地方都能用」的說法，整套平台被搬出實驗室、在沙漠沙丘上實際運行。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6341/wiki/content/hardware/cfd-prototype-3.webp","caption":"COMSOL Multiphysics CFD of the third rotor concept (three rows of small tilted blades) at 200 rpm, comparing bubble fate under Earth, Mars, Moon and transit gravity: the simulation that selected the final rotor geometry.","caption_zh":"第三種轉子構想（三排小型傾斜葉片）在 200 rpm 下的 COMSOL Multiphysics 流體力學模擬，比較地球、火星、月球與航行期重力下的氣泡去向：這就是選定最終轉子幾何的那次模擬。","credit":"Team KAUST-KSA, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6345","team":"BGI-College","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/bgi-college/","rank":40,"awards":["Best New Basic Part — Nominee (High School)","Best Alternative Platform — Winner (High School)","Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳替代平台 — 得主（高中組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"BioH2","projectTitle_zh":"BioH2","tagline":"A wild Clostridium isolated from a Guangdong wetland, made genetically tractable, then redesigned into a closed-loop biorefinery once the arithmetic killed hydrogen-only","tagline_zh":"一株從廣東濕地分離出的野生 Clostridium，被改造成可做基因操作的宿主；當算術否決了只賣氫氣這條路之後，整個專案又被重新設計成閉環生物精煉廠","summary":"BGI-College took Clostridium beijerinckii S63, a strain newly isolated from sediment at Yundonghai Wetland Park in Foshan, Guangdong (a site of interest because of unusually high natural soil hydrogen in the Sanshui Basin), and turned a non-model anaerobe into a working chassis. They sequenced it to a single circular 5,870,246 bp chromosome, measured 40.20 plus or minus 3.45 percent hydrogen in its gas output, built a metabolic flux model that identified PFOR and HydA overexpression plus thl deletion as targets, and established an electroporation transformation system through three documented DBTL cycles, two of which failed outright. Their economic check then did something unusual: it proved their own original premise impossible, since breaking even on glucose alone would need 6.70 mol H2 per mol glucose against a hard biochemical ceiling of 4.0, which forced a redesign around byproduct valorisation. They won Best Alternative Platform in the High School section and were nominated for Best New Basic Part and Best Presentation.","summary_zh":"BGI-College 取用 Clostridium beijerinckii S63——一株新分離自廣東佛山雲東海濕地公園底泥的菌株（該地之所以受注意，是因為三水盆地的天然土壤氫含量異常高）——把一株非模式厭氧菌變成能用的底盤。他們把它定序到單一環狀染色體 5,870,246 bp，量得氣體產物中氫氣含量為 40.20 加減 3.45%，建立代謝通量模型並據以指出 PFOR 與 HydA 過量表現加上 thl 剔除為工程目標，並經由三個有完整記錄的 DBTL 循環（其中兩個徹底失敗）建立電穿孔轉形系統。他們的經濟性檢核接著做了一件不尋常的事：它證明了自己最初的前提不可能成立——若只靠葡萄糖要達到損益兩平，每莫耳葡萄糖需產生 6.70 莫耳 H2，而生化上的硬上限是 4.0，這迫使他們圍繞副產物加值利用重新設計。他們獲得高中組的 Best Alternative Platform，並入圍 Best New Basic Part 與 Best Presentation。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6345/wiki/assets/alternative-platform/fig3.avif","caption":"The electroporation transformation workflow established for Clostridium beijerinckii S63, published with buffers, voltage and cuvette gap specified so another group can reproduce it","credit":"Team BGI-College, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"為 Clostridium beijerinckii S63 建立的電穿孔轉形流程，發表時寫明緩衝液、電壓與電穿孔槽間距，讓其他團隊能夠重現"}]},{"id":"6350","team":"Marburg","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","village":"Alternative Platform","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/marburg/","rank":131,"awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Alternative Platform — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳替代平台 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"CLiPPR - Chloroplast Library for inducible PPRs","projectTitle_zh":"CLiPPR——可誘導 PPR 的葉綠體元件庫（Chloroplast Library for inducible PPRs）","tagline":"Making the chloroplast switchable: inducible designer PPR proteins paired with synthetic 5'UTRs","tagline_zh":"讓葉綠體變成可開關的：把可誘導的訂製 PPR 蛋白與合成 5'UTR 配對使用","summary":"Chloroplasts are arguably the cheapest protein factories available (around 90% of global primary production, up to 70% of a plant cell's protein as transgenic product, linear rather than capital-intensive scaling), but they lack the one tool microbial hosts have: inducibility, so growth and production compete permanently and a toxic product means no plant at all. CLiPPR outsources that inducibility to the nucleus: nuclear-encoded, inducibly expressed synthetic pentatricopeptide repeat proteins are imported into the plastid, where they bind matched synthetic 5'UTRs placed upstream of a chloroplast gene and switch translation up or down by three mechanisms (blocking the start codon, protecting an unstable 5'UTR from exonucleases, or resolving a hairpin over the ribosome binding site). The team designed 30 fully synthetic 5'UTRs de novo, produced, purified and tested 19 new-to-nature PPR proteins, reported the highest transgene expression yet recorded in a chloroplast in vitro, and validated across three systems of rising complexity: chloroplast cell-free extract, Chlamydomonas reinhardtii, and Nicotiana benthamiana. It won Best Alternative Platform and was nominated for Part Collection, Education, Presentation, Wiki and Foundational Advance.","summary_zh":"葉綠體可說是現有最便宜的蛋白質工廠（占全球初級生產約 90%，轉殖產物可達植物細胞蛋白質的 70%，放大是線性而非資本密集），但它缺少微生物宿主早就有的那一項工具：可誘導性，因此生長與生產永遠在互相競爭，而一個有毒的產物就等於根本長不出植物。CLiPPR 把這份可誘導性外包給細胞核：由細胞核編碼、可誘導表現的合成五肽重複（PPR）蛋白被運入色素體，在那裡結合置於葉綠體基因上游的配對合成 5'UTR，並以三種機制把轉譯調高或調低（遮蔽起始密碼子、保護不穩定的 5'UTR 不被外切酶分解，或解開蓋在核糖體結合位上的髮夾結構）。團隊從頭設計了 30 條完全合成的 5'UTR，生產、純化並測試了 19 個自然界中不存在的 PPR 蛋白，報告出葉綠體體外至今最高的轉殖基因表現量，並在三個複雜度遞增的系統中驗證：葉綠體無細胞萃取液、Chlamydomonas reinhardtii 與 Nicotiana benthamiana。它拿下最佳替代平台獎，並獲元件集合、教育、簡報、wiki 與基礎進展等提名。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6350/wiki/src/contents/project/alternative-platform/ccfs-utr-screening-1280.avif","caption":"Screening the library of synthetic 5'UTR and designer PPR pairs in chloroplast cell-free extract, the lowest-complexity of the three test systems; one of these 30 de novo UTRs gave the highest transgene expression yet reported in a chloroplast in vitro.","caption_zh":"在葉綠體無細胞萃取液中篩選合成 5'UTR 與訂製 PPR 的配對元件庫，這是三個測試系統中複雜度最低的一個；這 30 條從頭設計的 UTR 中有一條，給出了葉綠體體外至今報告過的最高轉殖基因表現量。","credit":"Team Marburg, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6356","team":"TU Darmstadt","section":"Overgrad","country":"Germany","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/tu-darmstadt/","rank":40,"awards":["Best New Basic Part — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Hardware — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳新基礎元件 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳硬體 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"UNRAVEL: Unlocking New Resources And Value from End-of-Life textiles","projectTitle_zh":"UNRAVEL：從報廢紡織品中釋放新資源與價值","tagline":"Enzymes and thermophilic hosts for mixed textile waste, plus a 134 euro anaerobic chamber, a 115 euro oxygen monitor and a 68 euro shaker, all documented including the failures.","tagline_zh":"針對混合紡織廢棄物的酵素與嗜熱宿主，外加一個 134 歐元的厭氧操作箱、一個 115 歐元的氧氣監測器與一台 68 歐元的振盪器，全部都有文件記錄，包括失敗的部分。","summary":"TU Darmstadt attacked mixed textile waste, of which roughly 92 million tonnes are generated globally each year and less than 1% is recycled back into fibres, by working with two thermophilic organisms: Acetivibrio thermocellus, a strict anaerobe with a cellulosome that degrades cotton at 60 C, and Geobacillus thermocatenulatus, whose carboxylesterase the team characterised and registered as GeoEsterase. Because those organisms need equipment the team did not have, they built it: a movable DIY anaerobic chamber for under 150 euros, a portable ESP32 oxygen monitor when resazurin proved too slow and cumbersome to verify the atmosphere, and two generations of orbital shaker to fit inside an existing 60 C incubator. What makes the work a measurement case study is the discipline of separating what was demonstrated from what was not, in both the enzymology and the hardware.","summary_zh":"TU Darmstadt 處理的是混合紡織廢棄物——全球每年產生約 9,200 萬公噸，重新回到纖維的比例不到 1%——他們用了兩種嗜熱微生物：Acetivibrio thermocellus，一種嚴格厭氧菌，具有可在 60°C 降解棉的纖維小體；以及 Geobacillus thermocatenulatus，團隊對其羧酸酯酶做了特性分析，並以 GeoEsterase 之名註冊。因為這些菌需要團隊原本沒有的設備，他們就自己做：一個造價不到 150 歐元、可移動的 DIY 厭氧操作箱；在發現 resazurin 判讀太慢又麻煩、無法確認箱內氣氛時，做了一台可攜式 ESP32 氧氣監測器；還有兩代軌道式振盪器，以便塞進現有的 60°C 培養箱。真正讓這份工作成為量測案例研究的，是他們在酵素學與硬體兩方面，都嚴守「已證明」與「未證明」的分野。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6356/wiki/hardware/ac5.avif","caption":"The DIY anaerobic chamber: a transparent 55 L plastic storage container fitted with 125 mm glove ports, brass ball valves for gas inlet and outlet, an EPDM-sealed lid clamped with C-clamps along aluminium U-profile, and a two-container transfer lock, for 134.30 euros in materials against roughly 3,000 euros for a cheap commercial chamber.","caption_zh":"DIY 厭氧操作箱：一個透明的 55 L 塑膠收納箱，裝上 125 mm 手套口、作為氣體進出口的黃銅球閥，箱蓋以 EPDM 密封並沿鋁製 U 型軌以 C 型夾夾緊，另有雙箱體的轉移氣閘，材料成本 134.30 歐元，相較一台便宜的商用操作箱約需 3,000 歐元。","credit":"Team TU Darmstadt, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6366","team":"Peking","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/peking/","rank":21,"awards":["Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Safety and Security Award — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Conservation Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","安全與保安獎 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳保育專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"TermiTox — engineered yeast baits for species-specific termite colony control","projectTitle_zh":"TermiTox——以工程酵母餌劑進行物種專一的白蟻巢群防治","tagline":"Two engineered yeast strains, modelled from molecular dynamics to whole-colony collapse, to protect wooden heritage buildings without broad-spectrum pesticide.","tagline_zh":"兩株工程酵母，從分子動力學一路模擬到整個巢群崩解，在不使用廣效殺蟲劑的前提下保護木造古蹟建築。","summary":"Peking built a genuinely three-scale model of a termite bait. Strain A delivers a pH-gated listeriolysin O mutant that lyses the hindgut protozoa a termite depends on for cellulose digestion; Strain B releases hairpin RNA under hindgut hypoxia to silence RsEG (a termite cellulase) and Hexamerin-1 (a caste-development regulator). The Molecular Model used all-atom MD to verify the H311A-LLO safety premise, the Individual Model is a cohort-ODE system calibrated by MAP fitting against quantitative data extracted from 43 papers, and the Colony Model is a spatially explicit agent-based stochastic simulation of trophallaxis through a two-layer nest network with caste structure. The colony model produced a non-obvious and testable deployment schedule that the team then designed hardware for, plus a dose and collapse-time estimate anchored to published hexaflumuron field trials.","summary_zh":"Peking 為白蟻餌劑真正建了一個三尺度的模型。A 菌株投遞一個受 pH 調控的李斯特菌溶素 O（LLO）突變體，裂解白蟻賴以消化纖維素的後腸原生動物；B 菌株則在後腸低氧條件下釋放髮夾 RNA，靜默 RsEG（一種白蟻纖維素酶）與 Hexamerin-1（階級發育的調控因子）。分子模型以全原子 MD 驗證 H311A-LLO 的安全前提，個體模型是一套世代結構的 ODE 系統，以最大後驗（MAP）擬合對從 43 篇論文中擷取的定量資料進行校準，巢群模型則是一個空間明確的主體基隨機模擬，模擬交哺行為在具階級結構的兩層巢網路中的傳播。巢群模型產出一個並不直觀、但可被檢驗的投放時程，該隊接著為此設計硬體，並給出以已發表 hexaflumuron 田間試驗為錨的劑量與崩解時間估計。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6366/wiki/model/quick-view/termitox-model-whole-picture-v5.webp","caption":"The whole picture of the TermiTox multiscale model: molecular dynamics of the pH-gated LLO mutant, a cohort-ODE individual model of yeast persistence through payload release to functional decline, and a spatially explicit agent-based colony model of trophallactic spread, with each scale's output feeding the next.","caption_zh":"TermiTox 多尺度模型的全貌：受 pH 調控的 LLO 突變體的分子動力學、從酵母存續經酬載釋放到功能衰退的世代結構 ODE 個體模型，以及交哺傳播的空間明確主體基巢群模型，每個尺度的輸出都餵給下一個尺度。","credit":"Team Peking, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6379","team":"NCKU-Tainan","section":"Undergrad","country":"Taiwan","village":"Infectious Diseases","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ncku-tainan/","rank":33,"awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Infectious Diseases Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳傳染病專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"Capture: detecting and inhibiting Pseudomonas aeruginosa quorum-sensing signals","projectTitle_zh":"Capture：偵測並抑制 Pseudomonas aeruginosa 的群體感應訊號","tagline":"A US$54 to US$161 single-cuvette fluorescence reader, and a browser app that turns its counts into an AHL concentration with a 95% confidence interval.","tagline_zh":"一台造價 54 至 161 美元的單樣品槽螢光判讀儀，以及一個瀏覽器應用程式，可把它的計數值換算成帶 95% 信賴區間的 AHL 濃度。","summary":"NCKU-Tainan targeted the acyl-homoserine lactone signals that Pseudomonas aeruginosa uses to coordinate toxin release and biofilm formation in healthcare-associated infections, with two systems reading the same molecule: one that detects the signal and reports the infection, and one that inhibits it with published single-stranded DNA aptamers acting as molecular sponges. To read their GFP reporter without booking a shared plate reader in another building they built CAPTURE-Screen, a single-cuvette fluorescence reader in two versions, 3D-printed and laser-cut, costing 21 to 65 times less than an open-source plate reader. LasReader, a browser application, completes the chain by fitting a weighted four-parameter logistic calibration, deriving limits of detection from the blanks and returning each sample's concentration with an approximate confidence interval.","summary_zh":"NCKU-Tainan 針對 Pseudomonas aeruginosa 在醫療照護相關感染中用來協調毒素釋放與生物膜形成的醯基高絲胺酸內酯訊號，做了兩套讀取同一個分子的系統：一套偵測訊號並通報感染，另一套則以已發表的單股 DNA 適體作為分子海綿來抑制它。為了讀取自己的 GFP 報告訊號又不必到另一棟樓預約共用的微量盤判讀儀，他們做了 CAPTURE-Screen，一台單樣品槽螢光判讀儀，有 3D 列印與雷射切割兩個版本，成本比開源微量盤判讀儀低 21 至 65 倍。瀏覽器應用程式 LasReader 補完了整條鏈：擬合加權的四參數邏輯斯校正曲線，由空白樣本推導偵測極限，並回傳每個樣品的濃度與近似信賴區間。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6379/wiki/hardware/hardware.avif","caption":"CAPTURE-Screen, the team's single-cuvette fluorescence reader for GFP reporter cultures, built so it can sit next to the incubator instead of competing for a shared plate reader in another building.","caption_zh":"CAPTURE-Screen，團隊為 GFP 報告菌培養液打造的單樣品槽螢光判讀儀，設計上可以就放在培養箱旁邊，不必去搶另一棟樓裡的共用微量盤判讀儀。","credit":"Team NCKU-Tainan, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6381","team":"UCL","section":"Undergrad","country":"United Kingdom","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ucl/","rank":28,"awards":["Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Bioremediation Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物復育專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"SHELLter — capturing cisplatin from patient urine with a chelator made from shellfish waste","projectTitle_zh":"SHELLter — 以甲殼廢料製成的螯合劑，從病人尿液中捕捉順鉑","tagline":"A point-of-care cartridge that chelates platinum chemotherapy drugs out of patient urine, with the chelator made enzymatically from crab shell.","tagline_zh":"一個在照護現場使用的濾匣，把鉑類化療藥物從病人尿液中螯合出來，而螯合劑本身是以酵素從蟹殼製造的。","summary":"About half of each cisplatin dose leaves the patient in urine within days, and UK hospital effluent is not treated for cytotoxics at all. SHELLter intercepts it at the point of care with a monoacetylchitosan chelating ligand produced from shellfish-processing waste by an engineered SmChiA-VcCDA fusion enzyme. The dry lab is presented as four Python files on an interactive laptop — kinetic_model.py, docking_simulation.py, life_cycle_assessment.py and techno_economic_analysis.py — and all four feed each other: the kinetic model sets reaction conditions and predicts how downstream purification affects product yield, that yield drives the techno-economic cost per gram, and the same mass balance underpins the openLCA life cycle assessment. The docking study is a rigorously controlled computational experiment with negative controls, a pre-specified acceptance rule, multiple-comparison correction and a stated power analysis.","summary_zh":"每一劑順鉑約有一半會在數天內隨尿液離開病人體內，而英國醫院的廢水完全沒有針對細胞毒性藥物做處理。SHELLter 在照護現場就把它攔下來，使用的是以單乙醯幾丁聚醣為基礎的螯合配體，由改造過的 SmChiA-VcCDA 融合酵素以甲殼加工廢料製成。乾實驗室被呈現為一台互動式筆電上的四個 Python 檔案——kinetic_model.py、docking_simulation.py、life_cycle_assessment.py 與 techno_economic_analysis.py——而且四者互相餵養：動力學模型決定反應條件，並預測下游純化如何影響產物產率；該產率驅動技術經濟分析的每公克成本；同一份質量平衡也支撐起 openLCA 的生命週期評估。對接研究則是一個控制嚴謹的計算實驗，具備負對照、事先訂好的接受準則、多重比較校正，以及明確的檢定力分析。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6381/wiki/dockingpipeline.avif","caption":"The ten-stage docking pipeline, with each box naming the stage, what it does and the software used. Stage 0 defines the active sites by measuring them from substrate-bound crystal structures independently of any model built later, and stage 3 builds and verifies the substrates from PubChem — both complete before the work they feed into begins.","caption_zh":"十階段的對接流程，每個方塊都寫出階段名稱、做什麼以及使用的軟體。階段 0 以量測的方式從結合基質的晶體結構界定活性位，獨立於之後建立的任何模型；階段 3 則從 PubChem 建構並核對基質；兩者都在它們所餵養的工作開始之前就已完成。","credit":"Team UCL, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6389","team":"UFABC-Brazil","section":"Overgrad","country":"Brazil","village":"Diagnostics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/ufabc-brazil/","rank":14,"awards":["Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Diagnostics Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳診斷專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"Patchlepsy","projectTitle_zh":"Patchlepsy","tagline":"A paper-read toehold biosensor that gives people with epilepsy the one thing they do not have: warning time.","tagline_zh":"一款以紙張判讀的 toehold 生物感測器，提供癲癇患者最缺乏的一件東西：預警時間。","summary":"Patchlepsy is a toehold-switch biosensor designed to detect three tRNA-derived fragments (5'GlyGCC, 5'AlaTGC, 5'GluCTC) whose plasma levels rise before seizures in temporal lobe epilepsy, as reported by Hogg et al. (2019). Each switch releases a different chromoprotein reporter (mRFP1, AmilCP, fwYellow), read by a low-cost ESP32 plus AS7341 multispectral device and logged in a mobile app. To the team's knowledge these are the first toehold switches targeting tRFs rather than microRNAs. The cell-free assays never activated in either a CFPS extract kit or PURExpress, and the team publishes that failure with its two mechanistic hypotheses; the whole-cell system did work, with the GlyGCC/mRFP1 switch reaching a fold change of up to 23 in the presence of its trigger. The whole wiki is bilingual English and Portuguese.","summary_zh":"Patchlepsy 是一個 toehold switch 生物感測器，設計用來偵測三種 tRNA 衍生片段（5'GlyGCC、5'AlaTGC、5'GluCTC）——根據 Hogg 等人（2019）的報告，這些片段在顳葉癲癇患者發作前的血漿濃度會上升。每個開關各釋出一種不同的色素蛋白報告子（mRFP1、AmilCP、fwYellow），再由一台低成本的 ESP32 加 AS7341 多光譜裝置判讀，並記錄在手機應用程式中。就團隊所知，這是第一批以 tRF（而非 microRNA）為標的的 toehold switch。無細胞分析在 CFPS 萃取套組與 PURExpress 中都未曾活化，團隊把這項失敗連同兩個機制假說一併公開；全細胞系統則確實可行，GlyGCC/mRFP1 開關在其觸發物存在時達到最高 23 倍的倍數變化。整個 wiki 以英文與葡萄牙文雙語呈現。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6389/wiki/human-practices/integrated/fluxograma-hp-english.avif","caption":"The four-step integrated human practices workflow: DataSUS epidemiology, SWOT validation with people with epilepsy, stakeholder interviews, and project refinement.","credit":"Team UFABC-Brazil, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"四步整合式人類實踐流程：DataSUS 流行病學、與癲癇患者一起驗證 SWOT、利害關係人訪談，以及專案修正。"}]},{"id":"6391","team":"Oxford","section":"Undergrad","country":"United Kingdom","village":"Agriculture","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/oxford/","rank":47,"awards":["Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Agriculture Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳農業專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"NECTAR","projectTitle_zh":"NECTAR","tagline":"An end-to-end platform for designing, validating, producing and deploying RNAi interventions, stress-tested on Varroa destructor","tagline_zh":"一個從設計、驗證、生產到佈署 RNAi 干預措施的端到端平台，並以 Varroa destructor 作為壓力測試對象","summary":"NECTAR is a programmable RNAi pipeline: FORAGER (computational dsRNA design with off-target screening against the Apis mellifera transcriptome), microbial production in yeast, and delivery to hives in a pollen patty. Varroa destructor, the single biggest threat to honeybees, is the first real-world case study. The team built HIVE, an explicit four-step human-practices decision procedure (Hear, Investigate, Verdict, Evaluate) run over six open project questions with 28+ named stakeholders including US EPA/FDA/USDA staff, the Chair of the UK Advisory Committee on Releases to the Environment, and the Secretariat of the Convention on Biological Diversity. Stakeholder evidence changed the chassis (living engineered Snodgrassella alvi to heat-inactivated yeast), the delivery format, the off-target screening stage, the survey instrument and the definition of success.","summary_zh":"NECTAR 是一條可程式化的 RNAi 流程：FORAGER（以計算方法設計 dsRNA，並對 Apis mellifera 轉錄體做脫靶篩查）、在酵母中以微生物方式生產，以及用花粉餅把成品送進蜂箱。蜂蟹蟎 Varroa destructor 是蜜蜂最大的單一威脅，也是第一個真實世界的案例研究。團隊建立了 HIVE，一套明確的四步人類實踐決策程序（Hear、Investigate、Verdict、Evaluate），套用在六個開放的專案問題上，涵蓋 28 位以上具名利害關係人，包括美國 EPA/FDA/USDA 的人員、英國環境釋出諮詢委員會（ACRE）主席，以及生物多樣性公約秘書處。利害關係人提供的證據改變了底盤（從活體工程改造的 Snodgrassella alvi 改為熱去活化的酵母）、遞送形式、脫靶篩查階段、問卷工具，以及對「成功」的定義。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6391/wiki/assets/drawings/sdg-description.avif","caption":"NECTAR at the centre of four chosen SDGs - 15 Life on Land and 2 Zero Hunger as primary goals, 17 Partnerships and 4 Quality Education as enabling goals - each with its own justification rather than a logo wall","caption_zh":"NECTAR 置於四個被選定的 SDG 中央——15 陸域生命與 2 消除飢餓為主要目標，17 夥伴關係與 4 優質教育為支持性目標——每一項都附自己的理由，而不是一面標誌牆","credit":"Team Oxford, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6395","team":"NUS-Singapore","section":"Undergrad","country":"Singapore","village":"Biomanufacturing","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nus-singapore/","rank":105,"awards":["Top 10 (Undergrad)","Best Part Collection — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Biomanufacturing Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（大學組）","最佳元件集 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳生物製造專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"ORCHID","projectTitle_zh":"ORCHID","tagline":"Multiplexed fluorescent stress biosensors in yeast plus a machine-learning layer that turns intracellular stress into the next experiment to run.","tagline_zh":"在酵母中建立多工螢光壓力生物感測器，再加上一層機器學習，把細胞內的壓力狀態轉換成下一個該做的實驗。","summary":"Industrial bioreactors hold hundreds of thousands of litres and a single bad batch is expensive, yet conventional monitoring tracks only physical and chemical parameters such as pH and dissolved oxygen — nothing about what is happening inside the cell. Omics and LC-MS can see inside, but they are offline, destructive and slow enough that results arrive after the batch has finished, so they cannot act on anything. ORCHID puts biosensors for endoplasmic reticulum, oxidative and ATP stress into Saccharomyces cerevisiae as fluorescent reporters readable straight from a plate reader, solves the resulting spectral overlap with a linear unmixing model, and feeds the separated stress signals into SABLe, a neural-network framework that predicts growth, product and stress from process conditions and then proposes which culture to run next. It won nominations across parts, presentation, wiki and integrated human practices because the loop actually closed: SABLe's exploration rule proposed 27 C, the team grew that plate, and the measured product signal reached 491 mApple RFU/OD600 against 204 and 179 at the 24 and 30 C conditions it was trained on.","summary_zh":"工業級生物反應器動輒數十萬公升，一批壞掉就所費不菲，然而常規監測只追蹤 pH 與溶氧這類物理化學參數，對細胞內部正在發生什麼完全無法掌握。體學分析與 LC-MS 看得到內部，但它們是離線、破壞性的，而且慢到結果在批次結束後才拿到，因此無法據以採取任何行動。ORCHID 把偵測內質網壓力、氧化壓力與 ATP 壓力的生物感測器以螢光報導子的形式放進 Saccharomyces cerevisiae，可直接用盤式讀取儀讀取，再以一個線性解混模型處理隨之而來的光譜重疊，並把分離出來的壓力訊號餵給 SABLe，一個由製程條件預測生長、產物與壓力、並進而提議下一盤該培養什麼條件的類神經網路框架。本案在零件、簡報、wiki 與整合式人類實踐多項入圍，因為這個迴圈真的閉合了：SABLe 的探索規則提議 27 C，團隊真的培養了那一盤，而量到的產物訊號達到 491 mApple RFU/OD600，相對於訓練資料中 24 C 與 30 C 條件下的 204 與 179。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6395/wiki/pages/model/ml-stuff/sable-slide-12-exploration-score.avif","caption":"SABLe's acquisition rule made visible: model disagreement across the ten bootstrap networks and distance from already-tested conditions highlight different gaps, and their combined exploration score first selected 27 C, 1 mM DTT and 0.15% galactose as the next culture to grow.","caption_zh":"SABLe 的擷取規則被攤開來看：十個 bootstrap 網路之間的模型不一致，以及與已測試條件的距離，各自標示出不同的空缺，而兩者合成的探索分數最先選出了 27 C、1 mM DTT 與 0.15% 半乳糖，作為下一盤要培養的條件。","credit":"Team NUS-Singapore, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6399","team":"Kyoto","section":"Undergrad","country":"Japan","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/kyoto/","rank":21,"awards":["Best Part Collection — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Food & Nutrition Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳元件集 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳食品與營養專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"OiLipase — a protein timer that stops rice-bran lipase without destroying rice-bran protein","projectTitle_zh":"OiLipase——一個蛋白質定時器，讓米糠脂解酶停工、卻不摧毀米糠蛋白","tagline":"Degrade the enzyme that spoils rice bran oil, then build a molecular timer that degrades the protease once the job is done.","tagline_zh":"先分解讓米糠油敗壞的那個酵素，再做一個分子定時器，在任務完成後把蛋白酶自己也分解掉。","summary":"Rice bran goes rancid because endogenous lipase attacks the oil after milling. Kyoto tethered trypsin to an interface-seeking carrier so it preferentially cleaves lipase at the oil-water interface, then faced the real problem: once the lipase is gone, unselective trypsin starts eating the valuable albumin and globulin. Their answer is a protein timer — a split HRV 3C protease whose N-terminal half is sequestered by an excess decoy that is also a 3C substrate, producing an autocatalytic, tunable lag before 3C fires and destroys the trypsin. Three models carry the project: an ODE timer model with full sensitivity analysis, an induction-diffusion model that derives an interior optimum for leucine-zipper dissociation rate, and a protease-resistance design model that failed its own experiment and was then rebuilt into CleaveRank, released under GPL-3.0.","summary_zh":"米糠會變質，是因為碾米之後內源的脂解酶開始攻擊油脂。Kyoto 把胰蛋白酶（trypsin）繫在一個會自行尋找界面的載體上，使它優先在油水界面切斷脂解酶，接著就面對了真正的問題：脂解酶一旦被清除，沒有選擇性的胰蛋白酶就會開始吃掉珍貴的白蛋白與球蛋白。他們的解法是一個蛋白質定時器——一個分裂式 HRV 3C 蛋白酶，其 N 端半邊被過量的誘餌隔離住，而該誘餌本身也是 3C 的受質，從而在 3C 啟動並摧毀胰蛋白酶之前，產生一段自催化、可調校的延遲。三個模型撐起整個專題：一個附完整敏感度分析的 ODE 定時器模型、一個推導出白胺酸拉鍊解離速率存在內部最佳值的誘導—擴散模型，以及一個蛋白酶抗性設計模型——後者在自家實驗中被推翻，之後被重建成 CleaveRank，以 GPL-3.0 釋出。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6399/wiki/dry/fig3-timer-core.avif","caption":"Figure 3: the timer working. Without decoy, trypsin falls below 90% in under a minute; with 3.0 uM decoy a 27-minute lag appears. The lower panel shows active 3C held near zero through the whole lag then rising sharply as the decoy runs out — the autocatalysis made visible rather than asserted.","caption_zh":"圖 3：定時器運作的樣子。沒有誘餌時，胰蛋白酶在一分鐘內就掉到 90% 以下；加入 3.0 uM 誘餌後出現 27 分鐘的延遲。下方面板顯示有活性的 3C 在整段延遲期間都貼近零、待誘餌耗盡後才急遽上升——把自催化呈現出來，而不是用斷言帶過。","credit":"Team Kyoto, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6401","team":"HKU-HongKong","country":"Hong Kong","village":"Therapeutics","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/hku-hongkong/","rank":21,"awards":["Best New Composite Part — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Therapeutics Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳新複合元件 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳治療專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"Omni-Patch","projectTitle_zh":"Omni-Patch","tagline":"A cell-free single-layer sodium alginate dressing carrying a de novo TLR4/MD-2 antagonist peptide and FGF2 for hard-to-heal wounds","tagline_zh":"一款無細胞的單層海藻酸鈉敷料，載有 de novo 設計的 TLR4/MD-2 拮抗肽與 FGF2，用於難癒合傷口","summary":"Omni-Patch is a cell-free sodium alginate wound dressing loaded with aTi-14, a de novo designed peptide intended to block LPS binding to the MD-2/TLR4 complex, plus FGF2 as a repair-supporting growth factor. The team's first concept used a living chassis secreting a literature peptide (TAP2) under nitric-oxide control via NorR; recombinant TAP2 could not be recovered and the macrophage assay showed no reduction in inflammatory markers, so they pivoted to de novo design and a cell-free carrier. A nitric-oxide diffusion model then showed NO penetration depth was far shorter than the hydrogel thickness needed for exudate handling, which killed the NO-sensing component and reframed the device as open-loop. The wiki is unusually candid: aTi-14 left-shifted FITC-LPS binding at 25 uM in a one-concentration THP-1 M0 screen while five sibling variants did not, but matched qPCR showed no transcript drop, the Griess nitrite run was discarded for bacterial contamination, and no IC50 is claimed.","summary_zh":"Omni-Patch 是一款無細胞的海藻酸鈉傷口敷料，載有 aTi-14——一個 de novo 設計的肽，目的是阻斷 LPS 與 MD-2/TLR4 複合體的結合——再加上 FGF2 作為支持修復的生長因子。該隊最初的構想是用活體載體，在 NorR 的一氧化氮調控下分泌一個文獻中的肽（TAP2）；但重組 TAP2 無法回收，巨噬細胞試驗也顯示發炎指標沒有下降，於是他們轉向 de novo 設計與無細胞載體。接著一個一氧化氮擴散模型顯示 NO 的穿透深度遠小於處理滲液所需的水膠厚度，這直接殺掉了 NO 感測元件，並把裝置重新定位為開迴路。這個 wiki 坦率得不尋常：在單一濃度的 THP-1 M0 篩選中，aTi-14 在 25 uM 下使 FITC-LPS 的結合左移，而五個同批變體則沒有，但配對的 qPCR 並未顯示轉錄本下降，Griess 亞硝酸鹽那一輪因細菌污染而作廢，他們也沒有宣稱任何 IC50。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6401/wiki/modeling/updated/m4-fig2-closure-curves-and-time.avif","caption":"Module 4 Fisher-KPP wound-closure model: predicted closure curves and closure time, the patient-facing output of the chained model stack.","caption_zh":"模組 4 的 Fisher-KPP 傷口閉合模型：預測的閉合曲線與閉合時間，這是整條串接模型堆疊面向病人的輸出。","credit":"Team HKU-HongKong, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6405","team":"CalPolySLO","section":"Undergrad","country":"United States","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/calpolyslo/","rank":47,"awards":["Best Alternative Platform — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Measurement — Winner (Undergrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Foundational Advance Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳替代平台 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳量測 — 得主（大學組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳基礎推進專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"Accessible Science: Expanding the Synthetic Cell Toolkit for All","projectTitle_zh":"可及的科學：為所有人擴展合成細胞工具組","tagline":"A cheap polyphosphate-powered energy module, a reproducible synthetic-cell fabrication device, and the calibrated ATP assay that makes both measurable.","tagline_zh":"一個便宜的多磷酸鹽供能模組、一台能可重現製作合成細胞的裝置，以及讓兩者都能被量測的經校正 ATP 分析法。","summary":"Cal Poly SLO built a cell-free and synthetic-cell platform aimed at putting synthetic cells into undergraduate hands. The science problem is that PURE-type cell-free reactions run out of energy and that commercial creatine-phosphate regeneration is one of the most expensive parts of the kit, so the team screened a library of polyphosphate kinase 2 (PPK2) enzymes, filtered from roughly 18,000 sequences down to 16 phylogenetically diverse candidates, that regenerate ATP from cheap inorganic polyphosphate. To compare those enzymes they had to build the measurement first: a scalable, interference-corrected luciferase ATP assay with matched standard curves, published protocols, OpenTrons scripts and Excel templates. They also designed a 3D-printed emulsification 'washboard' and a tip-wipe recovery step to make hand-made vesicles reproducible, and wrote the whole thing into CHEM 471, a new undergraduate synthetic-cell lab course.","summary_zh":"Cal Poly SLO 做了一套無細胞與合成細胞平台，目標是把合成細胞交到大學生手上。科學問題在於 PURE 類型的無細胞反應會耗盡能量，而商用的磷酸肌酸再生系統又是整組套件中最貴的部分之一，因此團隊篩選了一組多磷酸鹽激酶 2（PPK2）酵素庫，從大約 18,000 條序列過濾到 16 個在親緣關係上具多樣性的候選，這些酵素能以便宜的無機多磷酸鹽再生 ATP。為了比較這些酵素，他們得先把量測方法做出來：一套可擴充、已校正干擾的螢光素酶 ATP 分析法，具備條件相符的標準曲線、公開的實驗流程、OpenTrons 腳本與 Excel 範本。他們也設計了一個 3D 列印的乳化「洗衣板」以及一道擦拭吸頭的回收步驟，讓手工製作的囊泡變得可重現，並把整套內容寫進 CHEM 471，一門全新的大學部合成細胞實驗課。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6405/wiki/measurement/meas-opentrons-deck.avif","caption":"The Opentrons OT-2 deck loaded with tip racks and plates; the robot was revived after five years to prepare the EDTA stop plates and the fixed 1:25 and 1:50 dilution plates for the ATP assay.","caption_zh":"裝好吸頭架與盤子的 Opentrons OT-2 平台；這台機器在閒置五年後被重新啟用，用來準備 ATP 分析所需的 EDTA 終止盤，以及固定的 1:25 與 1:50 稀釋盤。","credit":"Team CalPolySLO, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6409","team":"RDFZ-China","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/rdfz-china/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"GlacierGuard","projectTitle_zh":"GlacierGuard","tagline":"Protect the ice. Leave less behind.","tagline_zh":"守護冰川，少留痕跡。","summary":"RDFZ-China engineered E. coli to produce bacterial cellulose (BC) and built GlacierGuard, a biodegradable BC composite membrane intended to slow localized glacier surface ablation. Three genetic systems support it: heterologous bcsABCD plus a pgm/galU UDP-glucose precursor boost for BC yield, a urease (ureABC) biomineralization module that precipitates white CaCO3 inside the BC fibre network to raise albedo, and a CspA cold-shock-protein module to lower the fermentation temperature needed on the Qinghai-Tibet Plateau. BC production reached 230.6 +/- 15.3 mg/L in C41(DE3), roughly 65.9x the empty-vector control, and covered ice retained 3.2 percentage points more mass than geotextile-covered ice in a refrigerator day-night simulation. The team deliberately deployed only commercially sourced (non-engineered) BC membranes during its Tibet field trial and removed all material before leaving.","summary_zh":"RDFZ-China 改造 E. coli 生產細菌纖維素（BC），並做出 GlacierGuard——一種可生物降解的 BC 複合膜，用來減緩局部冰川表面消融。三套基因系統支撐它：異源的 bcsABCD 加上 pgm/galU 的 UDP-葡萄糖前驅物增補以提升 BC 產量；一個尿素酶（ureABC）生物礦化模組，在 BC 纖維網絡內析出白色 CaCO3 以提高反照率；以及一個 CspA 冷震蛋白模組，用來降低在青藏高原發酵所需的溫度。BC 產量在 C41(DE3) 中達到 230.6 +/- 15.3 mg/L，約為空載體對照的 65.9 倍；在冰箱日夜循環模擬中，覆蓋膜的冰比覆蓋土工織物的冰多保留 3.2 個百分點的質量。團隊在西藏實地考察時刻意只部署商購（非工程化）的 BC 膜，並在離開前把所有材料全部移除。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6409/wiki/human-practices/img16.avif","caption":"GlacierGuard stakeholder map plotted on power and interest axes, including non-human stakeholders such as glacier microbial communities and downstream aquatic ecosystems.","credit":"Team RDFZ-China, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"GlacierGuard 的利害關係人地圖，繪於權力與興趣兩軸上，並納入冰川微生物群落與下游水域生態系統等非人類利害關係人。"}]},{"id":"6422","team":"UiOslo-Norway","section":"Overgrad","country":"Norway","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/uioslo-norway/","rank":21,"awards":["Best Presentation — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳簡報 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"HePatch","projectTitle_zh":"HePatch","tagline":"A thermostable hepatitis B surface antigen for a dissolvable microneedle patch - and a hard look at whether that is actually the right problem","tagline_zh":"一種為可溶解微針貼片設計的耐熱 B 型肝炎表面抗原——以及對這到底是不是對的問題的一次嚴厲檢視","summary":"HePatch engineers the hepatitis B surface antigen (HBsAg) for thermostability so it could be delivered in a dissolvable microneedle patch without a cold chain, benchmarked against the WHO controlled temperature chain condition of 28 days at 37 C. The dry lab scored 2,260 ESM2/Rosetta substitutions on a 238-residue E. coli construct, retained 989 after a ddG filter, and ranked candidates for the bench. What distinguishes the team is that it put the project in front of ethicists, legal scholars, Norway's national research ethics committees, a medical officer in Kenya's highest-prevalence county and a youth-led organisation in Nairobi's informal settlements - and then published the places where those people broke the project's own premise. Each stakeholder round is closed with a 'What changed?' box naming the previous assumption, the new approach and the updated framing.","summary_zh":"HePatch 把 B 型肝炎表面抗原（HBsAg）改造成具熱穩定性，使其能以可溶解微針貼片在沒有冷鏈的情況下遞送，並以 WHO 控溫鏈條件（37 C 下 28 天）作為基準。乾實驗為一個 238 個殘基的 E. coli 構築體評分了 2,260 個 ESM2/Rosetta 取代，經 ddG 篩選後保留 989 個，並為實驗檯排出候選順序。真正讓這支團隊與眾不同的是，他們把專案拿到倫理學者、法律學者、挪威國家研究倫理委員會、肯亞盛行率最高郡的一位醫官，以及 Nairobi 非正式聚落中一個青年主導組織面前——然後把這些人戳破專案自身前提的地方公開出來。每一輪利害關係人互動都以一個「What changed?」方框收尾，寫明原先的假設、新的做法與更新後的框定。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6422/wiki/human-practices/kenya-1.avif","caption":"Conversations with practitioners in Kenya, designed as a falsification test of the project's own premise that cold-chain dependence is the main barrier to hepatitis B vaccination","credit":"Team UiOslo-Norway, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"與肯亞實務工作者的對話，被設計成對專案自身前提（冷鏈依賴是 B 型肝炎接種的主要障礙）的一次否證檢驗"}]},{"id":"6426","team":"CAU-China","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","village":"Food & Nutrition","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/cau-china/","rank":40,"awards":["Best Hardware — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Food & Nutrition Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["最佳硬體 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳食品與營養專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"Fungal Sentinel, with the OptiX phone spectrometer","projectTitle_zh":"Fungal Sentinel，搭配 OptiX 手機光譜儀","tagline":"A $12 to $30 phone-based spectrometer and the two-client software stack that turns one RAW photograph into a concentration with an uncertainty attached.","tagline_zh":"一台 12 到 30 美元的手機光譜儀，加上一組雙端軟體堆疊，把一張 RAW 照片變成一個附帶不確定度的濃度值。","summary":"CAU-China built Fungal Sentinel, engineered yeast that senses mould volatiles such as 1-octen-3-ol through a GPCR and reports them as fluorescence, and then built the instrument to read it where the mould actually is. OptiX is a pocket spectrometer that uses the phone's own camera as the detector: a threaded interchangeable excitation source, a sample chamber with light-trap fins, a collection module, a frosted-glass slit, a transmission grating, and two USB-C reference lamps that calibrate wavelength and spectral response per device. The software is two programs implementing one written specification, a Python reference implementation and an Android deployment client, held together by a parity test suite that enforces numerical agreement between them. The result is quantitative fluorescence with a limit of detection of 0.81 nM purified EGFP on an early build with no emission filter.","summary_zh":"CAU-China 做了 Fungal Sentinel——一種工程酵母，透過 GPCR 感測 1-octen-3-ol 等黴菌揮發物，並以螢光回報——接著又做了儀器，好在黴菌真正出現的地方讀取訊號。OptiX 是一台口袋型光譜儀，直接用手機自己的相機當偵測器：可螺紋互換的激發光源、帶有擋光鰭片的樣品室、收集模組、毛玻璃狹縫、穿透式繞射光柵，以及兩個 USB-C 參考燈，用來逐機校正波長與光譜響應。軟體是依同一份書面規格寫出的兩個程式：一個 Python 參考實作與一個 Android 部署端，由一組對等性測試套件把兩者的數值結果綁在一起。成果是可定量的螢光量測：在尚未加裝發射濾片的早期版本上，純化 EGFP 的偵測極限為 0.81 nM。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6426/wiki/optix-wiki-package/images/design/hero-cad-render.avif","caption":"OptiX, the phone-based spectrometer, rendered from the team's Fusion 360 assembly. Materials cost $12 to $30 per unit excluding the optional filter, because the most expensive component, the detector, is the camera the user already owns.","caption_zh":"OptiX 手機光譜儀，由團隊的 Fusion 360 組件算圖產生。不含選購濾片時每台材料成本 12 到 30 美元，因為最貴的元件——偵測器——就是使用者本來就有的相機。","credit":"Team CAU-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6439","team":"NFLSHS-CHINA","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nflshs-china/","rank":52,"awards":["Best Presentation — Winner (High School)","Best Entrepreneurship — Winner (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳簡報 — 得主（高中組）","最佳創業 — 得主（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"CroTeen","projectTitle_zh":"CroTeen","tagline":"Microbial crocetin: a controllable cell-factory supplement to saffron farming, taken all the way to B2B ingredient specs","tagline_zh":"微生物產番紅花酸：一座可控的細胞工廠，作為番紅花農業的補充，而且一路做到 B2B 原料規格","summary":"NFLSHS-China built a fully heterologous crocetin pathway in E. coli (idi, CrtE, CrtB, CrtI, CrtY, CrtZ upstream to zeaxanthin; CsCCD2 plus Neurospora crassa NcALD downstream to free crocetin), then re-engineered it after wet-lab failure from a two-plasmid system into a single-plasmid, two-T7-cassette construct (pET-Ds-Cro) for strain stability under scale-up. They used AlphaFold3, PrankWeb and CB-Dock2 to guide semi-rational mutagenesis of the rate-limiting CsCCD2 enzyme, with the N366G mutant giving a 1.13-fold yield increase confirmed by HPLC. The commercial side is unusually disciplined for a high-school team: a named B2B beachhead, a filed and accepted patent application on the CsCCD2 mutant, two physical MVPs with full formula tables, and an explicit separation of what is designed from what is still unvalidated. They won Best Entrepreneurship and Best Presentation in the High School section.","summary_zh":"NFLSHS-China 在 E. coli 中建出一條完全異源的番紅花酸（crocetin）途徑（上游 idi、CrtE、CrtB、CrtI、CrtY、CrtZ 做到玉米黃素；下游 CsCCD2 加上 Neurospora crassa 的 NcALD 做到游離番紅花酸），在濕實驗失敗後又把它從雙質體系統重新設計成單一質體、兩個 T7 卡匣的構築體（pET-Ds-Cro），以確保放大時的菌株穩定性。他們用 AlphaFold3、PrankWeb 與 CB-Dock2 指導限速酵素 CsCCD2 的半理性突變，其中 N366G 突變體使產量提升 1.13 倍，並經 HPLC 確認。商業那一側對高中團隊來說紀律罕見：一個具名的 B2B 灘頭堡市場、一件已提出並受理的 CsCCD2 突變體專利申請、兩個實體 MVP 與完整的配方表，以及明確區分「已設計完成」與「仍未驗證」。他們拿下高中組的 Best Entrepreneurship 與 Best Presentation。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6439/wiki/entrepreneurship8.avif","caption":"Patent application for the CsCCD2 mutant, filed and accepted, shown on the entrepreneurship page as the project's first hard IP asset","caption_zh":"CsCCD2 突變體的專利申請，已提出並受理，放在創業頁上作為這個專案第一項實質的智財資產","credit":"Team NFLSHS-CHINA, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6450","team":"IISER-Kolkata","country":"India","village":"Conservation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/iiser-kolkata/","rank":21,"awards":["Best Presentation — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Wiki — Nominee (Undergrad)","Best Conservation Project — Nominee"],"awards_zh":["最佳簡報 — 入圍（大學組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（大學組）","最佳保育專案 — 入圍"],"projectTitle":"FINS","projectTitle_zh":"FINS","tagline":"An estrogen-responsive E. coli biosensor coupled to secreted bacterial laccase, immobilised in PVA-alginate beads as a contained tank inside an existing wastewater treatment train","tagline_zh":"一種對雌激素有反應的 E. coli 生物感測器，與分泌型細菌漆酶串接，固定在 PVA-海藻酸鹽珠體中，作為既有污水處理流程內的一座封閉式槽體","summary":"FINS detects and degrades estrogenic endocrine disruptors (estrone E1, 17beta-estradiol E2, 17alpha-ethinylestradiol EE2) in wastewater. Module 1 uses EdcR, a TetR-family estrogen-dependent repressor from Caenibius tardaugens, expressed constitutively from BBa_J23105 to hold the Pb promoter shut; estrogen de-represses Pb, a T7 RNA polymerase stage amplifies the partial de-repression, and the output is either mScarlet3 (detection build) or secreted 6xHis-tagged BPul laccase from Bacillus pumilus, which oligomerises estrogens by oxidative coupling in the bulk phase. Module 2 is a holin-endolysin kill switch whose trigger was rebuilt from UV/LexA-SOS to RclR with the rclA promoter after wastewater practitioners pointed out Indian plants disinfect with sodium hypochlorite, not UV, on cost grounds. The project is sited as a discrete tank after secondary treatment and before chlorination, so the plant's own disinfection stage doubles as containment. The dry lab is the standout: 13 coupled ODEs, exact Gillespie and Linear Noise Approximation cross-checks, Fisher information and a Cramer-Rao limit of detection, a lattice-Boltzmann packed-bed solve, and a bespoke C++ elastic network solver released as open software.","summary_zh":"FINS 偵測並降解廢水中的雌激素類內分泌干擾物（雌酮 E1、17beta-雌二醇 E2、17alpha-炔雌醇 EE2）。模組 1 使用 EdcR，一個來自 Caenibius tardaugens 的 TetR 家族雌激素依賴型抑制蛋白，由 BBa_J23105 組成型表現，使 Pb 啟動子保持關閉；雌激素會解除對 Pb 的抑制，再由一段 T7 RNA 聚合酶放大這部分去抑制，輸出則是 mScarlet3（偵測版本）或分泌型、帶 6xHis 標籤的 Bacillus pumilus BPul 漆酶，後者在液相中以氧化偶合把雌激素寡聚化。模組 2 是一個 holin-endolysin 自殺開關；在污水處理從業者指出印度的處理廠出於成本考量是以次氯酸鈉而非 UV 消毒之後，其觸發機制從 UV/LexA-SOS 改建為搭配 rclA 啟動子的 RclR。整套系統被設置為二級處理之後、加氯之前的一座獨立槽體，因此處理廠自身的消毒步驟同時兼作生物圍阻。乾實驗是最突出的部分：13 條耦合 ODE、精確 Gillespie 與線性雜訊近似的交互驗證、Fisher 資訊量與 Cramer-Rao 偵測極限、一次格子 Boltzmann 填充床求解，以及一套自行開發、以開源軟體釋出的 C++ 彈性網路求解器。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6450/wiki/software/software/quiver-mode-arrows.webp","caption":"The Normal Mode Explorer, Quiver's browser interface: a structure drawn as a ribbon coloured blue to red by displacement with per-residue mode arrows overlaid.","caption_zh":"Normal Mode Explorer，Quiver 的瀏覽器介面：結構以帶狀呈現，依位移由藍到紅上色，並疊上每個殘基的模態箭頭。","credit":"Team IISER-Kolkata, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6456","team":"Jilin-China","section":"Undergrad","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/jilin-china/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Model — Nominee (Undergrad)"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（大學組）"],"projectTitle":"A DNA-based recorder of transient fermentation stress in Pichia pastoris","projectTitle_zh":"一個以 DNA 記錄 Pichia pastoris 發酵過程中瞬時壓力的記錄器","tagline":"Turn fleeting glucose and oxygen limitation during a fermentation run into permanent, readable marks in DNA.","tagline_zh":"把一次發酵運行中轉瞬即逝的葡萄糖與氧限制，變成 DNA 上永久且可讀取的印記。","summary":"Jilin-China built a two-channel genetic event recorder: pGTH1 drives Cre (recording glucose limitation) acting on a lox71/lox66 pair, and PsADH2 drives FLP (recording oxygen limitation) acting on an FRT-LE/FRT-RE pair, each inversion flipping a fluorescent reporter read after the run. Five separate models answer five design questions that experiments could not settle: which synonymous FLP sequence to synthesise, how bulk glucose maps to a promoter input, whether an alginate capsule isolates its cells from the broth, what DNA states the construct can occupy, and which published promoter evidence actually applies. The most striking feature is epistemic discipline: nearly every claim is accompanied by a statement of what the calculation does NOT establish, and when the glucose model's predicted low-glucose crossing time (7.56 h) disagreed with the measured 0.11 g/L at 8 h, the team reported the disagreement and downgraded the 0.05 g/L figure to a scenario threshold rather than a promoter activation threshold.","summary_zh":"Jilin-China 打造了一個雙通道的基因事件記錄器：pGTH1 驅動 Cre（記錄葡萄糖限制）作用於一組 lox71/lox66，而 PsADH2 驅動 FLP（記錄氧限制）作用於一組 FRT-LE/FRT-RE，每一次反轉都會翻轉一個螢光報導子，待運行結束後再讀取。五個各自獨立的模型回答了五個實驗無法定奪的設計問題：該合成哪一條同義密碼子的 FLP 序列、整體葡萄糖濃度如何對應到啟動子的輸入、海藻酸鹽膠囊是否真的把囊內細胞與培養液隔開、這個構築體可以存在於哪些 DNA 狀態，以及已發表的啟動子證據中哪些才真正適用。最醒目的特徵是認識論上的紀律：幾乎每一項主張都附帶一句說明，講清楚該計算並未證明什麼；而當葡萄糖模型預測的低葡萄糖跨越時間（7.56 小時）與第 8 小時實測的 0.11 g/L 不符時，團隊回報了這個不一致，並把 0.05 g/L 這個數字降級為情境閾值，而不是啟動子的活化閾值。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6456/wiki/day-lab/model/model-1.avif","caption":"Figure 1: connections among the five models, with solid arrows for within-module workflows and documented design selections and dashed arrows for conceptual interfaces that are explicitly NOT a validated coupled prediction — a distinction that lets a reader see exactly where the chain of evidence is real and where it is aspiration.","caption_zh":"圖 1：五個模型之間的連結，實線箭頭代表模組內的工作流程與有文件記載的設計選擇，虛線箭頭代表概念性介面，並明確不是一項已驗證的耦合預測，而這個區分讓讀者能精確看出證據鏈在哪裡是真的、在哪裡只是期望。","credit":"Team Jilin-China, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6462","team":"Eton-College-UK","section":"High School","country":"United Kingdom","village":"Infectious Diseases, Therapeutics, Diagnostics & Oncology","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/eton-college-uk/","rank":91,"awards":["Top 10 (High School)","Best Education — Nominee (High School)","Best Integrated Human Practices — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Infectious Diseases / Therapeutics / Diagnostics / Oncology)"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（高中組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳整合式人類實踐 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（傳染病 / 治療 / 診斷 / 腫瘤）"],"projectTitle":"ProteaSign","projectTitle_zh":"ProteaSign","tagline":"A point-of-care electrochemical sensor that quantifies individual protease activities in chronic wound exudate in about ten minutes.","tagline_zh":"一款照護現場的電化學感測器，約十分鐘內定量慢性傷口滲出液中各個蛋白酶的活性。","summary":"ProteaSign is a disposable-cartridge electrochemical diagnostic that separately measures MMP-9 (which degrades the extracellular matrix) and human neutrophil elastase (which degrades the growth factors needed for repair) in chronic wound fluid, turning wound assessment from a visual judgement into a measurement. The sensing interface is a gold electrode carrying methylene-blue-labelled, protease-cleavable peptides whose cleavage is read by square-wave voltammetry, with an independently anchored ferrocene reporter providing internal ratiometric normalisation and a matched non-cleavable peptide control on a second working electrode. The peptide sequences were not guessed: the team built a seven-protease machine-learning substrate predictor trained on 10,472 curated cleavage windows, and validated the predictions with two reprogrammable recombinant sfGFP protease biosensors. It won on the rare combination of genuinely publication-grade dry lab (cluster-aware cross-validation, Laplace-transform kinetics derivations, a physics-based SWV forward model), working hardware, and a human practices programme with over twenty named clinical and industrial stakeholders that visibly moved the design.","summary_zh":"ProteaSign 是一款採用一次性匣體的電化學診斷裝置，能分別量測慢性傷口液中的 MMP-9（分解細胞外基質）與人類嗜中性球彈性蛋白酶（分解修復所需的生長因子），把傷口評估從目視判斷變成量測。感測介面是一個金電極，表面帶有以亞甲藍標記、可被蛋白酶切斷的胜肽，其切斷情形以方波伏安法讀取；另有一個獨立固定的二茂鐵報告分子提供內部比率式標準化，並在第二個工作電極上設置配對的不可切斷胜肽對照。胜肽序列不是猜的：團隊建了一個涵蓋七種蛋白酶的機器學習受質預測器，以 10,472 個經整理的切割視窗訓練，並以兩套可重新編程的重組 sfGFP 蛋白酶生物感測器驗證預測結果。它之所以勝出，靠的是一個罕見的組合：真正達到可發表水準的乾實驗（具群集意識的交叉驗證、以拉普拉斯變換推導的動力學、基於物理的 SWV 正向模型）、能運作的硬體，以及一套有二十多位具名臨床與產業利害關係人、且明顯改變了設計的人類實踐計畫。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6462/wiki/f09.avif","caption":"Out-of-fold performance of the consensus score for all seven proteases: ROC curves with per-protease detection AUROC, precision-recall curves against a 0.25 prior, and the distribution of held-out positives' consensus percentiles against the uniform null.","caption_zh":"七種蛋白酶共識分數的折外表現：附每種蛋白酶偵測 AUROC 的 ROC 曲線、對照 0.25 先驗的精確率—召回率曲線，以及保留正樣本的共識百分位相對於均勻虛無分布的分布。","credit":"Team Eton-College-UK, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6463","team":"Yucai-SZ","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/yucai-sz/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"SpotAway: a dry-activatable emergency stain patch","projectTitle_zh":"SpotAway：一款乾式可活化的緊急除污貼片","tagline":"De novo designed pigment binders and a lipase fusion, measured with explicit methodological boundaries on every assay.","tagline_zh":"從頭設計的色素結合蛋白與一個脂解酶融合蛋白，而且每一項分析都附上明確的方法學邊界。","summary":"Yucai-SZ designed SpotAway, a concept for a portable dry patch that treats fresh oil stains where they happen. The functional layer pairs a cellulose-binding-module fusion carrying a de novo designed capsanthin binder, for capturing the hydrophobic pigment in chili oil, with a triolein-binding-domain lipase fusion that anchors near oil droplets and hydrolyses triglycerides, all held in a trehalose-mannitol-protected xerogel that is rehydrated with one or two drops of water. The dry lab extended the standard Foundry de novo design pipeline by layering a docking-based binding-ability pre-test onto structural screening, after wet-lab results showed that structural metrics alone could not rank candidates. What distinguishes the measurement work is that every assay is published with a section defining what it cannot show.","summary_zh":"Yucai-SZ 設計了 SpotAway，一個可攜乾式貼片的概念，用來就地處理剛沾上的油污。功能層由兩部分配對：一個帶有從頭設計辣椒紅素結合蛋白的纖維素結合模組融合蛋白，負責捕捉辣油中的疏水性色素；以及一個帶三油酸甘油酯結合域的脂解酶融合蛋白，會錨定在油滴附近並水解三酸甘油酯；兩者都包在以海藻糖與甘露醇保護的乾凝膠中，滴一兩滴水即可再水合。乾實驗則在標準的 Foundry de novo 設計管線上多加一層——在結構篩選之外再疊上以對接為基礎的結合能力預測試——因為濕實驗結果顯示單憑結構指標無法為候選排序。這份量測工作真正與眾不同之處在於：每一項分析都附上一節，明確定義它不能證明什麼。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6463/wiki/wetlab-oct15/figure-17a5a3588f362703.avif","caption":"Standard curves for the lead binder at 275 nm: a protein quantification curve in petroleum ether (R2 = 0.990) used to account for protein background, and the delta-OD against concentration curve for Binder-2 in the capsanthin system (R2 = 0.993), both declared valid only over 0 to 1.5 mg/mL.","credit":"Team Yucai-SZ, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"主要結合蛋白在 275 nm 的標準曲線：石油醚中的蛋白定量曲線（R2 = 0.990），用於扣除蛋白背景；以及辣椒紅素系統中 Binder-2 的 delta-OD 對濃度曲線（R2 = 0.993）；兩者都聲明僅在 0 至 1.5 mg/mL 區間內有效。"}]},{"id":"6475","team":"BGCFullerton","section":"High School","country":"United States","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/bgcfullerton/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Model — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳模型 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"MycoVela — helping mycorrhizal fungi establish with plants in lunar regolith simulant","projectTitle_zh":"MycoVela——協助菌根真菌在月壤模擬物中與植物建立共生","tagline":"Protect arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi from the oxidative chemistry of lunar regolith so they can form symbiosis with crops off Earth.","tagline_zh":"保護叢枝菌根真菌不受月壤氧化化學的傷害，使其能在地球之外與作物形成共生。","summary":"Lunar regolith generates hydroxyl radicals and stunts plant growth, and arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi (AMF) are the obvious partner to help plants reach nutrients in it — if the spores survive long enough to germinate. MycoVela tests whether pyomelanin, catalase, trehalose and calcium alginate can protect AMF during establishment in regolith simulant. The dry lab is a five-part collection built by a Boys and Girls Club team drawing students from ten schools, and its statistical standard is genuinely graduate-level: a 34-parameter Monte Carlo oxidative-stress simulation, a Fisher-information identifiability and Sobol sensitivity analysis that found exact degeneracies and an unobservable parameter and so changed the model's own equations, a hierarchical Bayesian dose-response model with partial pooling across three laboratories and 400 simulation-based calibration runs, a reproducible image-analysis tool (MycoLens) whose failure cases are published alongside its successes, and a structural screen of KatE catalase surface variants.","summary_zh":"月壤會產生氫氧自由基並抑制植物生長，而叢枝菌根真菌（AMF）是幫助植物在其中取得養分最顯然的夥伴——前提是孢子能活得夠久、撐到發芽。MycoVela 要測試的是：pyomelanin、catalase、trehalose 與海藻酸鈣能否在 AMF 於月壤模擬物中建立初期提供保護。乾實驗是一支 Boys and Girls Club 隊伍（成員來自十所學校）做出的五件套，而其統計水準確實達到研究所層級：一個 34 參數的蒙地卡羅氧化逆境模擬、一套費雪訊息可辨識性分析與 Sobol 敏感度分析（找出了精確退化與一個不可觀測的參數，因而改寫了模型自己的方程式）、一個跨三間實驗室做部分匯聚的階層貝氏劑量反應模型並執行 400 次模擬式校正、一個可重現的影像分析工具（MycoLens，失敗案例與成功案例一併公開），以及一組 KatE 觸酶表面變異體的結構篩選。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6475/wiki/models/models/source-p35-1.avif","caption":"Figure 4.2: sensitivity of each planned measurement to each of the 34 model parameters. Darker cells mean the measurement responds more strongly and is therefore more useful for estimating that parameter — germination tracks the stress and damage parameters, hyphal length the growth parameters, peroxide and superoxide the pigment chemistry, and surface coverage almost nothing.","caption_zh":"圖 4.2：每一項規劃中的量測對 34 個模型參數的敏感度。顏色越深代表該量測反應越強、因此對估計該參數越有用——發芽率追蹤的是逆境與損傷參數、菌絲長度追蹤生長參數、過氧化氫與超氧陰離子追蹤色素化學，而表面覆蓋率幾乎什麼都追蹤不到。","credit":"Team BGCFullerton, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6478","team":"Athens","section":"Overgrad","country":"Greece","village":"Conservation","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/athens/","rank":136,"awards":["Top 10 (Overgrad)","Best Model — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Education — Nominee (Overgrad)","Best Entrepreneurship — Winner (Overgrad)","Best Conservation Project — Winner"],"awards_zh":["Top 10（研究生組）","最佳模型 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳教育 — 入圍（研究生組）","最佳創業 — 得主（研究生組）","最佳保育專案 — 得主"],"projectTitle":"ApiconIASIS","projectTitle_zh":"ApiconIASIS","tagline":"Healing honeybees, sustaining pollinators: a precision phage-derived enzyme therapy for European Foulbrood","tagline_zh":"治癒蜜蜂、維繫授粉者：一種源自噬菌體的精準酵素療法，用於歐洲幼蟲病","summary":"ApiconIASIS targets European Foulbrood (EFB), a statutory honeybee brood disease caused by Melissococcus plutonius for which the only legal response in most of Europe is burning the colony. The team mined 165 M. plutonius genomes for dormant prophages, ranked hundreds of candidate lysins and selected two enzymes (an endolysin and a GH25 muramidase), each built with and without a fused antimicrobial peptide, expressed and purified in E. coli. They showed roughly 40% loss of OD600 against M. plutonius (LMG 20360) with 50 ug/mL purified endolysin while producing no effect distinguishable from the untreated control against the bee-gut commensals Lactobacillus apis and Bombilactobacillus mellis, both Lactobacillales like the pathogen. It won because the whole chain is closed: a protein (not a replicating phage) delivered in brood food, three linked dry-lab models (protein optimisation, larval-gut pharmacokinetics, bioprocess scale-up), and an entrepreneurship case built on the cost of hive burning.","summary_zh":"ApiconIASIS 針對歐洲幼蟲病（EFB），這是一種由 Melissococcus plutonius 造成的法定通報蜂子疾病，而在歐洲大部分地區，唯一合法的處置就是把整個蜂群燒掉。該隊從 165 個 M. plutonius 基因組中挖掘休眠的原噬菌體，對數百個候選溶解酶排序，選出兩個酵素（一個內溶素與一個 GH25 胞壁質酶），每個都做了接上與不接抗菌肽的版本，並在 E. coli 中表現與純化。他們顯示 50 ug/mL 的純化內溶素對 M. plutonius（LMG 20360）可造成約 40% 的 OD600 下降，而對蜂腸共生菌 Lactobacillus apis 與 Bombilactobacillus mellis（兩者與病原同屬 Lactobacillales）則沒有可與未處理對照區分的效果。它之所以出色，是因為整條鏈是閉合的：投遞的是一個蛋白質（不是會複製的噬菌體），透過蜂子食物給予；三個互相銜接的乾實驗模型（蛋白質最佳化、幼蟲腸道藥物動力學、生物製程放大）；以及一份以燒毀蜂箱的成本為基礎建立的創業論述。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6478/wiki/optimization/fig7-pareto.avif","caption":"Pareto front from the NSGA-II search over the 17 mutable positions, trading predicted solubility against thermostability (ddG) for the GH25 muramidase; variants A, B and C were selected along this front.","caption_zh":"NSGA-II 在 17 個可突變位置上搜尋所得的 Pareto 前緣，為 GH25 胞壁質酶權衡預測溶解度與熱穩定性（ddG）；變體 A、B、C 即沿此前緣選出。","credit":"Team Athens, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6479","team":"PSI Korea","section":"High School","country":"South Korea","village":"Biomanufacturing / materials and measurement (Best Village Project nominee; the village is not named on the wiki)","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/psi-korea/","rank":21,"awards":["Best Presentation — Nominee (High School)","Best Wiki — Nominee (High School)","Best Village Project — Nominee (Space / Foundational Advance / Software & AI / Biomanufacturing)"],"awards_zh":["最佳簡報 — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Wiki — 入圍（高中組）","最佳 Village 專案 — 入圍（太空 / 基礎推進 / 軟體與 AI / 生物製造）"],"projectTitle":"Bio Color ID - design and validation of a product authentication system using synthetic biology","projectTitle_zh":"Bio Color ID：以合成生物學打造產品真偽辨識系統的設計與驗證","tagline":"An authentication tag whose identity is the material itself, read as 60 optical features","tagline_zh":"一種以材料本身作為身分的真偽辨識標籤，讀取為 60 項光學特徵","summary":"Bio Color ID is a counterfeit-detection tag made by casting biologically produced indigoid pigments into bacterial PHB, so that the authentication feature is the material's own optical response rather than a printed code that can be copied or transferred. Two pathways were engineered into E. coli - phaCAB for PHB from acetyl-CoA, and a tryptophan-derived halogenated-indigoid route - with the team solving substrate competition between the halogenase and TnaA by deleting chromosomal tnaA by lambda-Red, moving the host to BL21-AI to stop T7 leakage, screening seven TnaA variants for intermediate rather than maximal activity, and screening six halogenases before settling on SttH. Tags are then read by a team-built reader: a camera plus five LEDs over four coloured backgrounds, giving 60 RGB features per tag. The team shows that three independently fabricated tags agree to Pearson r >= 0.9977 (MAE 3.58 DN) while visually indistinguishable tags and watercolour paper imitations separate clearly.","summary_zh":"Bio Color ID 是一種防偽辨識標籤，做法是把生物生產的靛類色素澆鑄進細菌產製的 PHB 中，使辨識特徵成為材料自身的光學反應，而不是一組可被複製或轉貼的印刷碼。團隊在 E. coli 中建構兩條途徑，一條是由 acetyl-CoA 生產 PHB 的 phaCAB，另一條是源自色胺酸的鹵化靛類路線；他們以 lambda-Red 刪除染色體上的 tnaA 來解決鹵化酶與 TnaA 之間的底物競爭，把宿主換成 BL21-AI 以阻止 T7 滲漏，篩選七個 TnaA 變體以取得中等而非最大的活性，並在篩選六個鹵化酶後定案採用 SttH。標籤再由團隊自製的判讀裝置讀取：一台相機加五顆 LED，搭配四種彩色背景，每個標籤可得 60 項 RGB 特徵。團隊顯示三個各自獨立製作的標籤相符至 Pearson r >= 0.9977（MAE 3.58 DN），而肉眼難以區分的標籤與水彩紙仿品則能被清楚分開。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6479/wiki/description/figure-11-reader-assembly.webp","caption":"Assembly of the Bio Color ID Reader: a fixed camera, a hemispherical shell carrying five LEDs (405, 525, 625, 660 nm plus broadband white) and a tag holder over four coloured background panels.","caption_zh":"Bio Color ID Reader 的組裝：固定式相機、一個載有五顆 LED（405、525、625、660 nm 加寬頻白光）的半球形外殼，以及位於四片彩色背景板上方的標籤座。","credit":"Team PSI Korea, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6485","team":"WUXI-DSAS","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/wuxi-dsas/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Sustainable Development Impact — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳永續發展影響 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"ReNovo","projectTitle_zh":"ReNovo","tagline":"A hidden signal in a drop.","tagline_zh":"一滴尿裡藏著的訊號。","summary":"ReNovo is a whole-cell E. coli biosensor for urinary gentisic acid (2,5-dihydroxybenzoic acid), built as a non-invasive early-screening route for renal cell carcinoma (RCC), which is 80-85% of primary kidney malignancies and asymptomatic exactly when it is curable. The team adapted the maleylpyruvate-responsive GtdR/PgtdA system of Cupriavidus necator, deliberately omitting the gtdT transporter from the published circuit to obtain a monotonic, quantifiable dose-response, and used mCherry to dodge urine's green autofluorescence. Because urinary analyte concentration tracks hydration, a parallel colorimetric creatinine assay is run on the same chip and the result is reported as a gentisic acid-to-creatinine ratio in a three-tier risk band. The second-generation sensor PG2 gave a linear response over 0-12 uM (y = 1.094x + 16.8, R2 = 0.9764) with no significant artificial-urine matrix effect and no cross-reactivity to 2-, 3-, 4-HBA or salicyluric acid.","summary_zh":"ReNovo 是一個偵測尿中龍膽酸（2,5-二羥基苯甲酸）的全細胞 E. coli 生物感測器，被設計成腎細胞癌（RCC）非侵入式早期篩檢的途徑；RCC 佔原發性腎臟惡性腫瘤的 80-85%，而且偏偏在還可治癒的階段毫無症狀。團隊改用 Cupriavidus necator 中對順丁烯二醯丙酮酸有反應的 GtdR/PgtdA 系統，並刻意把已發表迴路中的 gtdT 運輸蛋白去掉，以取得單調且可量化的劑量反應關係，同時用 mCherry 避開尿液本身的綠色自體螢光。由於尿中分析物濃度會隨補水狀況變動，同一片晶片上還並行一個比色法肌酸酐分析，結果以龍膽酸對肌酸酐的比值、分三級風險區間回報。第二代感測器 PG2 在 0-12 uM 區間呈線性反應（y = 1.094x + 16.8，R2 = 0.9764），在人工尿液基質中沒有顯著的基質效應，對 2-、3-、4-HBA 或水楊尿酸也沒有交叉反應。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6485/wiki/sustainability-figure-01-concentric-impact-framework.avif","caption":"ReNovo's concentric SDG framework: SDG 3 at the clinical core, SDGs 4/9/12 at the user interface, and SDGs 8/10/17 in the outer ripple, with layer position set by causal distance rather than importance.","caption_zh":"ReNovo 的同心 SDG 框架：SDG 3 位於臨床核心，SDG 4／9／12 位於使用者介面層，SDG 8／10／17 位於外圈漣漪，各層位置依因果距離而非重要性決定。","credit":"Team WUXI-DSAS, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6497","team":"Worldshaper-Shanghai","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Entrepreneurship — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳創業 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"SweetCycle","projectTitle_zh":"SweetCycle","tagline":"Don't sell the molecule, sell the step that makes it cheap to separate: engineered glycosyltransferases licensed into existing Reb A refineries","tagline_zh":"不賣分子，賣讓分離變便宜的那一步：把工程化的糖基轉移酶授權給既有的 Reb A 精煉廠","summary":"Worldshaper-Shanghai engineered the two glycosyltransferases that perform the final steps to Rebaudioside M (SrUGT76G1 and SrUGT91D2), screened eight designed variants in a contained Stevia hairy-root chassis with qPCR and HPLC read-out, and found that T284I raised Reb M to 21.96 micrograms per gram fresh weight against 15.44 for wild type while the SrUGT91D2 variants did nothing. The commercial insight is genuinely original: Reb M is expensive not because the pathway is hard but because it sits at about 2 percent of a pool of near-identical glycosides, so the only lever that matters is raising that fraction (eta), and the party who benefits is whoever owns the separation column. They therefore sell a licensed process asset to Reb A refiners rather than a product, backed by a published, recomputable techno-economic model that ranks three production routes and finds their own current enzyme performance gives a negative NPV in every scenario. They were nominated for Best Entrepreneurship in the High School section.","summary_zh":"Worldshaper-Shanghai 改造了負責 Rebaudioside M 最後幾步反應的兩個糖基轉移酶（SrUGT76G1 與 SrUGT91D2），在受圍堵的甜菊毛狀根載體中篩選八個設計變異體，以 qPCR 與 HPLC 讀值判定，結果發現 T284I 把 Reb M 提升到每公克鮮重 21.96 微克，而野生型為 15.44；SrUGT91D2 的變異體則毫無作用。商業洞見確實原創：Reb M 之所以昂貴，不是因為路徑困難，而是因為它只占一池幾乎無法區分的糖苷中的約 2%，因此唯一真正有用的槓桿是提高這個比例（eta），而受益者是擁有分離管柱的那一方。於是他們把授權式的製程資產賣給 Reb A 精煉商，而不是賣產品，並以一份公開、可重新計算的技術經濟模型為支撐——該模型對三條生產路線排序，並發現以他們目前的酵素效能，在每一種情境下的 NPV 都是負的。他們獲得高中組 Best Entrepreneurship 提名。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6497/wiki/worldshaper-shanghai/entrepreneurship/image3.webp","caption":"Positioning map of cost per sucrose-sweetness equivalent on a log scale, showing sucralose at 0.33 RMB/SSE as the ceiling over the whole natural-sweetener category","credit":"Team Worldshaper-Shanghai, iGEM 2026 wiki","caption_zh":"以對數尺度呈現的每單位蔗糖甜度當量成本定位圖，顯示 0.33 RMB/SSE 的三氯蔗糖構成整個天然甜味劑類別的天花板"}]},{"id":"6511","team":"Labi-Taiwan","section":"High School","country":"Taiwan","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/labi-taiwan/","rank":33,"awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (High School)","iGEMers Prize — Winner (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（高中組）","iGEMers 票選獎 — 得主（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"BlueCatcher: a cell-free electrochemical biosensor for MDD-associated circulating microRNAs","tagline":"A multistep biosensor validated stage by stage, from three-way-junction target recognition to a calibrated square-wave voltammetry readout.","summary":"Labi-Taiwan built BlueCatcher, a portable cell-free electrochemical biosensor for circulating microRNAs associated with major depressive disorder, intended as objective biological evidence alongside clinical assessment rather than as a diagnosis. The signal chain is deliberately long: a three-way junction recognises the target miRNA and releases a trigger strand, the trigger activates a toehold switch that expresses a nuclease, the nuclease cleaves a methylene-blue-labelled DNA reporter, and the released reporter is captured on a gold-modified screen-printed carbon electrode and quantified by square-wave voltammetry. Because a final signal alone cannot show that every step behaved, the team built a stepwise measurement framework in which each stage is independently validated before integration, with the degree of calibration deliberately matched to each measurement's role. The project also carries a machine-learning design suite and a strong education programme grounded in its own 432-respondent survey; it won the iGEMers Prize in the High School section.","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6511/wiki/wet-lab/measurement/v2/figure-23.avif","caption":"Square-wave voltammetry quantification of the methylene-blue reporter on functionalised Au@SPCEs across 0 to 500 nM. The inset shows the approximately linear relationship between peak current and log concentration (R2 = 0.9457), from which a blank-derived limit of detection of 7.53 nM is calculated.","credit":"Team Labi-Taiwan, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6520","team":"Al-Nahrain-IRAQ","section":"Undergrad","country":"Iraq","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/al-nahrain-iraq/","rank":26,"awards":["iGEM Spirit Award — Winner (Undergrad & Overgrad)"],"awards_zh":["iGEM 精神獎 — 得主（大學暨研究生組）"],"projectTitle":"SYNOVA","projectTitle_zh":"SYNOVA","tagline":"The first Iraqi iGEM team: a software platform and home-built bioreactor for turning date-palm waste into bioethanol, built under hard local constraints","tagline_zh":"伊拉克第一支 iGEM 團隊：一個軟體平台與一台自製生物反應器，在嚴苛的在地限制下把椰棗廢料變成生物乙醇","summary":"Al-Nahrain-IRAQ is the first Iraqi team ever to compete in iGEM, from Al-Nahrain University, with a team drawn from Biotechnology, AI & Robotics Engineering, Civil Engineering and Business Economics. SYNOVA tackles yeast fermentation of date-palm waste into bioethanol, with a software platform of four apps whose governing rule is that a prediction must never be presented as a measurement, so predicted, published-measured and your-own-lab-measured results are kept separate and never combined into one number. The project is defined as much by what Iraq lacks: no local S. cerevisiae collection to borrow, no liquid ethanol sensor purchasable anywhere in Iraq or neighbouring countries at a reasonable price or wait, no local gene bank because of national restrictions, and RT-qPCR primers that took months and arrived only on 19 October. They built the sensor themselves, isolated four candidate wild yeasts from local sourdough, pomegranate vinegar, date vinegar and an overripe date from Najaf, and set an explicit goal of leaving behind protocols, tools and trained people that the next Iraqi team can start from.","summary_zh":"Al-Nahrain-IRAQ 來自 Al-Nahrain University，是史上第一支參加 iGEM 的伊拉克團隊，成員來自生物技術、AI 與機器人工程、土木工程與商業經濟。SYNOVA 處理的是用酵母把椰棗廢料發酵成生物乙醇，軟體平台由四個應用程式組成，其統御規則是：預測永遠不能被當成量測呈現，因此預測值、已發表的量測值與你自己實驗室的量測值被分開保存，絕不合併成同一個數字。這個專案同樣被「伊拉克缺什麼」所定義：沒有可借用的本地 S. cerevisiae 菌種庫、在伊拉克或鄰國都買不到價格與等待時間合理的液相乙醇感測器、因國家限制而沒有本地基因庫，以及等了好幾個月、直到 10 月 19 日才到貨的 RT-qPCR 引子。他們自己做了感測器，從在地酸麵團、石榴醋、椰棗醋與一顆來自 Najaf 的過熟椰棗中分離出四株候選野生酵母，並明確立下目標：留下協議、工具與受過訓練的人，讓下一支伊拉克團隊可以從那裡起跑。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6520/wiki/hp-education/banana-dna-interactive-learning-01.avif","caption":"Banana DNA extraction with schoolchildren at Ajyal Al-Amal and Sarh Baghdad schools","caption_zh":"在 Ajyal Al-Amal 與 Sarh Baghdad 兩所學校與小學生一起做香蕉 DNA 萃取","credit":"Team Al-Nahrain-IRAQ, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]},{"id":"6523","team":"NIS Almaty-Medeu","section":"High School","country":"Kazakhstan","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/nis-almaty-medeu/","rank":7,"awards":["Inclusivity Award — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["包容性獎 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"MiRVOX (Pulmora and OncoNose)","projectTitle_zh":"MiRVOX（Pulmora 與 OncoNose）","tagline":"Two approaches to accessible lung cancer screening: programmable RNA detection of blood microRNAs, and exploratory breath volatile organic compound patterns","tagline_zh":"兩條通往可負擔肺癌篩檢的路徑：對血液 microRNA 的可程式化 RNA 偵測，以及呼氣揮發性有機化合物模式的探索性研究","summary":"NIS Almaty-Medeu built MiRVOX, two parallel platforms for accessible lung cancer research: Pulmora, a synthetic biology platform for programmable detection of circulating microRNAs in blood, and OncoNose, an exploratory engineering project on volatile organic compound patterns in exhaled breath. The team states plainly on its landing page that neither platform is a clinically validated diagnostic test. The project is framed by hard numbers - 2.5 million lung cancer diagnoses and 1.8 million deaths worldwide in 2022, 12.4% of new cancers and 18.7% of cancer deaths, and 4,429 estimated new cases in Kazakhstan where it is the second most diagnosed cancer and the most common cancer in men. Their education and inclusivity work is extraordinarily large for a high-school team and is written with unusual methodological honesty, including a published disagreement between two of their own documents' participant counts.","summary_zh":"NIS Almaty-Medeu 打造了 MiRVOX，兩個並行的平台，目標是讓肺癌研究更易於觸及：Pulmora 是一個合成生物學平台，用於可程式化地偵測血液中的循環 microRNA；OncoNose 則是一個探索性的工程專案，研究呼出氣體中揮發性有機化合物的模式。團隊在首頁就明白表示，這兩個平台都不是經臨床驗證的診斷檢測。整個專案以具體數字定調：2022 年全球有 250 萬人被診斷為肺癌、180 萬人死亡，佔新增癌症的 12.4% 與癌症死亡的 18.7%；而在哈薩克估計有 4,429 例新病例，肺癌在當地是第二常被診斷的癌症，也是男性最常見的癌症。他們的教育與包容性工作對一支高中團隊而言規模大得驚人，而且在方法學上誠實得不尋常，甚至公開了自家兩份文件之間參與人數不一致的問題。"},{"id":"6529","team":"CHINAGuangdongShimen","section":"High School","country":"China","wiki":"https://2026.igem.wiki/chinaguangdongshimen/","rank":7,"awards":["Best Measurement — Nominee (High School)"],"awards_zh":["最佳量測 — 入圍（高中組）"],"projectTitle":"Re-CDI Alert: an engineered EcN platform for monitoring and treating recurrent Clostridioides difficile infection","projectTitle_zh":"Re-CDI Alert：用於監測與治療復發性 Clostridioides difficile 感染的工程化 EcN 平台","tagline":"A p-cresol-sensing probiotic biosensor, characterised with a measurement protocol written so that other teams can repeat it.","tagline_zh":"一個偵測 p-cresol 的益生菌生物感測器，其特性分析搭配一份寫成可供其他隊伍重複執行的量測規程。","summary":"Shimen built an Escherichia coli Nissle 1917 (EcN) biosensor that detects p-cresol, the metabolite Clostridioides difficile produces to suppress competing gut microbes and secure its own niche, and couples detection to a therapeutic output targeting the TcdB toxin. Because recurrence after CDI treatment is diagnosed only once symptoms return, the aim is to shift from symptom-triggered diagnosis toward proactive risk sensing during the post-treatment window. The dry-lab contribution is the measurement protocol itself: a documented, reusable workflow for characterising a small-molecule biosensor, covering plate layout, normalisation, chassis comparison, tolerance limits, dose response and specificity against structural analogues.","summary_zh":"Shimen 建了一個 Escherichia coli Nissle 1917（EcN）生物感測器，偵測 p-cresol——那是 Clostridioides difficile 用來壓制競爭的腸道微生物、為自己保住生態棲位的代謝物——並把偵測結果耦合到針對 TcdB 毒素的治療性輸出。由於 CDI 治療後的復發要等症狀再出現才會被診斷出來，他們的目標是從症狀觸發的診斷，轉向在治療後窗口期主動感測風險。乾實驗的貢獻就是那份量測規程本身：一套有完整文件、可重複使用的小分子生物感測器特性分析流程，涵蓋盤面配置、標準化、底盤比較、耐受上限、劑量反應，以及對結構類似物的專一性。","images":[{"url":"https://static.igem.wiki/teams/6529/wiki/public/measurement/measurement-figure-01.webp","caption":"Measurement figure from the Re-CDI Alert characterisation workflow, which reads GFP fluorescence at 485 nm excitation and 528 nm emission alongside OD600 so that every value can be normalised per unit biomass.","caption_zh":"Re-CDI Alert 特性分析流程中的量測圖；該流程在激發 485 nm、發射 528 nm 下讀取 GFP 螢光，並同時讀取 OD600，使每個數值都能依單位生物量標準化。","credit":"Team CHINAGuangdongShimen, iGEM 2026 wiki"}]}];
